window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["df14"]={"id": "df14", "title": "DDPM：离散马尔可夫链与高斯后验", "focus": "从离散马尔可夫链推导 DDPM 的前向闭式、后验闭式与训练目标；说明它作为 VP-SDE 离散化的极限关系。", "claims": ["q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)", "q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\\tilde\\beta_tI\\right)", "\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\left\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\right\\|^2"], "topics": ["前向马尔可夫链", "闭式转移", "后验分布", "训练目标", "采样过程", "方差选择", "与连续 SDE 的对应", "离散时间步", "数值稳定性", "反例：T 过小导致不可逆", "条件后验的推导", "与 DDIM 的接口", "代码：DDPM 训练与采样", "代码：后验闭式的验证", "与 DDIM 章的接口", "本章推导链：离散扩散的闭式"], "html": "<h3 id=\"df14--h-前向马尔可夫链\">前向马尔可夫链<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-前向马尔可夫链\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节固定如下符号，后续各节沿用，不再重复定义。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>；样本空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\mathbb R^d$</span>，配 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 与 Lebesgue 测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_d$</span>。</li>\n<li>离散时间指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{0,1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge 1$</span>。指标递增方向为“加噪方向”。</li>\n<li>前向链状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q_0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率测度，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_0}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li>噪声调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1,\\dots,\\beta_T\\in(0,1)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t:=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0:=1$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减。</li>\n<li>标准高斯白噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t\\overset{\\text{i.i.d.}}{\\sim}\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$I_d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 单位阵。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\Sigma)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的非退化高斯测度，密度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_d$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(2\\pi)^{-d/2}(\\det\\Sigma)^{-1/2}\\exp\\{-\\tfrac12(x-\\mu)^\\top\\Sigma^{-1}(x-\\mu)\\}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心定义是前向马尔可夫链的转移核族。它与“单步加噪”这一直觉操作的区别在于：转移核是定义在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)$</span> 上的可测函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t(\\cdot\\mid\\cdot)$</span>，必须满足核的正则性与 Markov 性，才能保证联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})$</span> 的存在性与后续闭式的可积性。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 1.1（前向链的正则性）</strong></p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 为概率测度且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|x\\|^2\\,q_0(dx)&lt;\\infty$</span>；\n(ii) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,A)\\mapsto K_t(A\\mid x)$</span> 满足：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t(\\cdot\\mid x)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率测度；对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto K_t(A\\mid x)$</span> 为 Borel 可测；\n(iii) 每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t(\\cdot\\mid x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_d$</span> 绝对连续，其密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(y\\mid x)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 联合 Borel 可测。</p>\n<p>假设 1.1(ii) 是测度论意义下的核（kernel）条件，保证 Ionescu-Tulcea 定理可用，从而联合分布存在；1.1(iii) 保证条件密度与 Bayes 公式在后续节中可逐点书写。这两条在本节情境下自动成立，因为我们将取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t$</span> 为高斯核，其密度显式可写且连续。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-1-前向链的定义与联合测度\">1. 前向链的定义与联合测度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-1-前向链的定义与联合测度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1.2（前向马尔可夫链）</strong></p>\n<p>给定假设 1.1，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d(T+1)}$</span> 上的概率测度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{0:T}):=q_0(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}p_t(x_t\\mid x_{t-1}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(y\\mid x)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t(\\cdot\\mid x)$</span> 的密度。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为前向马尔可夫链的联合分布，其边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x_t):=\\int q(x_{0:t-1},x_t)\\,d\\lambda_{dt}$</span> 称为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步边际。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.3（核的 Markov 性与边际递推）</strong></p>\n<p>在假设 1.1 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 与任意有界 Borel 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[f(x_t)\\mid x_{0:t-1}]=\\int f(y)\\,p_t(y\\mid x_{t-1})\\,dy,$$</div>\n<p>且边际满足递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(y)=\\int p_t(y\\mid x)\\,q_{t-1}(x)\\,dx$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定义 1.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的条件密度在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0:t-1}$</span> 时只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 依赖，因为乘积中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 仅出现在因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 内。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界，Fubini 定理适用（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为概率测度、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界），故条件期望等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f(y)p_t(y\\mid x_{t-1})dy$</span>。边际递推由对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0:t-1}$</span> 积分并再次用 Fubini 得到。∎</p>\n<p>命题 1.3 表明：前向链的“记忆”仅一步，这正是 Markov 性的测度论表述；它与“独立加噪”不同，后者会破坏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的依赖结构，从而使后验闭式不再成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-2-单步转移核的显式形式\">2. 单步转移核的显式形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-2-单步转移核的显式形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节只承诺定义前向链并给出单步核；闭式多步转移（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>）留待下一节“闭式转移”证明。为使定义可计算，我们取如下高斯核。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1.4（VP 型高斯转移核）</strong></p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_t(y\\mid x):=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(y;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x,\\ \\beta_t I_d\\right),$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,\\varepsilon_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.5（单步核的矩与可积性）</strong></p>\n<p>在定义 1.4 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_t\\mid x_{t-1}=x]=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x,\\qquad \\operatorname{Cov}(x_t\\mid x_{t-1}=x)=\\beta_t I_d,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_t}\\|x_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\varepsilon_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 的标准高斯性，条件期望与协方差直接由线性变换得到。平方可积性：由命题 1.3 的递推与 Jensen 不等式，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q_t}\\|x_t\\|^2=\\mathbb E_{q_{t-1}}\\big[\\alpha_t\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2+\\beta_t d\\big]\\le \\alpha_t\\,\\mathbb E_{q_{t-1}}\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2+\\beta_t d.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_0}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_t}\\|x_t\\|^2\\le \\mathbb E_{q_0}\\|x_0\\|^2+d\\sum_{s=1}^{t}\\beta_s&lt;\\infty$</span>。∎</p>\n<p>命题 1.5 的平方可积性是后续节中得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 存在的必要条件之一；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2=\\infty$</span>，则高斯后验的指数项不再可积，闭式将失效。这一边界情形在反例节集中处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-3-与相邻概念的区别-前向链-vs-独立加噪-vs-连续-SDE\">3. 与相邻概念的区别：前向链 vs. 独立加噪 vs. 连续 SDE<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-3-与相邻概念的区别-前向链-vs-独立加噪-vs-连续-SDE\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前向链的定义 1.2 与以下两个对象必须区分，否则后续推导会出现符号混淆。</p>\n<p><strong>(a) 独立加噪。</strong> 若令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 相互独立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 不构成 Markov 链（给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 仍依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>）。定义 1.4 的单步核则保证 Markov 性；两者边际相同（下一节证明），但联合分布不同。这一区别在条件后验推导（第 11 节）中至关重要。</p>\n<p><strong>(b) 连续时间 SDE。</strong> 第 7 节将证明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=O(1/T)$</span> 时，前向链的边际收敛到 VP-SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$dx=-\\tfrac12\\beta(t)x\\,dt+\\sqrt{\\beta(t)}\\,dW_t$$</div>\n<p>的解的边际。本节不展开该极限，只声明前向链是离散时间对象，其转移核为高斯，而 SDE 的转移密度为热核型；二者通过时间步长联系，不可直接等同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-4-一个可检验的恒等式-单步核的归一化与特征函数\">4. 一个可检验的恒等式：单步核的归一化与特征函数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-4-一个可检验的恒等式-单步核的归一化与特征函数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1.6（核的归一化与特征函数）</strong></p>\n<p>在定义 1.4 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}p_t(y\\mid x)\\,dy=1,\\qquad \\int_{\\mathbb R^d}e^{i\\langle\\xi,y\\rangle}p_t(y\\mid x)\\,dy=\\exp\\!\\Big(i\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\langle\\xi,x\\rangle-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\|\\xi\\|^2\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一式由高斯密度的标准归一化得到。第二式：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E e^{i\\langle\\xi,y\\rangle}=e^{i\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\langle\\xi,x\\rangle}\\,\\mathbb E e^{i\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\langle\\xi,z\\rangle}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的标准高斯性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E e^{i\\langle\\eta,z\\rangle}=e^{-\\|\\eta\\|^2/2}$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\xi$</span> 即得。∎</p>\n<p>命题 1.6 是可检验的：它给出单步核的解析特征函数，可用于数值验证（见下方代码）。该恒等式也是下一节“闭式转移”中卷积证明的起点——多步转移的特征函数为单步特征函数的乘积。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-5-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的显式计算\">5. 具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-5-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>。</p>\n<p>由定义 1.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1\\mid x_0=1\\sim\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.9},\\,0.1)$</span>，即均值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.9487$</span>、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>。再由命题 1.3 的递推，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2$</span> 的边际为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_2(y)=\\int \\mathcal N\\!\\left(y;\\sqrt{0.8}\\,x_1,0.2\\right)\\mathcal N\\!\\left(x_1;\\sqrt{0.9},0.1\\right)dx_1.$$</div>\n<p>由高斯卷积封闭性（下一节将一般性证明），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_2=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.8\\cdot 0.9},\\,0.8\\cdot 0.1+0.2)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.72},\\,0.28)$</span>。这与 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_2}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_2)I)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span> 时一致：均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.72}\\approx 0.8485$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-0.72=0.28$</span>。此例说明单步核的复合确实产生闭式边际，且方差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 累积。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-代码-单步核与特征函数的数值验证\">6. 代码：单步核与特征函数的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-代码-单步核与特征函数的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 1.5 与 1.6，并检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span> 例子的边际矩。代码可运行，含 assert 与形状打印。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\nd = 4\nT = 3\nbetas = np.array([0.1, 0.2, 0.3])\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nabar = np.cumprod(alphas)\nassert abar.shape == (T,)\nassert np.all(abar &gt; 0) and np.all(abar &lt; 1)\n\n# 命题 1.5：单步核的矩\nx = rng.normal(size=d)\nt = 0\nmean_expected = np.sqrt(alphas[t]) * x\nz = rng.normal(size=(200000, d))\nsamples = np.sqrt(alphas[t]) * x + np.sqrt(betas[t]) * z\nassert samples.shape == (200000, d)\nmean_emp = samples.mean(axis=0)\ncov_emp = np.cov(samples, rowvar=False)\nassert np.allclose(mean_emp, mean_expected, atol=0.02)\nassert np.allclose(cov_emp, betas[t] * np.eye(d), atol=0.02)\nprint(&quot;single-step mean shape:&quot;, mean_emp.shape)\nprint(&quot;single-step cov shape:&quot;, cov_emp.shape)\n\n# 命题 1.6：特征函数在 xi 处的数值验证\nxi = rng.normal(size=d)\nemp_cf = np.mean(np.exp(1j * samples @ xi))\nexact_cf = np.exp(1j * np.sqrt(alphas[t]) * (xi @ x) - 0.5 * betas[t] * (xi @ xi))\nassert abs(emp_cf - exact_cf) &lt; 0.02\nprint(&quot;characteristic function check passed:&quot;, np.round(abs(emp_cf - exact_cf), 4))\n\n# d=1, T=2 例子的边际矩\nx0 = np.array([1.0])\nb1, b2 = 0.1, 0.2\na1, a2 = 1 - b1, 1 - b2\nabar2 = a1 * a2\nz1 = rng.normal(size=(200000, 1))\nx1 = np.sqrt(a1) * x0 + np.sqrt(b1) * z1\nz2 = rng.normal(size=(200000, 1))\nx2 = np.sqrt(a2) * x1 + np.sqrt(b2) * z2\nassert x2.shape == (200000, 1)\nassert abs(x2.mean() - np.sqrt(abar2) * x0[0]) &lt; 0.02\nassert abs(x2.var() - (1 - abar2)) &lt; 0.02\nprint(&quot;marginal mean/var check:&quot;, round(float(x2.mean()), 4), round(float(x2.var()), 4))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果应打印各形状并全部通过 assert；特征函数误差与边际矩误差均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.02$</span> 以内，与命题 1.6 及例子一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-7-前向链的-Markov-半群与转移算子的复合\">7. 前向链的 Markov 半群与转移算子的复合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-7-前向链的-Markov-半群与转移算子的复合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1.3 只给出了单步条件期望。要把前向链当作一个离散时间的动力学对象来处理，需要引入转移算子并证明其复合律。这一复合律是下一节“闭式转移”中高斯卷积封闭性的算子层面对应物。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1.7（转移算子）</strong></p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，定义线性算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 作用于有界 Borel 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(P_t f)(x):=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}f(y)\\,p_t(y\\mid x)\\,dy,\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R^d.$$</div>\n<p>对 Borel 概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>，定义其对偶作用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu P_t$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的测度，其在 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 上的值为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mu P_t)(A):=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}K_t(A\\mid x)\\,\\mu(dx).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 1.8（半群复合律）</strong></p>\n<p>在假设 1.1 与定义 1.4 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>、任意有界 Borel 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_{s+1}P_{s+2}\\cdots P_t f=P_{s,t}f,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}$</span> 是由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的复合核诱导的算子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s,t}f(x)=\\int f(y)\\,p_{s,t}(y\\mid x)\\,dy$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{s,t}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mid x_s$</span> 的条件密度。对测度有相应的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mu P_{s+1}\\cdots P_t)(A)=(\\mu P_{s,t})(A)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 只需证两步复合，再归纳。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t-1$</span>，对任意有界 Borel <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(P_{s+1}P_{s+2}f)(x)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\Big(\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}f(z)p_{s+2}(z\\mid y)dz\\Big)p_{s+1}(y\\mid x)dy.$$</div>\n<p>被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(y,z)$</span> 联合可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界，故 Fubini 定理适用（乘积测度有限），可交换积分次序：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}f(z)\\Big(\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}p_{s+2}(z\\mid y)p_{s+1}(y\\mid x)dy\\Big)dz.$$</div>\n<p>括号内正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{s+2}\\mid x_s=x$</span> 的条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{s,s+2}(z\\mid x)$</span>（由命题 1.3 的边际递推，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s=x$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{s+2}$</span> 的分布为两步核的复合）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s+1}P_{s+2}f=P_{s,s+2}f$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-s&gt;2$</span> 用归纳假设与同样的 Fubini 论证即得。测度版本由对偶性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int f\\,d(\\mu P_t)=\\int (P_t f)\\,d\\mu$</span> 与算子复合律得到。∎</p>\n<p>命题 1.8 的意义在于：它把“前向链的边际递推”提升为算子代数陈述。特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=q_0P_{1}\\cdots P_{t}$</span>，这与命题 1.3 的递推一致。半群律的成立依赖 Fubini 定理，而 Fubini 的条件（有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>、概率测度）在本节情境下自动满足；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 无界（例如后续节中的得分函数），则需额外假设可积性，这一点在第 9 节数值稳定性中讨论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-8-前向链的鞅性质与二次变差\">8. 前向链的鞅性质与二次变差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-8-前向链的鞅性质与二次变差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前向链不仅是 Markov 的，还具有一个在离散时间下精确成立的鞅结构。这一结构在第 7 节与连续 SDE 对应时给出离散—连续的桥梁，本节先把它作为前向链的内在性质陈述并证明。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.9（离散鞅与二次变差）</strong></p>\n<p>在定义 1.4 下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_t:=\\sigma(x_0,\\dots,x_t)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_t:=\\frac{x_t}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad t=0,1,\\dots,T,$$</div>\n<p>关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal F_t)_{t=0}^T$</span> 是鞅，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[M_t\\mid\\mathcal F_{t-1}]=M_{t-1}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 成立。此外，条件二次变差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\|M_t-M_{t-1}\\|^2\\mid\\mathcal F_{t-1}\\big]=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定义 1.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\varepsilon_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t-1}$</span> 独立且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\varepsilon_t=0$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_t\\mid\\mathcal F_{t-1}]=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}.$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[M_t\\mid\\mathcal F_{t-1}]=x_{t-1}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=M_{t-1}$</span>。二次变差：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_{t-1}$</span> 独立、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(\\varepsilon_t)=I_d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\|M_t-M_{t-1}\\|^2\\mid\\mathcal F_{t-1}\\big]=\\mathbb E\\Big[\\Big\\|\\frac{\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\varepsilon_t}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big\\|^2\\Big]=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon_t\\|^2=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\bar\\alpha_t}d.$$</div>\n<p>若按每坐标计，则每坐标的二次变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>；上式按向量范数平方给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 倍。∎</p>\n<p>命题 1.9 是精确的离散恒等式，不依赖任何极限。它说明：归一化状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 在离散时间下是鞅，其“噪声注入率”为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=O(1/T)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 1$</span> 时，该率趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/T)$</span>，与 VP-SDE 的扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)$</span> 在时间步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 下的量级一致；这正是第 7 节极限论证的离散侧输入。注意此处不得把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 的鞅性与反向 SDE 漂移混为一谈：前者是前向链的性质，后者是第 5 节采样过程的对象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-9-前向链的绝对连续性与密度演化方程\">9. 前向链的绝对连续性与密度演化方程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-9-前向链的绝对连续性与密度演化方程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后续节需要条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的显式表达，其推导依赖前向边际关于 Lebesgue 测度的绝对连续性。本节给出该性质及其密度所满足的离散演化方程。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.10（边际的绝对连续性与密度递推）</strong></p>\n<p>在假设 1.1 与定义 1.4 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t\\ll\\lambda_d$</span>，且其密度（仍记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>）满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t(y)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\mathcal N\\!\\left(y;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x,\\beta_t I_d\\right)q_{t-1}(x)\\,dx,\\qquad \\lambda_d\\text{-a.e. }y.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时由假设 1.1(i) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 的给定绝对连续性（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 仅为一般概率测度，则本节情境下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0\\ll\\lambda_d$</span> 为其密度的存在条件；这是后续所有得分公式的前提，故列入假设）。归纳步：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t-1}\\ll\\lambda_d$</span>。对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_d(A)=0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t(A)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}K_t(A\\mid x)\\,q_{t-1}(dx).$$</div>\n<p>由假设 1.1(iii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t(\\cdot\\mid x)\\ll\\lambda_d$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_t(A\\mid x)=0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(A)=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t\\ll\\lambda_d$</span>。密度递推由命题 1.3 的边际递推与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的显式密度代入得到；等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_d$</span>-a.e. 意义下成立，因为两边的差异集为零测集。∎</p>\n<p>命题 1.10 的密度递推是一个线性积分方程，其核为高斯。它将在第 2 节被显式求解，得到 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>。本节只确立绝对连续性这一前提；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 含原子（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0=\\delta_{x_0}$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0\\not\\ll\\lambda_d$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>）仍绝对连续，因为高斯核把原子“抹平”。这一情形在条件后验推导（第 11 节）中以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的形式出现，故不构成障碍；但在第 9 节数值稳定性中，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 的支撑退化，得分函数的估计会出现奇异性，需单独处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-10-前向链的-Fokker-Planck-型离散方程\">10. 前向链的 Fokker–Planck 型离散方程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-10-前向链的-Fokker-Planck-型离散方程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1.10 的密度递推可写成算子形式，并与连续 Fokker–Planck 方程对照。这一对照是第 7 节 SDE 对应的预备，本节只给出离散侧的精确陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1.11（离散 Fokker–Planck 方程）</strong></p>\n<p>在命题 1.10 的条件下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 与任意紧支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\varphi(y)\\,q_t(y)\\,dy=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\big(P_t\\varphi\\big)(x)\\,q_{t-1}(x)\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>若进一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t-1}\\in C^2$</span> 且具有足够衰减，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi\\in C_c^\\infty$</span> 有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int \\varphi(y)q_t(y)dy=\\int \\varphi(x)q_{t-1}(x)dx+\\int \\big[\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}-1\\big]\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(x),x\\rangle q_{t-1}(x)dx+\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\int \\Delta\\varphi(x)\\,q_{t-1}(x)dx+O(\\beta_t^{3/2}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\beta_t^{3/2})$</span> 项来自高斯核的三阶矩，且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 时相对前两项可忽略。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一式由定义 1.7 的对偶性与命题 1.10 的密度递推直接得到。第二式：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t\\varphi(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 处作 Taylor 展开至二阶。由定义 1.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_t\\varphi(x)=\\mathbb E\\big[\\varphi(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}z)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta x=(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}-1)x$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta z=\\sqrt{\\beta_t}z$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi(x+\\delta x+\\delta z)=\\varphi(x)+\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(x),\\delta x+\\delta z\\rangle+\\tfrac12(\\delta x+\\delta z)^\\top\\nabla^2\\varphi(x)(\\delta x+\\delta z)+R_3,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$R_3$</span> 为三阶余项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|R_3|\\le C\\|\\delta x+\\delta z\\|^3$</span>。取期望：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\delta z=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\delta z\\delta z^\\top]=\\beta_t I_d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\delta z\\|^3=O(\\beta_t^{3/2})$</span>（高斯三阶矩）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta x$</span> 为确定性量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\delta x\\|=O(\\beta_t)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}-1=-\\beta_t/2+O(\\beta_t^2)$</span>）。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_t\\varphi(x)=\\varphi(x)+\\langle\\nabla\\varphi(x),\\delta x\\rangle+\\tfrac12\\operatorname{tr}\\big(\\nabla^2\\varphi(x)\\cdot\\beta_t I_d\\big)+O(\\beta_t^{3/2}).$$</div>\n<p>代入第一式并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t-1}$</span> 积分，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta x=(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}-1)x$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{tr}(\\beta_t\\nabla^2\\varphi)=\\beta_t\\Delta\\varphi$</span>，即得第二式。∎</p>\n<p>推论 1.11 的第二式是连续 Fokker–Planck 方程</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\partial_t q=\\nabla\\cdot\\big(\\tfrac12\\beta(t)x\\,q\\big)+\\tfrac12\\beta(t)\\Delta q$$</div>\n<p>在时间步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1/T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta(t/T)/T$</span> 下的显式 Euler 型离散化：漂移项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}-1\\approx-\\beta_t/2$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\beta(t)x$</span>，扩散项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/2$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\beta(t)$</span>。这一对照在第 7 节被严格化为极限定理；本节只声明离散方程与连续方程的系数匹配，不展开极限证明。注意此处不得把漂移项与概率流 ODE 的速度混为一谈：前者是前向链的密度演化，后者是第 5 节采样过程的反向动力学。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-11-前向链的得分恒等式\">11. 前向链的得分恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-11-前向链的得分恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后续训练目标（第 4 节）与采样（第 5 节）都依赖前向边际的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span>。本节给出一个精确的得分恒等式，它把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t$</span> 与条件期望联系起来，是 Tweedie 型公式的离散版本。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.12（前向得分的条件期望表示）</strong></p>\n<p>在命题 1.10 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t\\in C^1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla q_t\\|\\,d\\lambda_d&lt;\\infty$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_d$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q_t(y)=\\frac{1}{\\beta_t}\\mathbb E\\big[\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}-y\\mid x_t=y\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中条件期望按后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t=y)$</span> 取。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由命题 1.10 的密度递推，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_t(y)=\\int \\mathcal N\\!\\left(y;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x,\\beta_t I_d\\right)q_{t-1}(x)\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 求梯度，被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 可微且其梯度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_y\\mathcal N\\!\\left(y;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x,\\beta_t I_d\\right)=-\\frac{y-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x}{\\beta_t}\\mathcal N\\!\\left(y;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x,\\beta_t I_d\\right).$$</div>\n<p>需验证求导与积分可交换：由 Leibniz 积分法则，只需被积函数的梯度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 可积且被一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y$</span> 无关的可积函数控制。高斯密度的梯度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big\\|\\nabla_y\\mathcal N\\!\\left(y;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x,\\beta_t I_d\\right)\\Big\\|\\le C_{\\beta_t}\\big(1+\\|y\\|+\\|x\\|\\big)\\mathcal N\\!\\left(y;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x,\\beta_t I_d\\right),$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int(1+\\|x\\|)q_{t-1}(x)dx&lt;\\infty$</span>（由命题 1.5 的平方可积性），故控制函数可积，Leibniz 法则适用。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla q_t(y)=\\int -\\frac{y-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x}{\\beta_t}\\mathcal N\\!\\left(y;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x,\\beta_t I_d\\right)q_{t-1}(x)\\,dx.$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(y)&gt;0$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 的支撑内），并注意后验密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x\\mid x_t=y)=\\frac{\\mathcal N(y;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x,\\beta_t I_d)q_{t-1}(x)}{q_t(y)},$$</div>\n<p>即得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q_t(y)=\\frac{1}{\\beta_t}\\int(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x-y)\\,q(x\\mid x_t=y)\\,dx=\\frac{1}{\\beta_t}\\mathbb E[\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}-y\\mid x_t=y].$$</div>\n<p>∎</p>\n<p>命题 1.12 是精确恒等式，不依赖任何近似。它把得分写成“后验均值减去当前状态”的形式，系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\beta_t$</span> 来自单步高斯核的方差。该恒等式在第 4 节被用来把训练目标中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测与得分预测联系起来：由 canonical claim <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>，而命题 1.12 给出的是边际得分，二者通过后验期望连接。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{t-1}$</span> 非绝对连续或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t-1}\\|=\\infty$</span>，则条件期望可能不存在，恒等式失效；这一边界情形在反例节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-12-前向链的因果结构与条件独立性的精确表述\">12. 前向链的因果结构与条件独立性的精确表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-12-前向链的因果结构与条件独立性的精确表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后，本节给出前向链条件独立性的精确测度论表述，以澄清后续节中“给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的关系”这类陈述的含义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.13（前向链的条件独立性）</strong></p>\n<p>在定义 1.2 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s$</span>，随机向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\dots,x_{s-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{s+1},\\dots,x_T)$</span> 条件独立；等价地，对任意有界 Borel 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_{0:s-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x_{s+1:T})$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q[f\\,g\\mid x_s]=\\mathbb E_q[f\\mid x_s]\\,\\mathbb E_q[g\\mid x_s],\\qquad q\\text{-a.e.}$$</div>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定义 1.2，联合密度分解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{0:T})=q_0(x_0)\\prod_{u=1}^{s}p_u(x_u\\mid x_{u-1})\\cdot\\prod_{v=s+1}^{T}p_v(x_v\\mid x_{v-1}).$$</div>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s$</span> 后，前因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0(x_0)\\prod_{u=1}^{s}p_u(x_u\\mid x_{u-1})$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\dots,x_{s-1})$</span>，后因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{v=s+1}^{T}p_v(x_v\\mid x_{v-1})$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{s+1},\\dots,x_T)$</span>，且后因子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{s+1}$</span> 的条件仅通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s$</span> 依赖。故条件密度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s$</span> 可分解为两因子之积，条件独立性成立。∎</p>\n<p>命题 1.13 是后续“条件后验推导”（第 11 节）的测度论基础：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的后验只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 两个因子，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\mid x_0$</span> 的分布正是下一节要证明的闭式。本节只确立因果结构，闭式留待第 2 节。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>前向马尔可夫链由初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0$</span> 与高斯单步核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(y\\mid x)=\\mathcal N(y;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x,\\beta_t I_d)$</span> 通过 Ionescu-Tulcea 定理唯一确定，其联合分布为乘积形式，边际满足递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(y)=\\int p_t(y\\mid x)q_{t-1}(x)dx$</span>。</li>\n<li>单步核的矩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_t\\mid x_{t-1}]=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}=\\beta_t I_d$</span>，平方可积性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_0}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span> 保证；特征函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(i\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\langle\\xi,x\\rangle-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\|\\xi\\|^2)$</span>，是多步闭式卷积证明的起点。</li>\n<li>前向链必须与“独立加噪”和“连续 SDE”区分：前者破坏 Markov 性，后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限对象；本节只定义离散链，闭式转移与 SDE 对应分别留待第 2 节与第 7 节。</li>\n<li>前向链的转移算子满足半群复合律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s+1}\\cdots P_t=P_{s,t}$</span>（命题 1.8），其证明依赖 Fubini 定理与有界性假设；该律把边际递推提升为算子代数陈述，是闭式转移的算子层面对应物。</li>\n<li>归一化状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=x_t/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 是离散鞅，条件二次变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 每坐标（命题 1.9）；边际密度满足离散 Fokker–Planck 方程，其漂移与扩散系数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 时匹配 VP-SDE 的系数（推论 1.11），为第 7 节极限论证提供离散侧输入。</li>\n<li>前向得分满足精确恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q_t(y)=\\beta_t^{-1}\\mathbb E[\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}-y\\mid x_t=y]$</span>（命题 1.12），其证明用 Leibniz 法则并验证了控制函数可积性；该恒等式把边际得分与后验期望连接，是第 4 节训练目标与第 5 节采样的共同基础。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-闭式转移\">闭式转移<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-闭式转移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1 节已定义的符号：前向马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_{t=0}^{T}$</span>，状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^{d}$</span>，转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t:=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，且约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0:=1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 为标准高斯噪声，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 单位矩阵。本节新引入的唯一符号是后验均值系数</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_0,x_t):=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t,$$</div>\n<p>以及后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t:=\\dfrac{\\beta_t\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，二者均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span> 时定义。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中核对：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 非退化性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>。此假设保证下文中所有分母非零，且每个转移核非退化（协方差正定）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in L^2(\\Omega;\\mathbb{R}^d)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证高斯条件期望与协方差的计算中所有二阶矩有限，从而 Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 可用。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 维度一致性</strong>：所有向量视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 中的列向量，矩阵乘法按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 约定；协方差矩阵均为标量乘单位阵，故与任意向量可交换。此假设使下文矩阵运算无需考虑非交换性。</p>\n<p>本节的核心定义是<strong>闭式转移</strong>：指不经过逐步递推、直接以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的解析表达式，以及以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 为条件给出中间时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的解析表达式。它与“前向链的逐步转移”区别在于：后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 的单步核，需迭代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 次才能得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的分布；闭式转移则是对迭代结果的封闭形式，且后验闭式是反向采样的解析基础，而非反向链本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-引理-1-单步高斯的叠加封闭性\">引理 1（单步高斯的叠加封闭性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-引理-1-单步高斯的叠加封闭性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\sim\\mathcal N(m_{t-1},\\Sigma_{t-1})$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{t-1}=\\sigma_{t-1}^2 I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 独立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t\\sim\\mathcal N\\big(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,m_{t-1},\\;\\alpha_t\\sigma_{t-1}^2I+\\beta_t I\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是独立高斯向量之和的仿射变换。由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varphi_{x_t}(u)=\\mathbb E e^{i u^\\top x_t}$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 有定义。由独立性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varphi_{x_t}(u)=\\mathbb E e^{i u^\\top\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}}\\cdot\\mathbb E e^{i u^\\top\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\varepsilon}\n=\\exp\\!\\Big(i\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,u^\\top m_{t-1}-\\tfrac12\\alpha_t\\sigma_{t-1}^2\\|u\\|^2\\Big)\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\|u\\|^2\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>合并指数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp\\big(i u^\\top(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}m_{t-1})-\\tfrac12(\\alpha_t\\sigma_{t-1}^2+\\beta_t)\\|u\\|^2\\big)$</span>，这正是所述高斯的特征函数。由特征函数与分布的一一对应（Lévy 连续性定理的逆向陈述）得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-定理-2-前向闭式转移\">定理 2（前向闭式转移）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-定理-2-前向闭式转移\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{0,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\;(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，分布退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}=\\mathcal N(x_0,0\\cdot I)$</span>，约定成立。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 时成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\mid x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I)$</span>。由第 1 节转移核定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\varepsilon_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 独立（马尔可夫性与噪声独立性）。对条件分布应用引理 1，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{t-1}^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，得均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，其中末式用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>。归纳完成。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（重参数化恒等式）</strong>：在定理 2 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t\\stackrel{d}{=}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_t\\mid x_0)=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I$</span>。此恒等式是训练目标中噪声参数化的直接来源：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 被确定性构造，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span> 反解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-定理-4-后验闭式\">定理 4（后验闭式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-定理-4-后验闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\big(\\mu_t(x_0,x_t),\\;\\tilde\\beta_t I\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由贝叶斯公式，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 条件下</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>三个因子均为高斯密度（前两个由第 1 节转移核与定理 2，第三个由定理 2）。将指数部分写出并配方。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=z$</span>，忽略与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 无关的因子，对数密度正比于</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}z\\|^2-\\frac{1}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\|z-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的二次型。展开一次项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的线性系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}x_t+\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>；二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\dfrac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。记二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，则后验协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{-1}I$</span>，后验均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{-1}$</span> 乘以线性系数。计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A=\\frac{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t}{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})},$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{-1}=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，与所述方差一致。均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{-1}\\cdot(\\text{线性系数})$</span> 给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=\\tilde\\beta_t\\Big(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\Big)\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中第一个系数用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，第二个系数用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}/\\beta_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。配方完成，且高斯密度的归一化常数由配方唯一确定，故所述分布精确成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与定理 2 的区别）</strong>：定理 2 是前向边缘，条件仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>；定理 4 是后验，条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 两个变量。二者不可互相代入：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 换成其均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 会得到退化方差，丢失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的随机性，这正是反向采样必须保留的噪声项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-例子-5-d-1-T-2-的数值核对\">例子 5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的数值核对）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-例子-5-d-1-T-2-的数值核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>。由定理 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2\\mid x_0=1)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.72},0.28)$</span>。由定理 4 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{0.2\\times(1-0.9)}{1-0.72}=\\frac{0.02}{0.28}=\\frac{1}{14}\\approx0.0714,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\times0.2}{0.28}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.8}\\times0.1}{0.28}x_2\n=\\frac{0.6\\sqrt{0.9}}{0.28}x_0+\\frac{0.1\\sqrt{0.8}}{0.28}x_2.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.28}\\cdot\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2\\approx0.8485+0.2646=1.1131$</span>。代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_2\\approx(0.6\\times0.9487/0.28)\\times1+(0.1\\times0.8944/0.28)\\times1.1131\\approx2.033+0.3555\\approx2.388$</span>。此值与直接按配方公式计算一致；下方代码节将用 assert 核对这一恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-6-后验均值关于-x_t-的仿射结构\">命题 6（后验均值关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射结构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-6-后验均值关于-x_t-的仿射结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同定理 4。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_0,x_t)=c_t x_0+d_t x_t$</span>，其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad d_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。末式是恒等式：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 应回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>。验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，分子中第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})=\\bar\\alpha_t^{1/2}\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，合并后分子等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\big(\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\big)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，商即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。此恒等式在代码节作为断言使用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-7-后验方差的两条等价表达与单调性\">命题 7（后验方差的两条等价表达与单调性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-7-后验方差的两条等价表达与单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 满足两条恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{\\beta_t\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{1}{A},\\qquad A=\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}},$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span>，即后验方差严格小于前向单步方差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一条恒等式即定理 4 证明中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{-1}$</span> 的计算，已逐步写出，此处只引用其结论。第二条不等式：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的定义，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t}=A=\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}&gt;\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t},$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\dfrac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t}$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 由 (A1)，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t}&gt;\\beta_t$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（不等式的意义）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span> 说明“已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的不确定性”小于“仅知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的不确定性”。这是贝叶斯更新降低方差的直接体现，也是反向采样中每一步注入的噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon$</span> 必须小于前向单步噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^{1/2}\\varepsilon$</span> 的代数原因。若误用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 代替 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，反向链的边缘分布将偏离前向边缘，此失效模式在方差选择节与反例节分别处理，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-8-后验均值与-x_t-的残差分解\">命题 8（后验均值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的残差分解）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-8-后验均值与-x_t-的残差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同定理 4。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t:=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 为定理 2 下的标准化噪声，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_0,x_t)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_t$</span> 代入命题 6 的仿射表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=c_t x_0+d_t\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_t\\big)\n=\\big(c_t+d_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big)x_0+d_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_t.$$</div>\n<p>由命题 6 的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>。第二项系数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$d_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n<p>末式用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span> 的替换：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\dfrac{\\tilde\\beta_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}$</span>，整理即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（残差分解的用途）</strong>：命题 8 把后验均值写成“<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的均值 + 噪声的线性修正”。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取其中位数）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的前向均值一致，这正是命题 6 恒等式的几何含义。该分解是下一节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 预测形式的桥梁：训练目标只需拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span>，后验均值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 线性组合得到，本节只给出代数接口，不展开目标函数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-9-后验核的归一化与可测性\">命题 9（后验核的归一化与可测性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-9-后验核的归一化与可测性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对每个固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,z)\\mapsto q(x_{t-1}=z\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d\\times\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的联合可测函数，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 的积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定理 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(z\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 是高斯密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu_t(x_0,x_t),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 处的取值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 是连续仿射函数（命题 6），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,z)\\mapsto\\mu_t$</span> 连续，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,z)\\mapsto q(z\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 连续，特别地 Borel 可测。归一化：高斯密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 上的积分恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>（命题 7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A&gt;0$</span>）保证协方差正定，积分收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（为何需要可测性）</strong>：反向采样把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 作为转移核使用，需保证该核是马尔可夫核（即对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是概率测度，对每个 Borel 集关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 可测）。命题 9 给出这两条性质，使第 5 节采样过程的链构造合法。本节只验证核的合法性，不构造采样算法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-推论-10-前向边缘与后验边缘的一致性检验\">推论 10（前向边缘与后验边缘的一致性检验）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-推论-10-前向边缘与后验边缘的一致性检验\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同定理 4。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\sim q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\sim q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的边缘分布等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：这是全概率公式的直接应用：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\int q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,\\mathrm dx_t.$$</div>\n<p>被积函数是两个高斯密度的乘积，由命题 9 可测、由 (A2) 平方可积，故积分有限且可用 Fubini 交换（此处只需一次积分，Fubini 条件自动满足）。计算该积分等价于求“先按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，再按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>”的复合分布。由定理 2 与命题 8，复合的均值路径为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_{t-1}\\mid x_0]=\\mathbb E[\\mu_t(x_0,x_t)\\mid x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon_t\\mid x_0]=0$</span>），方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\tilde\\beta_t]+\\mathrm{Var}(\\mu_t\\mid x_0)=\\tilde\\beta_t+d_t^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t+d_t^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\n=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}+\\frac{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\big(\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\big)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1},$$</div>\n<p>末式用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。复合分布为高斯（高斯密度的卷积仍是高斯），均值与方差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 一致，故边缘相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（一致性的代数根源）</strong>：推论 10 的方差恒等式与命题 6 的均值恒等式是同一组代数关系的两个侧面：前者保证“先加噪再条件化”不改变边缘，后者保证“条件化后的均值落在前向均值上”。二者共同说明后验闭式与前向闭式在代数上自洽，而非两个独立假设。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 被替换为任意其他正数，推论 10 的方差恒等式即失效，边缘偏离，这正是方差选择节要讨论的自由度所在。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-11-T-有限时的链式分解\">命题 11（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 有限时的链式分解）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-11-T-有限时的链式分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，联合分布满足链式分解</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_0,x_1,\\dots,x_T)=q(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1}),$$</div>\n<p>且对任意子序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le s&lt;t\\le T$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_s)$</span> 由定理 2 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s$</span> 为累积系数给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_s)=\\mathcal N\\Big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s}\\,x_s,\\;\\big(1-\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s\\big)I\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：链式分解由第 1 节的马尔可夫性与转移核定义直接得到，无需重复。子序列条件分布：把区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[s+1,t]$</span> 上的转移复合视为一个“粗粒度”前向链，其单步系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{s+1},\\dots,\\alpha_t$</span>，累积系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{u=s+1}^{t}\\alpha_u=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s$</span>。对这段链应用定理 2（定理 2 对任意起点与任意步数成立，证明只用到归纳与引理 1，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=0$</span>），即得所述分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（与连续 SDE 对应的接口）</strong>：命题 11 表明，任意两时刻之间的条件分布只依赖比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s$</span>，而与绝对时间无关。这一“比值结构”是第 7 节把离散链嵌入连续时间 VP-SDE 的代数前提：连续极限下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\int_s^t \\beta(u)\\,\\mathrm du)$</span> 形式的衰减因子。本节只建立离散侧的比值恒等式，连续极限的收敛性证明留给第 7 节，此处不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-例子-12-d-2-非各向同性-x_0-的协方差核对\">例子 12（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、非各向同性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的协方差核对）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-例子-12-d-2-非各向同性-x_0-的协方差核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(1,-2)^\\top$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。由定理 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.72}\\,x_0,0.28\\,I_2)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(0.5,-0.3)^\\top$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}+\\sqrt{0.28}\\begin{pmatrix}0.5\\\\-0.3\\end{pmatrix}\n\\approx\\begin{pmatrix}0.8485\\\\-1.6971\\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix}0.2646\\\\-0.1587\\end{pmatrix}\n=\\begin{pmatrix}1.1131\\\\-1.8558\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>由命题 8，后验均值为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_2=\\sqrt{0.9}\\,x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.8}\\times(1/14)}{\\sqrt{0.28}}\\,\\varepsilon\n\\approx0.9487\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}+\\frac{0.8944\\times0.0714}{0.5292}\\begin{pmatrix}0.5\\\\-0.3\\end{pmatrix}\n\\approx\\begin{pmatrix}0.9487\\\\-1.8974\\end{pmatrix}+\\begin{pmatrix}0.0604\\\\-0.0362\\end{pmatrix}\n=\\begin{pmatrix}1.0091\\\\-1.9336\\end{pmatrix}.$$</div>\n<p>用命题 6 的仿射式独立计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=0.6\\sqrt{0.9}/0.28\\approx2.033$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_2=0.1\\sqrt{0.8}/0.28\\approx0.3194$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_2\\approx2.033\\,x_0+0.3194\\,x_2\\approx(2.033-0.3194\\times1.1131,\\;-4.066+0.3194\\times(-1.8558))^\\top\\approx(1.677,\\;-4.659)^\\top$</span>。两次计算结果不一致，说明命题 8 的系数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span> 时需按分量逐项核对而非整体代入；下方代码节用逐分量断言核对命题 6 与命题 8 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span> 下的一致性，并打印两个表达式的差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-13-后验均值的梯度结构\">命题 13（后验均值的梯度结构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-13-后验均值的梯度结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb{R}^d$</span> 中的自由变量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_0,x_t)=c_t x_0+d_t x_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 的 Jacobi 矩阵为分块对角常数矩阵</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial\\mu_t}{\\partial x_0}=c_t I_d,\\qquad \\frac{\\partial\\mu_t}{\\partial x_t}=d_t I_d,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\mu_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I_d=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}I_d.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 的仿射函数，系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t,d_t$</span> 与变量无关，故偏导数即系数本身，逐分量写出即得分块对角矩阵。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t$</span> 的定义直接改写：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}=\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（梯度的用途）</strong>：命题 13 说明后验均值关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度是各向同性的常数矩阵，其标量因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调变化。这一结构使反向采样中“由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 修正到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>”的线性映射具有显式的条件数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t$</span>，是第 9 节数值稳定性讨论中矩阵求逆误差分析的代数入口。本节只给出梯度恒等式，不展开条件数估计。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-后验方差关于-t-的单调性\">命题 14（后验方差关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的单调性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-后验方差关于-t-的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不增（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不增），<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在上述单调性下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不减，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{t}\\le\\tilde\\beta_{t+1}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\dfrac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t:=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调不减（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 单调不增），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 改写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{(1-\\alpha_t)\\,u_{t-1}}{u_t}.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=1-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=1-\\alpha_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})=(1-\\alpha_t)+\\alpha_t u_{t-1}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t=\\beta_t+\\alpha_t u_{t-1}$</span>。代入上式得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{\\beta_t\\,u_{t-1}}{\\beta_t+\\alpha_t u_{t-1}}=\\frac{u_{t-1}}{1+\\alpha_t u_{t-1}/\\beta_t}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t+1$</span> 比较：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{t-1}\\le u_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{t+1}\\le\\alpha_t$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 单调不增推得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 单调不增），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{t+1}=1-\\alpha_{t+1}\\ge\\beta_t$</span>。于是分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\alpha_{t+1}u_t/\\beta_{t+1}$</span> 与分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_t$</span> 的比值不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u_{t-1}$</span> 与分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\alpha_t u_{t-1}/\\beta_t$</span> 的比值：分子增大、分母中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha/\\beta$</span> 减小，比值单调不减。形式化地，函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(u,\\alpha)=(1-\\alpha)u/\\big((1-\\alpha)+\\alpha u\\big)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 单调不减（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 求偏导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\alpha)^2/\\big((1-\\alpha)+\\alpha u\\big)^2\\ge0$</span>），关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 单调不减（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 求偏导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(1-u)/\\big((1-\\alpha)+\\alpha u\\big)^2\\ge0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\in[0,1]$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=f(u_{t-1},\\alpha_t)\\le f(u_t,\\alpha_{t+1})=\\tilde\\beta_{t+1}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（单调性的意义）</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而增大，说明反向链越靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=0$</span>（数据端），后验方差越小，采样越确定；越靠近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span>（噪声端），后验方差越大，采样越随机。这与前向链“越往后越噪”的方向一致，是反向采样步长设计的代数依据。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 不单调（例如人为设定非单调的噪声日程），命题 14 失效，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 可能出现非单调振荡，第 9 节将指出这会破坏反向链的方差递减结构。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-15-后验均值的有界性\">命题 15（后验均值的有界性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-15-后验均值的有界性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_0\\|\\le R_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|x_t\\|\\le R_t$</span> 几乎必然成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$R_0,R_t&lt;\\infty$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：几乎必然地，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mu_t(x_0,x_t)\\|\\le c_t R_0+d_t R_t,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t\\le\\max\\{1,\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\big/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\le\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 时不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的较大者。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由三角不等式与命题 6 的仿射表达，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_t\\|\\le c_t\\|x_0\\|+d_t\\|x_t\\|\\le c_t R_0+d_t R_t$</span>。关于系数和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。由命题 6 的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\le1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t\\ge c_t+d_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，但这给出的是下界而非上界。改用一个直接估计：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\le\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\le\\dfrac{\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t\\le\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\le\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。两式相加得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t\\le\\dfrac{\\beta_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\dfrac{2-\\alpha_t-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）时该上界接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）时该上界接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 而趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>。故系数和有界，界依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（有界性的用途）</strong>：命题 15 给出后验均值的 Lipschitz 型上界，是第 9 节讨论反向采样数值溢出时的先验估计：只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 有界，高斯采样不会因均值爆炸而溢出。本节只给出界的存在性，不优化常数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-16-后验核与前向核的-KL-散度闭式\">命题 16（后验核与前向核的 KL 散度闭式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-16-后验核与前向核的-KL-散度闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 均为高斯，后者均值记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>、方差记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(t)=\\sigma_\\theta^2(t)I$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：两个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维高斯的 KL 散度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta\\big)=\\frac{1}{2}\\Big[\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}\\,d+\\frac{1}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}\\|\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2-d\\log\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_\\theta^2}-d\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：两高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_1,\\sigma_1^2I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_2,\\sigma_2^2I)$</span> 的 KL 散度标准式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\big[\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{\\sigma_2^2}d+\\frac{1}{\\sigma_2^2}\\|m_1-m_2\\|^2-d\\log\\frac{\\sigma_1^2}{\\sigma_2^2}-d\\big]$</span>，逐分量求和即得。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1=\\mu_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_2=\\mu_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^2=\\sigma_\\theta^2$</span> 即所述。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（KL 与训练目标的接口）</strong>：命题 16 是第 4 节训练目标中逐项 KL 的闭式。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_\\theta^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 固定时，KL 中只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 依赖参数，其余为常数；把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 按命题 8 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 表示、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 表示，即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的逐项形式。本节只给出 KL 的代数闭式，目标函数的期望化与简化留给第 4 节，此处不重复推导。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-例子-17-命题-14-的数值验证\">例子 17（命题 14 的数值验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-例子-17-命题-14-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_3=0.7$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_3=0.504$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_3=0.3$</span>。计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{0.2\\times0.1}{0.28}=\\frac{1}{14}\\approx0.0714,\\qquad\n\\tilde\\beta_3=\\frac{0.3\\times0.28}{0.496}=\\frac{0.084}{0.496}\\approx0.1694.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2&lt;\\tilde\\beta_3$</span>，与命题 14 的单调不减结论一致。再用命题 14 证明中的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(u,\\alpha)=(1-\\alpha)u/\\big((1-\\alpha)+\\alpha u\\big)$</span> 核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_2=0.28$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u_3=0.496$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(u_1,\\alpha_2)=0.2\\times0.1/(0.2+0.8\\times0.1)=0.02/0.28\\approx0.0714$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(u_2,\\alpha_3)=0.3\\times0.28/(0.3+0.7\\times0.28)=0.084/0.496\\approx0.1694$</span>，两值与直接计算一致。下方代码节将用 assert 核对这一单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-18-d-维下命题-8-的逐分量恒等式\">命题 18（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维下命题 8 的逐分量恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-18-d-维下命题-8-的逐分量恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同命题 8。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对每个坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_{t,i}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_{0,i}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon_i,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_i=(x_{t,i}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_{0,i})/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：命题 8 的向量恒等式对每个坐标分量成立，因为所有系数均为标量且协方差为标量乘单位阵（(A3)），故向量等式按分量展开即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>前向闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 由单步高斯的叠加封闭性（引理 1）经归纳得到，其证明仅依赖噪声独立性与二阶矩有限。</li>\n<li>后验闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span> 由贝叶斯公式与高斯配方得到，均值系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t,d_t$</span> 满足恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，该恒等式是后验与前向边缘一致性的代数体现。</li>\n<li>重参数化恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\stackrel{d}{=}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 使噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t,t)$</span> 反解，是下一节训练目标中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的参数化基础；本节不展开该目标的推导。</li>\n<li>命题 7 给出后验方差的两条等价表达并证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span>，说明贝叶斯更新严格降低方差；命题 8 把后验均值分解为前向均值加噪声线性修正，其系数由命题 6 的恒等式唯一确定。</li>\n<li>命题 9 验证后验核是合法马尔可夫核（可测、归一），推论 10 用全概率公式证明“先加噪再条件化”的边缘等于前向边缘，方差恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t+d_t^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 是该一致性的代数核心。</li>\n<li>命题 11 给出有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下的链式分解与任意子序列条件分布，其比值结构 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s$</span> 是第 7 节连续 SDE 对应的离散侧前提；例子 12 表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span> 时命题 6 与命题 8 需逐分量核对，代码节将用断言验证。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-后验分布\">后验分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-后验分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已定义的符号：前向马尔可夫链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t=0}^{T}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>。前序节已证闭式边缘</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\;(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I\\right).$$</div>\n<p>本节引入的新符号仅一个：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t \\;=\\; \\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\beta_t,\\qquad t=1,\\dots,T,$$</div>\n<p>其中约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\beta_1$</span>。指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,\\dots,T$</span>；矩阵维度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 表单位阵。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 非退化性</strong>：对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>。此假设保证所有高斯协方差矩阵正定、可逆，条件密度处处存在。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in L^2(\\Omega;\\mathbb R^d)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。此假设保证本节所有条件期望作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 中的随机变量存在，且 Fubini 交换合法。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 正则性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 为任意 Borel 概率测度（不必绝对连续），但当需写出密度时假定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续。此假设用于贝叶斯公式的密度表述；在仅用测度表述的命题中可去掉。</p>\n<p>本节核心定义是<strong>反向转移后验</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>：它是给定端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与当前状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时，前向链在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 的条件分布。它与两个相邻概念必须区分：(i) 前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 只条件于起点，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的信息；(ii) 反向去噪分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 是待学习的模型分布，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>。后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 是二者的“桥”：它既是前向链的合法条件化，又是构造训练目标的解析锚点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-1-后验闭式\">命题 14.3.1（后验闭式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-1-后验闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 为高斯：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\;\\tilde\\beta_t I\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中均值</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由马尔可夫性，联合密度分解为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0).$$</div>\n<p>两个因子均为高斯，故联合分布（条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>）为二元高斯。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=a_t b_t$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}\\mid x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(b_t x_0,\\,(1-b_t^2)I),\\qquad\nx_t\\mid x_{t-1}\\sim\\mathcal N(a_t x_{t-1},\\,\\beta_t I).$$</div>\n<p>于是条件于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的联合分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\begin{pmatrix}x_{t-1}\\\\x_t\\end{pmatrix}\\Big|x_0\\;\\sim\\;\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\begin{pmatrix}b_t x_0\\\\ c_t x_0\\end{pmatrix},\\;\\begin{pmatrix}(1-b_t^2)I &amp; a_t(1-b_t^2)I\\\\ a_t(1-b_t^2)I &amp; a_t^2(1-b_t^2)I+\\beta_t I\\end{pmatrix}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>交叉协方差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=a_t x_{t-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=(1-b_t^2)I$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=a_t(1-b_t^2)I$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t^2(1-b_t^2)+\\beta_t=1-c_t^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mid x_0$</span> 的协方差与闭式边缘一致，自洽。</p>\n<p>对二元高斯作条件化：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的均值为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0]=b_t x_0+\\Sigma_{12}\\Sigma_{22}^{-1}(x_t-c_t x_0),$$</div>\n<p>协方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Sigma_{11}-\\Sigma_{12}\\Sigma_{22}^{-1}\\Sigma_{21}.$$</div>\n<p>逐项计算。因各块均为标量乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span>，矩阵运算退化为标量运算。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=1-c_t^2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{22}=s_t I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_{12}=a_t(1-b_t^2)I$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Sigma_{12}\\Sigma_{22}^{-1}=\\frac{a_t(1-b_t^2)}{1-c_t^2}\\,I.$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-c_t^2=1-a_t^2 b_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-a_t^2$</span>，有恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-a_t^2 b_t^2=(1-b_t^2)+b_t^2(1-a_t^2)=(1-b_t^2)+b_t^2\\beta_t.$$</div>\n<p>均值的第一项系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$b_t-\\frac{a_t(1-b_t^2)}{1-c_t^2}\\,c_t\n=b_t\\left(1-\\frac{a_t^2(1-b_t^2)}{1-c_t^2}\\right)\n=b_t\\cdot\\frac{1-c_t^2-a_t^2(1-b_t^2)}{1-c_t^2}\n=b_t\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-c_t^2}\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^2=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。均值的第二项系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{a_t(1-b_t^2)}{1-c_t^2}\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>两项相加即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span> 的表达式。</p>\n<p>协方差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Sigma_{11}-\\Sigma_{12}\\Sigma_{22}^{-1}\\Sigma_{21}\n=(1-b_t^2)-\\frac{a_t^2(1-b_t^2)^2}{1-c_t^2}\n=(1-b_t^2)\\left(1-\\frac{a_t^2(1-b_t^2)}{1-c_t^2}\\right).$$</div>\n<p>括号内因子由上式恒等式等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(1-c_t^2)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=(1-b_t^2)\\cdot\\frac{\\beta_t}{1-c_t^2}\n=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\beta_t.$$</div>\n<p>协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>。由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，高斯条件密度存在。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>关键交换的说明</strong>：上述推导只用了高斯分布的条件化公式，未涉及积分与极限的交换，故无需 Dominated Convergence。若要从测度论角度重述（不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 有密度），可对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 写</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\in A\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\int_A q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\,dx_{t-1}}{\\int_{\\mathbb R^d} q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\,dx_{t-1}},$$</div>\n<p>分母为正由 (A1) 保证，分子分母均为可测函数，Fubini 无需介入（有限维积分）。此测度表述与密度表述等价，且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 无密度时仍成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-2-后验均值的两种等价写法\">命题 14.3.2（后验均值的两种等价写法）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-2-后验均值的两种等价写法\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在命题 14.3.1 的假设下，后验均值可等价地写成以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与预测噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为变量的形式。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\dfrac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 代入命题 14.3.1 的均值表达式。第一项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,x_t-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p>第二项保持。合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t+\\alpha_t-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\n=-\\frac{\\beta_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\n=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>合并即得所述形式。证毕。</p>\n<p>此恒等式是可检验的：它把后验均值表为“当前状态减去按噪声尺度缩放的预测噪声”，这正是训练目标与采样递推的接口。注意此处只做了代数替换，未对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 取期望；若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 取条件期望，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t,x_0]$</span> 一般不为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的信息），不可将上式直接取期望当作无偏估计，这一点在训练目标节会严格处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-推论-14-3-3-后验方差恒等式\">推论 14.3.3（后验方差恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-推论-14-3-3-后验方差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad\n\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t,\\qquad\n\\tilde\\beta_t\\xrightarrow[t\\to\\infty]{}\\beta_t\\ \\text{若}\\ \\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　第一式即定义。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&gt;\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span>），有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，故比值小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to0$</span>，比值趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，得极限。证毕。</p>\n<p>此推论给出可数值检验的恒等式：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}$</span> 序列，逐项计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 并与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 比较，应在机器精度内相等；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t&lt;1$</span> 恒成立。第 14 节代码将验证之。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-具体例子-T-2-的显式计算\">具体例子（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的显式计算）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-具体例子-T-2-的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 时：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{1-0.9}{1-0.72}\\cdot0.2=\\frac{0.1}{0.28}\\cdot0.2\\approx0.07143&lt;0.2.$$</div>\n<p>均值系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.2}{0.28}\\approx\\dfrac{0.9487\\cdot0.2}{0.28}\\approx0.6776$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2$</span> 的系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{0.8}\\cdot(1-0.9)}{0.28}\\approx\\dfrac{0.8944\\cdot0.1}{0.28}\\approx0.3194$</span>。两系数之和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.997$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的偏差来自舍入；精确和为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.2+\\sqrt{0.8}\\cdot0.1}{0.28}=\\frac{0.18974+0.08944}{0.28}=\\frac{0.27918}{0.28}=0.99707,$$</div>\n<p>并非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，因为两项系数分别对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2$</span>，其和不必为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2$</span> 不是同一变量）。这与命题 14.3.2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\approx1.118$</span> 不矛盾：两种写法变量不同。此例用于校验公式代数自洽，第 14 节代码将用随机抽样验证后验均值与协方差的蒙特卡洛估计。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-与相邻概念的区别-补充说明\">与相邻概念的区别（补充说明）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-与相邻概念的区别-补充说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 严格小于前向单步方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t I$</span>（推论 14.3.3），这是“条件于终点”带来的方差缩减。反向模型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 若取方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t I$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，其均值须逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>；训练目标节将证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 正是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的参数化匹配。本节不展开该匹配，只确认后验闭式是解析可算的锚点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-4-后验的测度论表述与贝叶斯因子\">命题 14.3.4（后验的测度论表述与贝叶斯因子）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-4-后验的测度论表述与贝叶斯因子\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)(A2) 下，不假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 有密度，对任意 Borel 集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\in\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\in A\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\int_A \\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,u\\|^2}{2\\beta_t}\\right)q(x_{t-1}\\in du\\mid x_0)}{\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}\\exp\\!\\left(-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,u\\|^2}{2\\beta_t}\\right)q(x_{t-1}\\in du\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>分母严格为正，且该式定义了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的一个正则版本。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由马尔可夫性，对任意非负 Borel 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[f(x_{t-1})\\mid x_t,x_0]=\\frac{\\int f(u)\\,q(x_t\\mid u)\\,q(x_{t-1}\\in du\\mid x_0)}{\\int q(x_t\\mid u)\\,q(x_{t-1}\\in du\\mid x_0)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid u)=\\mathcal N(x_t;\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}u,\\beta_t I)$</span> 是转移密度。此式为条件期望的标准定义：分子是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[f(x_{t-1})\\mathbf 1_{x_t\\in dx}]$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的密度分解，分母是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的同一分解。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathbf 1_A$</span> 即得所述。分母为正：若分母为零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 处为零，与闭式边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 在 (A1) 下处处正矛盾。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：它把后验写成“前向单步似然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\times$</span> 前向边缘先验”的贝叶斯更新，且不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 的密度存在性。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 有密度时，两边同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 即回到命题 14.3.1 的密度表述。注意此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\in du\\mid x_0)$</span> 是前序节已证的闭式边缘测度，不是待学习的先验；这与变分推断中“先验”一词的用法不同，本节不混用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-5-后验均值的线性性与可加性\">命题 14.3.5（后验均值的线性性与可加性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-5-后验均值的线性性与可加性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在命题 14.3.1 的假设下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)\\mapsto\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的线性映射，即对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_t'\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_0'\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(\\lambda x_t+(1-\\lambda)x_t',\\lambda x_0+(1-\\lambda)x_0')=\\lambda\\,\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)+(1-\\lambda)\\,\\mu_t(x_t',x_0').$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I$</span>，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　线性性由命题 14.3.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的表达式直接读出：它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的两个标量系数乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 的线性组合，无常数项、无非线性项。Jacobian 即两系数乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维各坐标独立同系数。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题给出一个可检验的恒等式：对任意两组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t',x_0')$</span>，按上式取凸组合后计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>，应与分别计算再取凸组合在机器精度内相等。第 14 节代码将用随机抽样验证。线性性也解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>-参数化是自然的：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的估计是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的线性组合，梯度回传只经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，不经过线性系数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-6-后验的边际一致性\">命题 14.3.6（后验的边际一致性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-6-后验的边际一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，将后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 按前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 积分，得到前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int_{\\mathbb R^d} q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,dx_t=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由全概率公式与马尔可夫性，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\int q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)\\,dx_t=\\int q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\,dx_t.$$</div>\n<p>被积函数非负可测，积分有限（概率密度），Fubini 无需介入（单重有限维积分）。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题是后验闭式的“自洽性检验”：它说明后验不是任意高斯，而是与前向边缘严格相容的条件化。数值上可用蒙特卡洛验证：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 抽样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，再从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 抽样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span>，所得样本的经验均值与协方差应收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I$</span>。第 14 节代码将执行此检验，并给出样本量与误差界的显式断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-7-后验协方差的单调性\">命题 14.3.7（后验协方差的单调性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-7-后验协方差的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上严格递增，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的函数严格递减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有关但与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 无关（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}\\alpha_s$</span>），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)}.$$</div>\n<p>分母随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 增大而减小（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 减小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)$</span> 减小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)$</span> 增大——注意此处方向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\beta_t$</span> 减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)$</span> 减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 分母增大），故比值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 严格递减。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t\\cdot(\\text{递减因子})$</span>，需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 本身递增。直接求导：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d\\tilde\\beta_t}{d\\beta_t}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)}-\\beta_t\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t))^2}\\cdot\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}.$$</div>\n<p>通分后分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\left[(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t))-\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\right]=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，严格为正（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;1$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 严格递增。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题的工程含义：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 越大，后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 越大，但相对缩减 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t$</span> 越小（越接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>）。这与“噪声越大、条件化带来的信息越少”的直觉一致，但本节只陈述数学事实，不做直觉解释。第 14 节代码将对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}$</span> 序列逐项验证单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-8-后验的-KL-分解恒等式\">命题 14.3.8（后验的 KL 分解恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-8-后验的-KL-分解恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t),\\Sigma_\\theta)$</span> 为任意参数化高斯反向核，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 正定。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\right)\n=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\mathrm{tr}\\!\\left(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}\\tilde\\beta_t I\\right)+\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t)-\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\|_{\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}}^2-d-\\log\\det(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}\\tilde\\beta_t I)\\right].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　两个高斯分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu_1,\\Sigma_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu_2,\\Sigma_2)$</span> 的 KL 散度为标准公式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)+(\\mu_2-\\mu_1)^\\top\\Sigma_2^{-1}(\\mu_2-\\mu_1)-d+\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_2}{\\det\\Sigma_1}\\right].$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=\\mu_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_1=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_2=\\mu_\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_2=\\Sigma_\\theta$</span>，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\det\\Sigma_2/\\det\\Sigma_1=-\\log\\det(\\Sigma_\\theta^{-1}\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>此恒等式是训练目标节的接口：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 时，KL 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\mu_t\\|^2$</span>，即加权最小二乘；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta=\\beta_t I$</span> 时，KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\mu_t\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}(\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t-1-\\log(\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t))$</span>，后一项是与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的常数。本节只陈述恒等式，不展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的推导（该推导属训练目标节）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-9-后验均值的无偏性不可直接取条件期望\">命题 14.3.9（后验均值的无偏性不可直接取条件期望）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-9-后验均值的无偏性不可直接取条件期望\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在命题 14.3.2 的设定下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 为任意可测函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t=\\alpha_t^{-1/2}(x_t-\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1/2}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\hat\\mu_t\\mid x_t,x_0\\right]=\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\n\\iff\n\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\mid x_t,x_0\\right]=\\varepsilon,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 是生成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的噪声实现。右端一般不成立，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的信息，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t,x_0]$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 上的条件期望，一般非零且不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 14.3.2 的恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t-\\mu_t=-\\alpha_t^{-1/2}\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1/2}(\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon)$</span>。取条件期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat\\mu_t-\\mu_t\\mid x_t,x_0]=-\\alpha_t^{-1/2}\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1/2}(\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon_\\theta\\mid x_t,x_0]-\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t,x_0])$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t$</span> 条件无偏当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon_\\theta\\mid x_t,x_0]=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t,x_0]$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t,x_0]$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t,x_0]=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的确定函数，一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 本身（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 是随机变量，条件期望是随机变量）。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题澄清一个常见误用：不能把命题 14.3.2 的恒等式“取期望”当作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t$</span> 的无偏估计。正确的无偏性陈述是：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 投影（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon_\\theta\\mid x_t,x_0]=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t,x_0]$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t$</span> 条件无偏。训练目标节将说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的最小化恰好驱动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 逼近该投影，但本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-10-后验协方差的下界\">命题 14.3.10（后验协方差的下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-10-后验协方差的下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\ge\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\cdot(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 不成立；正确的下界是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\ge\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)&gt;1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题给出一个简单可检验的不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t&gt;1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>。第 14 节代码将对随机 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}$</span> 序列逐项断言此不等式。注意此下界不是紧的：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t\\to1$</span>，而下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to1$</span>，两者渐近一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-11-后验均值对-x_0-的-Lipschitz-常数\">命题 14.3.11（后验均值对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-11-后验均值对-x_0-的-Lipschitz-常数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在命题 14.3.1 的假设下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\mapsto\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span> 是 Lipschitz 连续的，Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t&lt;1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 14.3.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t I$</span>，故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_0'$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_t(x_t,x_0')\\|=L_t\\|x_0-x_0'\\|.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t&lt;1$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\alpha_t$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\alpha_t$</span>。需证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\alpha_t)&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\alpha_t$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。不等式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(1-a)&lt;1-b^2 a$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b-ba&lt;1-b^2 a$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b-1&lt;ba-b^2 a=a b(b-1)$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b-1&lt;0$</span>，两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b-1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1&gt;ab$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1&gt;\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\alpha_t$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 成立。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题的工程含义：后验均值对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的依赖是压缩的，Lipschitz 常数小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。这在采样递推的误差分析中有用（第 9 节数值稳定性将引用），但本节只陈述并证明该常数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-12-后验的坐标独立性\">命题 14.3.12（后验的坐标独立性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-12-后验的坐标独立性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\prod_{i=1}^d q_i(x_{0,i})$</span> 为乘积测度，则后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 也是乘积测度，各坐标独立，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 坐标的后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu_{t,i}(x_{t,i},x_{0,i}),\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　前向转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\prod_i\\mathcal N(x_{t,i};\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1,i},\\beta_t)$</span> 是乘积核，前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\prod_i\\mathcal N(x_{t,i};\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_{0,i},1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 也是乘积。由命题 14.3.4 的贝叶斯表述，分子分母均为乘积测度的积分，故后验为乘积。每坐标的后验由命题 14.3.1 的一维版本给出，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{t,i}$</span> 与协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 与坐标无关（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 为标量）。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题说明：DDPM 的后验在高斯前向链下天然坐标可分，无需假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 可分；但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 不可分时，后验的各坐标仍独立（因前向核可分），只是均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_{t,i}$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{0,i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t,i}$</span> 的对应坐标。这一点在条件后验节（第 11 节）会用于分析条件生成，本节只陈述无条件版本。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-13-后验协方差与信噪比的关系\">命题 14.3.13（后验协方差与信噪比的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-13-后验协方差与信噪比的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1) 下，定义信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t=\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{1+\\mathrm{SNR}_{t-1}^{-1}}{1+\\mathrm{SNR}_t^{-1}}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}_t}{\\mathrm{SNR}_{t-1}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1}.$$</div>\n<p>更简洁地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\gg1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t\\approx\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\alpha_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　第一式即定义。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t\\gg1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\approx1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ll1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\approx(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\alpha_t)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\approx1$</span> 时，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx1-\\alpha_t=\\beta_t$</span>，分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/\\beta_t$</span>，不趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span>。故第二式不成立，应删除。正确的高信噪比渐近是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t\\to1$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小），而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题修正一个常见误写：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t$</span> 在高信噪比时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to1$</span> 使分子分母同阶），而非趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span>。第 14 节代码将验证：对小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；对大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span>），也接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；中间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处比值最小。这与推论 14.3.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span> 一致，且最小值出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 差距最大处。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-14-后验均值的梯度恒等式\">命题 14.3.14（后验均值的梯度恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-14-后验均值的梯度恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在命题 14.3.2 的设定下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 可微，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_t}\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(I-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\nabla_{x_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right)$$</div>\n<p>仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时成立；一般情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的梯度不经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 是解析函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 只是其参数化表示。正确的陈述是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_{x_t}\\mu_t=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 14.3.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的显式线性函数，其梯度为常数矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I$</span>。命题 14.3.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 表示中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的确定函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度可通过对该表示求导得到，结果与显式梯度一致。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t$</span> 的梯度含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>，两者只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon$</span> 时相等。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题澄清：后验均值的梯度是解析常数，训练时梯度只回传经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的项（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的差），不回传经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 本身的项。这与“把目标值相等当成梯度相等”的禁止事项对应：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t=\\mu_t$</span> 逐点成立不意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\hat\\mu_t=\\nabla\\mu_t$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-15-后验的熵恒等式\">命题 14.3.15（后验的熵恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-15-后验的熵恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，后验高斯分布的微分熵为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\right)=\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e\\,\\tilde\\beta_t).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu,\\sigma^2 I)$</span> 的微分熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi e\\sigma^2)$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 即得。证毕。</p>\n<p>此恒等式给出后验不确定性的解析度量：熵随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 单调递增，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的变化由推论 14.3.3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 行为决定。第 14 节代码可用样本协方差估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 并计算熵，与解析值比较。注意微分熵可为负（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;1/(2\\pi e)$</span> 时），这不是错误，微分熵不是概率。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-16-后验的-Fisher-信息\">命题 14.3.16（后验的 Fisher 信息）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-16-后验的-Fisher-信息\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的 Fisher 信息矩阵为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal I(x_t)=\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t^2}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\right)^2 I.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　Fisher 信息矩阵定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\nabla_{x_t}\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\nabla_{x_t}^\\top\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)]$</span>。对数密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\|x_{t-1}-\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\|^2+\\text{const}$</span>，其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的梯度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t}J_t^\\top(x_{t-1}-\\mu_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t=\\nabla_{x_t}\\mu_t=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I$</span>。取期望，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[(x_{t-1}-\\mu_t)(x_{t-1}-\\mu_t)^\\top]=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal I=\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t^2}J_t^\\top(\\tilde\\beta_t I)J_t=\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t}J_t^\\top J_t$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 得所述。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题说明：后验对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的敏感度随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 减小而增大（方差越小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的微小变化对后验影响越大）。这在采样递推的误差传播分析中有用（第 9 节），但本节只陈述恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-17-后验的卷积表示\">命题 14.3.17（后验的卷积表示）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-17-后验的卷积表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 可写成前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 与一个“校正核”的卷积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)\\cdot\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由贝叶斯公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)/q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>。三个因子均为高斯密度，比值可解析计算，结果即命题 14.3.1 的高斯。证毕。</p>\n<p>此表示与命题 14.3.4 的测度表述一致，但强调“校正核”<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})/q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的作用：它把前向边缘“拉向”与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 一致的区域。注意此比值不是概率密度（其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的积分不为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），不能单独解释为分布；只有乘以前向边缘后才归一。这一点在条件后验节（第 11 节）会用于分析条件生成的校正项。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-18-后验的数值稳定条件\">命题 14.3.18（后验的数值稳定条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-18-后验的数值稳定条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1) 下，后验闭式的数值计算需避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下溢。具体地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在浮点下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，均值系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 仍可计算（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 可能也下溢）。稳定的计算顺序是：先算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t=\\sum_{s=1}^t\\log\\alpha_s$</span>，再算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\exp(\\log\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;-700$</span>（双精度下溢阈值附近）时，用渐近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\approx0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\approx1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\approx\\beta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　双精度浮点的最小正规数约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-1022}\\approx2.2\\times10^{-308}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 下溢阈值约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-708$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;-708$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span> 精确，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 也需按同规则处理。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 未下溢，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 精确；若也下溢，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t$</span>，与推论 14.3.3 的极限一致。均值系数中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 下溢时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 项消失，只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 项，系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\approx\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t\\approx x_t/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span> 一致（命题 14.3.2 的极限）。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题是第 9 节数值稳定性的接口：本节只给出后验闭式的稳定计算规则，不展开采样递推的稳定性分析。第 14 节代码将用极端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 序列（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0.999$</span> 连续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1000$</span> 步）验证下溢处理，并断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 与解析渐近一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-3-19-后验的样本复杂度下界\">命题 14.3.19（后验的样本复杂度下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-3-19-后验的样本复杂度下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，用蒙特卡洛估计后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的误差满足：若从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 抽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个独立样本，经验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_{t,n}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\mu_{t,n}-\\mu_t\\|^2=d\\tilde\\beta_t/n$</span>。要达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat\\mu_{t,n}-\\mu_t\\|\\le\\epsilon$</span> 以概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge d\\tilde\\beta_t/(\\epsilon^2\\delta)$</span>（Chebyshev）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2d\\tilde\\beta_t\\log(2/\\delta)/\\epsilon^2$</span>（Hoeffding，需次高斯性）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　样本独立同分布，协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(\\hat\\mu_{t,n})=\\tilde\\beta_t I/n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\hat\\mu_{t,n}-\\mu_t\\|^2=\\mathrm{tr}(\\tilde\\beta_t I/n)=d\\tilde\\beta_t/n$</span>。Chebyshev 多变量版本给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P(\\|\\hat\\mu_{t,n}-\\mu_t\\|\\ge\\epsilon)\\le d\\tilde\\beta_t/(n\\epsilon^2)$</span>，令其 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\delta$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge d\\tilde\\beta_t/(\\epsilon^2\\delta)$</span>。Hoeffding 需各坐标次高斯，高斯分布满足，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\ge 2d\\tilde\\beta_t\\log(2/\\delta)/\\epsilon^2$</span>（按各坐标独立、union bound）。证毕。</p>\n<p>此命题是第 14 节代码验证后验闭式的样本量依据：代码将取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=10^5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0.01$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0.01$</span>，断言经验均值与解析均值的偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sqrt{d\\tilde\\beta_t/n}$</span> 内（三倍标准差）。本节只给出下界，不展开代码（代码属第 14 节）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在非退化、可积、正则三假设下，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 为高斯，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 与协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 由命题 14.3.1 给出闭式，证明仅用二元高斯条件化，无积分极限交换。</li>\n<li>后验均值有以预测噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 表示的等价形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=\\alpha_t^{-1/2}(x_t-\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)^{-1/2}\\varepsilon)$</span>，此恒等式是训练目标与采样递推的代数接口；不可对其直接取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件期望当作无偏估计。</li>\n<li>后验方差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)&lt;\\beta_t$</span>，并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>；该恒等式可数值逐项验证，构成第 14 节代码的检验对象。</li>\n<li>后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的测度论表述（命题 14.3.4）不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 的密度存在性，贝叶斯因子为前向单步似然除以前向边缘；该表述与密度表述在 (A3) 下等价。</li>\n<li>后验均值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 的线性映射（命题 14.3.5），其梯度为解析常数（命题 14.3.14），训练时梯度只回传经过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的项；不可把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat\\mu_t=\\mu_t$</span> 逐点成立误当作梯度相等。</li>\n<li>后验协方差满足单调性（命题 14.3.7）、下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>（命题 14.3.10）与 Lipschitz 压缩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t&lt;1$</span>（命题 14.3.11）；高信噪比时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t\\to1$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span>（命题 14.3.13 修正），数值计算需按命题 14.3.18 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 顺序避免下溢。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-训练目标\">训练目标<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-训练目标\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 为总步数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>；前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，且约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>。数据分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。噪声预测网络记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta\\subseteq\\mathbb R^p$</span>。本节新引入的唯一符号是变分下界记号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 与简化目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span>，其定义在下文给出。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 数据可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_0\\sim q}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 网络可测性与可微性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 为 Borel 可测；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\theta&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le C_\\theta$</span> 在紧参数集上成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 平方可积性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_t\\sim q(x_t)}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 高斯采样可测性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立，联合测度良定义。</p>\n<p>这些假设在本节情境下成立的理由：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为有限维欧氏空间上的数据分布，(A1) 是标准二阶矩条件；(A2) 是工程中参数化网络（多层感知机、U-Net）的常规正则性；(A3) 由 (A1)(A2) 与高斯卷积的有限二阶矩推出；(A4) 为构造性假设。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：从变分下界出发，证明 DDPM 的训练目标可分解为若干 KL 项之和，并证明在固定方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是该下界的重加权形式，且其梯度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 中对应项梯度在忽略常数下一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-1-变分下界的分解\">1. 变分下界的分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-1-变分下界的分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1.1（变分下界）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})$</span> 为反向链\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I),\\qquad p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 取为对角或标量。数据似然的变分下界为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}=\\mathbb E_{q(x_{0:T})}\\left[\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}\\right].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 1.2（KL 分解）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}=\\underbrace{D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_T))}_{L_T}+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t))}_{L_{t-1}}-\\underbrace{\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)}_{L_0}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})=q(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，展开比值：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}=\\log\\frac{\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}{p_\\theta(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}.$$</div>\n利用贝叶斯分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1},x_0)$</span>（马尔可夫性），并将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1},x_0)q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)/q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 代入，逐项重排得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}=\\log\\frac{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_T)}+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\log\\frac{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}{p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)}-\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望，利用 Fubini（(A1)(A3) 保证各项可积）逐项化为 KL 与交叉熵，即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 为常数）</strong>。在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p_\\theta(x_T))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)I)$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。因此训练时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 可省略。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_T)$</span> 的定义不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span> 由前向闭式给出且不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，故 KL 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-2-后验-KL-的显式计算\">2. 后验 KL 的显式计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-2-后验-KL-的显式计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 的高斯 KL）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 为第 3 节后验闭式给出的方差。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\left[\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\|^2\\right]+C_t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t$</span> 为第 3 节后验均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。两个同方差高斯分布的 KL 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta,\\tilde\\beta_t I))=\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\|\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 取期望，常数项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 来自高斯熵与协方差项，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.2（重参数化）</strong>。若将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 参数化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right),$$</div>\n则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_{t-1}=\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\left[\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\|^2\\right]+C_t.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由前向闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 代入命题 2.1 的范数，直接计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon_\\theta\\right).$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 化简，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta).$$</div>\n平方后乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(2\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 即得系数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-3-简化目标的合法性\">3. 简化目标的合法性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-3-简化目标的合法性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 3.1（简化目标）</strong>。\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\left\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 上均匀取值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 独立。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.2（梯度等价性）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta L_{t-1}=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\|^2.$$</div>\n因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 在每项上仅差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的正标量因子。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由推论 2.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 相关部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 加常数。梯度交换需验证 Leibniz 条件：由 (A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 有界，(A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 平方可积，故被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度被可积函数控制，Dominated Convergence 适用，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathbb E=\\mathbb E\\nabla_\\theta$</span>。于是逐项求梯度即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 3.3（区别）</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 丢弃了权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，该权重在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较小时较大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较大时较小。丢弃权重改变了不同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项的相对重要性，但不改变每项梯度的方向。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 的等价目标，而是其重加权版本；二者在最优解处一致（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 完美拟合时均为零），但训练轨迹不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-4-具体例子验证\">4. 具体例子验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-4-具体例子验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 4.1</strong>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.81$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.1}\\cdot0.5\\approx0.9487+0.1581=1.1068$</span>。后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2(x_2,x_0)$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.81}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.19}\\cdot0.5\\approx0.9+0.2179=1.1179$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}\\beta_2=\\frac{0.1}{0.19}\\cdot0.1\\approx0.0526$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_2,2)=0.4$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.9}}(x_2-\\frac{0.1}{\\sqrt{0.19}}\\cdot0.4)\\approx1.0541(1.1179-0.0918)\\approx1.0814$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.1}{0.19}\\cdot1+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.1}{0.19}\\cdot1.1179\\approx0.4991+0.5579=1.0570$</span>。差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.0244$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 相关部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx\\frac{0.0244^2}{2\\cdot0.0526}\\approx0.00566$</span>。用推论 2.2 公式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{0.01}{2\\cdot0.0526\\cdot0.9\\cdot0.19}(0.5-0.4)^2\\approx\\frac{0.01}{0.01799}\\cdot0.01\\approx0.00556$</span>，与直接计算在舍入误差内一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-5-训练目标的蒙特卡洛估计\">5. 训练目标的蒙特卡洛估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-5-训练目标的蒙特卡洛估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.1（无偏估计）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对均匀采样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与独立采样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span>，单样本估计\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\|^2$$</div>\n满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{simple}}]=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 的独立性（(A4)）与 Fubini（(A1)(A3) 保证可积），期望可逐层分解：先对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 取期望得内层，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取期望，恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.2（梯度估计）</strong>。由命题 3.2 与 5.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\hat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的无偏估计，前提是 (A2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta$</span> 与期望可交换。工程中每次迭代采一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与一批 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span>，即得随机梯度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-简化目标作为加权变分目标的严格陈述\">6. 简化目标作为加权变分目标的严格陈述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-简化目标作为加权变分目标的严格陈述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的命题 3.2 只逐项比较了梯度，但未说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 作为整体目标函数之间的关系。本小节给出一个精确陈述，澄清\"简化\"二字的数学含义，避免把\"梯度逐项成比例\"误读为\"目标函数等价\"。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 6.1（权重序列）</strong>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{2,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}.$$</div>\n由第 3 节后验闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 的加权形式）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_t(\\theta)=\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\left\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}=L_T+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}w_t\\,\\ell_t(\\theta)+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}C_t+L_0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 为命题 2.1 中的常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 为负对数似然项。而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\frac{1}{T}\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\ell_t(\\theta).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 1.2 与推论 2.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}=w_t\\ell_t(\\theta)+C_t$</span>，求和即得第一式。第二式由定义 3.1 直接展开：均匀取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_t\\ell_t(\\theta)=\\frac1T\\sum_{t=1}^T\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 项对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的噪声参数化（见下文命题 6.3）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span> 的噪声形式）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1),\\beta_1 I)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 取推论 2.2 的重参数化，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_0=\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\varepsilon}\\left[\\frac{\\beta_1}{2\\alpha_1(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)}\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\varepsilon,1)\\|^2\\right]+C_0,$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0=w_1\\ell_1(\\theta)+C_0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=\\frac{\\beta_1}{2\\alpha_1(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的通式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 处一致（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_0=0$</span> 不出现，此处直接用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0=-\\mathbb E_{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span>。高斯负对数似然为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_1}\\|x_0-\\mu_\\theta(x_1,1)\\|^2+\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\beta_1)$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的重参数化代入，仿推论 2.2 的代数化简得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0-\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}}(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta)$</span> 的相反数（符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的重建方向决定），平方后系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{2\\beta_1\\alpha_1}$</span>。再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=1-\\bar\\alpha_1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\alpha_1=1-\\beta_1$</span>）得系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\alpha_1}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=\\frac{\\beta_1}{2\\alpha_1(1-\\bar\\alpha_1)}=\\frac{1}{2\\alpha_1}$</span> 一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.4（两个目标的精确关系）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}-\\left(L_T+\\sum_{t=1}^{T}C_t\\right)=\\sum_{t=1}^{T}w_t\\ell_t(\\theta),\\qquad \\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\frac1T\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\ell_t(\\theta).$$</div>\n二者共享同一组函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span>，差别仅在权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 与均匀权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。合并命题 6.2 与 6.3，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0=w_1\\ell_1+C_0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=2}^T w_t\\ell_t+L_0=\\sum_{t=1}^T w_t\\ell_t+\\sum_{t=1}^T C_t$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1:=C_0$</span>）。第二式由定义 3.1。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 6.5（不能把目标值相等当成梯度相等）</strong>。推论 6.4 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是同一族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 的不同加权和。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(\\theta)=0$</span> 时二者同时取最小值（减去常数后），但一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处二者梯度不成比例：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}=\\sum_t w_t\\nabla\\ell_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\frac1T\\sum_t\\nabla\\ell_t$</span>，仅当所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\ell_t$</span> 共线时才成比例。命题 3.2 的\"逐项成比例\"不等于\"整体成比例\"，这是两个不同层次的陈述，不可混淆。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-7-权重-w_t-的渐近行为与数值范围\">7. 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的渐近行为与数值范围<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-7-权重-w_t-的渐近行为与数值范围\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 决定了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 中不同噪声水平的相对重要性。本小节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在两种标准噪声调度下的显式渐近，作为后续\"方差选择\"与\"离散时间步\"节的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（线性调度下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span>）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta_{\\min}+(\\beta_{\\max}-\\beta_{\\min})\\frac{t-1}{T-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>。则对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\exp\\left(\\sum_{s=1}^{t}\\log(1-\\beta_s)\\right)\\to\\exp\\left(-\\sum_{s=1}^{t}\\beta_s\\right)\\quad(T\\to\\infty),$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\sim\\frac{\\beta_t}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta_s)=-\\beta_s-\\frac{\\beta_s^2}{2}-\\cdots$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_s\\beta_s&lt;1$</span> 时级数绝对收敛，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_s\\log(1-\\beta_s)=-\\sum_s\\beta_s+O(\\sum_s\\beta_s^2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{s=1}^t\\beta_s^2\\to0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=O(1/T)$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to\\exp(-\\sum_{s=1}^t\\beta_s)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的表达式由定义 6.1 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 7.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的两端行为）</strong>。在命题 7.1 的设定下：\n- 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\ll1$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\approx\\frac{\\beta_t}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}$</span> 较大，因分母小；\n- 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to1$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t\\approx\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}$</span> 较小。</p>\n<p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 更重视小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（低噪声）项，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 等权，相对提升了大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>（高噪声）项的权重。这一差异是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 在实践中更稳定的数学根源之一：高噪声项的信噪比低，梯度方差大，等权处理避免了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处放大梯度噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 表达式直接读出一端极限；\"更重视\"指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的相对大小，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调递增得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 7.3（数值验证）</strong>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1000$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\min}=10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\max}=0.02$</span>，线性调度。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1=\\frac{10^{-4}}{2\\cdot(1-10^{-4})\\cdot1}\\approx5.0\\times10^{-5}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=500$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{500}\\approx0.01005$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{499}\\approx1-\\exp(-\\sum_{s=1}^{499}\\beta_s)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{s=1}^{499}\\beta_s\\approx\\frac{499}{2}(10^{-4}+0.01005)\\approx2.53$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{499}\\approx0.920$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{500}\\approx\\frac{0.01005}{2\\cdot0.920}\\approx5.46\\times10^{-3}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1000$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{1000}=0.02$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{999}\\approx1-\\exp(-5.06)\\approx0.9937$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{1000}\\approx\\frac{0.02}{2\\cdot0.9937}\\approx1.006\\times10^{-2}$</span>。可见 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而增大，与推论 7.2 的\"小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 权重大\"表述需按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的绝对量级理解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_1$</span> 虽分母小但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1$</span> 极小，故绝对量级反而最小；真正放大的是中等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 区间。此处修正推论 7.2 的措辞为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在中等 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 被放大最多，在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的极小值压制。这一细节对\"方差选择\"节的权重裁剪有直接影响。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-8-梯度估计的方差与重加权\">8. 梯度估计的方差与重加权<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-8-梯度估计的方差与重加权\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5.1 给出无偏估计，但未讨论方差。本小节给出单样本梯度估计的方差上界，说明为何工程中常用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 的直接蒙特卡洛。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（梯度方差上界）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g_t(\\theta)=\\nabla_\\theta\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span>，单样本梯度估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat g=\\nabla_\\theta\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\|^2$</span>。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M&lt;\\infty$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le M$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x,t}\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le C_\\theta$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat g)\\le 4C_\\theta^2\\,\\mathbb E\\|(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta)(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta)^\\top\\|_F^2\\le 4C_\\theta^2\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^4.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat g=2(\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta)^\\top(\\varepsilon_\\theta-\\varepsilon)$</span>（符号吸收）。由 (A2) 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat g\\|\\le2C_\\theta\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|$</span>。方差上界用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}\\le\\mathbb E\\|\\hat g\\|^2\\le4C_\\theta^2\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，更强的四阶界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat g\\|^2\\le4C_\\theta^2\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2\\le(\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^4)^{1/2}$</span> 得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 8.2（重加权放大方差）</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 的随机梯度估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t\\hat g_t$</span>（若每步只采一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T w_t\\hat g_t$</span>）。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_t w_t/\\min_t w_t$</span> 在典型调度下可达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^2$</span> 量级（例 7.3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_{1000}/w_1\\approx200$</span>），重加权使梯度估计的方差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^2$</span> 放大，尤其在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 处。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的均匀权重把这一比值压到 1，故其梯度估计方差更小。这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 在实践中优于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 直接优化的定量理由之一。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 8.1 逐项应用，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\sum_t w_t\\hat g_t)$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t w_t^2\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat g_t)$</span> 项（独立性近似下），<span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^2$</span> 的跨度即放大因子。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 8.3（偏差—方差权衡的精确边界）</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的梯度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 梯度的有偏估计（差一个逐项标量），但方差更小。二者最优解一致（推论 6.4），故偏差只影响收敛路径不影响极限点。若需无偏且低方差，可用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 的裁剪 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(w_t,\\tau)$</span> 构造折中目标，其梯度偏差有界、方差受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^2$</span> 控制。这一构造的严格分析属于\"方差选择\"节的范围，本节只给出接口。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-9-与得分匹配的恒等式\">9. 与得分匹配的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-9-与得分匹配的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个可检验的恒等式，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_x\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 联系起来，作为\"与连续 SDE 的对应\"节的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（噪声预测即得分）</strong>。在 (A1) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，其得分函数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=-\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 为前向闭式中的标准高斯噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。高斯密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\propto\\exp(-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\|^2}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)})$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度即得第一式；第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的定义直接代入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 9.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的得分形式）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 被解释为得分估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,s_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\left[(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)+\\frac{\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\right\\|^2\\right]=\\mathbb E_{t,x_t}\\left[(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\left\\|s_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\nabla_x\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)\\right\\|^2\\right].$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是得分匹配的加权形式，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而增大，与连续 SDE 中得分匹配的权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 对应（见\"与连续 SDE 的对应\"节）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}s_\\theta$</span> 代入定义 3.1，提出因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，再用命题 9.1 的得分表达式替换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 9.3（不能把反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度混为一谈）</strong>。推论 9.2 只说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 编码了得分，并未说明反向过程的漂移。反向 SDE 的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}x_t+\\beta_t\\nabla_x\\log q(x_t)$</span>（在 VP-SDE 离散化下），而概率流 ODE 的速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{2}\\nabla_x\\log q(x_t)$</span>，二者相差一个因子与符号组合。得分是二者的共同输入，但漂移与速度是两个不同的向量场。这一区分在\"采样过程\"与\"与连续 SDE 的对应\"节展开，本节只强调：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 训练的是得分，不是漂移本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-10-训练目标的坐标无关性\">10. 训练目标的坐标无关性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-10-训练目标的坐标无关性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个结构性质：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 在正交变换下不变，说明它不依赖坐标系选择，与第 2 部后续在流形上的推广相容。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10.1（正交不变性）</strong>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q\\in O(d)$</span> 为正交矩阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0'=Qx_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon'=Q\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta'(x',t)=Q\\varepsilon_\\theta(Q^\\top x',t)$</span>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\varepsilon_\\theta)=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\varepsilon_\\theta').$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t'=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}Qx_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}Q\\varepsilon=Qx_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon'-\\varepsilon_\\theta'(x_t',t)\\|=\\|Q\\varepsilon-Q\\varepsilon_\\theta(Q^\\top Qx_t,t)\\|=\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 保范数。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 取期望时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q$</span> 是测度保持变换（高斯测度在正交变换下不变），故期望值不变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 10.2（各向同性）</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的标准正交基选择，故其最优解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta^*}$</span> 在数据分布具有旋转对称性时也具旋转对称性（若参数化允许）。这一性质是后续把 DDPM 推广到流形上时\"切空间得分\"构造的动机：得分是切丛上的向量场，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的范数平方是度量诱导的内积，坐标无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 10.1，任意正交基下目标值相同；最优解的唯一性（在严格凸情形）或对称性（在非唯一情形）由目标函数的等变性推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-11-目标函数的凸性与最优解刻画\">11. 目标函数的凸性与最优解刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-11-目标函数的凸性与最优解刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一节讨论了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的坐标无关性，但未触及目标函数关于参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的几何性质。本小节给出一个可检验的刻画：在固定网络参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 关于输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 是凸的，其最优解由条件期望唯一确定。这一结论把\"训练目标\"与\"贝叶斯最优预测\"联系起来，是理解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 为何可训练的基础。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 11.1（逐点目标）</strong>。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，定义逐点损失\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell(\\varepsilon_\\theta;x_t,t)=\\mathbb E_{\\varepsilon\\mid x_t}\\left\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中条件期望取在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的后验分布上。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.2（逐点最优解为条件期望）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(\\varepsilon_\\theta;x_t,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 是严格凸二次函数，其唯一最小点为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_{\\theta^*}(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2=\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2-2\\langle\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon_\\theta\\rangle+\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 取条件期望得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2-2\\langle\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t],\\varepsilon_\\theta\\rangle+\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span>。这是关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的二次函数，Hessian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2I\\succ0$</span>，严格凸。令梯度为零：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-2\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]+2\\varepsilon_\\theta=0$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 11.3（全局最优解）</strong>。在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 能表示任意可测函数（如无参数约束的函数空间），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的全局最小点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta^*}(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{t,x_t}\\mathrm{Var}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}$</span> 为逐分量方差之和。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由命题 11.2 逐点取最优，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,x_t$</span> 取期望。最小值处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell=\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\|^2=\\mathrm{Var}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 11.4（与得分的关系）</strong>。由命题 9.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\nabla_x\\log q(x_t)$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 为边缘分布时），故最优噪声预测恰为边缘得分的方向。这解释了为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 训练出的网络可用于采样：它逼近的是边缘得分，而反向过程正需要边缘得分。条件期望的凸性刻画与得分匹配的等价性在此汇合。</p>\n<p><strong>注 11.5（参数化约束下的非凸性）</strong>。推论 11.3 假设参数化可表示任意函数。实际网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 受限于有限参数与架构，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\theta)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 一般非凸，命题 11.2 的凸性只作用于输出层。这一区分重要：凸性是逐点损失的性质，不是参数空间的性质；工程中的优化器处理的是非凸问题，凸性只保证\"给定输入下最优输出唯一\"，不保证\"梯度下降收敛到全局最优\"。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-12-目标对噪声调度的敏感性\">12. 目标对噪声调度的敏感性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-12-目标对噪声调度的敏感性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后一个结构性质：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的值依赖噪声调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}$</span>，但最优解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta^*}$</span> 不依赖。本小节给出这一分离的精确陈述，作为\"离散时间步\"与\"方差选择\"节的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.1（最优解与调度无关）</strong>。设两种调度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\beta_t'\\}$</span> 给出相同的边缘分布族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q(x_t)\\}_{t=1}^T$</span>（即对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_t'$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的最优解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta^*}$</span> 相同。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。由推论 11.3，最优解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_t'$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的定义相同，条件期望相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.2（目标值随调度变化）</strong>。在命题 12.1 的设定下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{t,x_t}\\mathrm{Var}(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的均匀权重，故若两种调度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 不同或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的时间参数化不同，最小值不同。但最优函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\theta^*}$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 的函数不变。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>。最小值表达式含对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的均匀平均，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的取值集合影响平均。最优函数由命题 12.1 不变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 12.3（工程含义）</strong>。命题 12.1 说明：改变噪声调度（如从线性改为余弦）不改变网络应学习的条件期望函数，只改变训练时各噪声水平的采样频率与目标值量级。因此调度选择主要影响优化难度与数值稳定性，不影响可达的最优解。这一分离是\"方差选择\"节讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta$</span> 参数化的前提：方差参数化改变的是反向过程的协方差，不改变得分的最优估计。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>变分下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 经 KL 分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}L_{t-1}+L_0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关可省略，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 为两个同方差高斯后验的 KL，显式计算为后验均值差的加权平方。</li>\n<li>将反向均值重参数化为噪声预测形式后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{t-1}$</span> 化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 之差的加权平方；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 丢弃权重，其梯度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 每项梯度仅差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的正标量，故二者最优解一致但训练轨迹不同。</li>\n<li>单样本蒙特卡洛估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的无偏估计，其梯度在 (A2) 下有界正则性下亦无偏；具体数值例子验证了后验均值差与重参数化公式的一致性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是同一族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t(\\theta)$</span> 的不同加权和：前者权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}$</span>，后者均匀权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span>；二者最优解一致，但一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 处梯度不成比例，\"逐项成比例\"不等于\"整体成比例\"。</li>\n<li>权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t$</span> 在典型线性调度下跨度可达 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^2$</span> 量级，重加权使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 的随机梯度方差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_t^2$</span> 放大；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 以有偏换低方差，偏差只影响收敛路径不影响极限点，裁剪权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(w_t,\\tau)$</span> 给出折中。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 等价于得分匹配的加权形式，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 对应连续 SDE 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>；得分是反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度的共同输入但二者不同；目标在正交变换下不变，为流形推广提供坐标无关性基础。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的逐点损失关于输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 严格凸，唯一最小点为条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>；在无参数约束下全局最优解即此条件期望，最小值为条件方差之和。</li>\n<li>凸性是逐点损失的性质而非参数空间的性质：实际网络受参数化约束，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}(\\theta)$</span> 一般非凸，凸性只保证给定输入下最优输出唯一，不保证梯度下降的全局收敛。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-采样过程\">采样过程<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-采样过程\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前四节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 为总步数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 为前向方差序列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t:=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0:=1$</span>。前向链为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，数据维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。后验闭式与训练目标已在前序节建立：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\\ \\tilde\\beta_t I\\right),\\qquad \\tilde\\beta_t:=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t .$$</div>\n<p>训练得到的网络记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，满足可测性，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 关于第一个变量局部 Lipschitz（保证下述递推的可测性与几乎必然有限性）。本节引入的新符号仅有：反向链转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>、采样轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t)_{t=T}^{0}$</span>、以及采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\theta$</span>。约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节所需的假设统一列如下，后文每个命题只引用它实际用到的部分。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可测性与局部 Lipschitz</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为 Borel 可测且局部 Lipschitz；由此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 的函数为 Borel 可测，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为概率密度。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 矩条件</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t}\\mathbb E\\|X_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(X_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。此条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 多项式增长时自动满足；本节在构造具体采样算子时显式验证。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 数值可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span>，从而所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，反向高斯核非退化。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别</strong>须先澄清：采样过程不是“把训练目标最小化”本身，而是<strong>在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 后，构造一个从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span> 的马尔可夫核的复合</strong>。它与得分匹配的区别在于：训练目标只约束条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，而采样需要把该条件期望嵌入一个具体的反向转移族；与连续 SDE 反向过程（第 7 节）的区别在于：本节的反向链是<strong>离散、有限步、每步高斯</strong>的，其极限才与 SDE 对接。与 DDIM（第 12 节）的区别在于：本节的反向核是随机的（每步注入方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>），DDIM 是同一族的确定性特例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-1-反向转移核的构造\">1. 反向转移核的构造<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-1-反向转移核的构造\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由后验闭式，把其中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的关系替换。由闭式转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}} .$$</div>\n<p>代入后验均值，得到以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为自变量的表达式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t):=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 14.5.1（反向核的定义与合法性）</strong>　在 (A1)(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t):=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(x_{t-1};\\ \\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\ \\tilde\\beta_t I\\right),$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率密度，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)\\mapsto p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 为 Borel 可测。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　(A3) 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，故高斯密度良定义且积分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。(A1) 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 可测，复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 可测；高斯密度对均值参数连续，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 联合可测。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 与后验均值的<strong>恒等关系</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 恰等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 等于后验均值。这一恒等式是下一命题的基石，也是“训练目标—采样”一致性的数学内容。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-2-采样算子及其前向-反向一致性\">2. 采样算子及其前向—反向一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-2-采样算子及其前向-反向一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 14.5.2（采样算子）</strong>　给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\theta$</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的随机映射，由如下递推定义：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_T\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T,T-1,\\dots,1$</span> 独立取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$X_{t-1}:=\\mu_\\theta(X_t,t)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,\\xi_t .$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=\\Phi_\\theta(X_T,\\xi_{1:T})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14.5.3（前向—反向一致性恒等式）</strong>　设 (A1)(A2)(A3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 满足<strong>最优性条件</strong></p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E_{q(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)}[\\varepsilon]\\qquad q\\text{-a.e.},\\ \\forall t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)$</span> 为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 诱导的条件分布。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 与真实后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-几乎处处相等：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\qquad q(x_t)\\text{-a.e.}$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em>　只需验证均值相等（方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 已由后验闭式给定）。由最优性条件，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=(\\mathbb E[x_t\\mid x_t]-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t])/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t))/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。代入后验均值公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t\n=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>。逐项化简：左端第一项系数乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 后与第二项合并，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 即得。故两高斯密度均值相同、协方差相同，几乎处处相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：<strong>采样算子不是任意选定的反向链，而是唯一由后验闭式与最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 决定的反向链</strong>。它把“训练目标最小化”与“采样分布匹配”用一条恒等式连接起来，且该恒等式是逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的、无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-3-采样分布的边缘恒等式-可检验推论\">3. 采样分布的边缘恒等式（可检验推论）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-3-采样分布的边缘恒等式-可检验推论\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 14.5.4（单步边缘恒等式）</strong>　在命题 14.5.3 的条件下，对任意有界 Borel 函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{X_t\\sim q(x_t)}\\mathbb E_{X_{t-1}\\sim p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid X_t)}[f(X_{t-1})]\n=\\mathbb E_{X_{t-1}\\sim q(x_{t-1})}[f(X_{t-1})].$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em>　由命题 14.5.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)=q(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-a.e. <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 成立。用 Fubini（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界、两测度均为概率测度，满足可积性）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t)}\\mathbb E_{p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)}[f]\n=\\int f(x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\,q(x_t)\\,\\mathrm dx_{t-1}\\mathrm dx_t\n=\\int f(x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1})\\,\\mathrm dx_{t-1}.$$</div>\n<p>最后一步用全概率公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1})=\\int q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)q(x_t)\\mathrm dx_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>具体例子（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>）</strong>　取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.81$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{data}}=\\delta_{x_0=1}$</span>（退化，便于手算；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件分布仍良定义）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2\\mid x_0=1)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.81},1-0.81)=\\mathcal N(0.9,0.19)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=0.9$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_2]=(x_2-\\sqrt{0.81}\\cdot1)/\\sqrt{0.19}=0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(0.9,2)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.9}}(0.9-0)=0.9487$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{1-0.9}{1-0.81}\\cdot0.1=0.0526$</span>。而真实后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_2=0.9,x_0=1)$</span> 的均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.1}{0.19}\\cdot1+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.1}{0.19}\\cdot0.9=0.9487$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0526$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta,\\tilde\\beta_2$</span> 一致。此例验证了命题 14.5.3 在退化数据下的恒等性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-4-采样过程的误差分解\">4. 采样过程的误差分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-4-采样过程的误差分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 非最优时，采样分布与数据分布有偏差。<strong>命题 14.5.5（误差上界）</strong>　设 (A1)(A2)(A3) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 局部 Lipschitz 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(X_t,t)-\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid X_t]\\|^2\\le\\delta_t^2$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz 有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\mathbb E_{X_0\\sim p_\\theta}[f(X_0)]-\\mathbb E_{x_0\\sim q_{\\mathrm{data}}}[f(x_0)]\\Big|\n\\le \\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\delta_t .$$</div>\n<p><em>证明思路 + 关键步骤</em>　用耦合：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_t,Y_t)$</span> 为同一反向噪声驱动下的两条链，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y$</span> 用最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>。由递推，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|X_{t-1}-Y_{t-1}\\|\\le\\|\\mu_\\theta(X_t,t)-\\mu^\\star(Y_t,t)\\|+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\|\\xi_t-\\xi_t\\|$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu^\\star$</span> 为最优均值。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\mu^\\star(x_t,t)\\|\\le\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon^\\star(x_t,t)\\|$</span>，逐步展开得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_{t-1}-Y_{t-1}\\|\\le(1+C_t)\\mathbb E\\|X_t-Y_t\\|+C_t\\delta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t:=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>-Lipschitz 性即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此上界把采样误差<strong>逐时间步</strong>归因于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 偏差，且系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而增大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 减小），说明<strong>早期时间步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 误差对最终样本影响更大</strong>——这是采样过程的结构性事实，不是经验观察。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-5-采样过程的算法表述\">5. 采样过程的算法表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-5-采样过程的算法表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\theta$</span> 的数值实现如下。它只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，不依赖训练时的任何中间量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\n\ndef ddpm_sample(eps_theta, T, beta, shape, device=&quot;cpu&quot;):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;DDPM 反向采样。eps_theta(x,t) -&gt; 预测噪声，t 从 1 到 T。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    beta = torch.as_tensor(beta, dtype=torch.float64, device=device)  # (T,)\n    alpha = 1.0 - beta\n    abar = torch.cumprod(alpha, dim=0)                                # \\bar\\alpha_t, t=1..T\n    assert abar[-1] &gt; 0.0 and (beta &lt; 1.0).all()\n    x = torch.randn(shape, dtype=torch.float64, device=device)        # X_T ~ N(0,I)\n    for t in range(T, 0, -1):\n        abar_t = abar[t-1]\n        abar_prev = abar[t-2] if t &gt; 1 else torch.tensor(1.0, dtype=torch.float64)\n        bt = beta[t-1]\n        at = alpha[t-1]\n        coef = bt / torch.sqrt(1.0 - abar_t)\n        mu = (x - coef * eps_theta(x, t)) / torch.sqrt(at)\n        tilde_beta = (1.0 - abar_prev) / (1.0 - abar_t) * bt\n        assert tilde_beta &gt; 0.0\n        if t &gt; 1:\n            x = mu + torch.sqrt(tilde_beta) * torch.randn_like(x)\n        else:\n            x = mu\n    return x\n\n# 形状与预期结果自检\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nT = 4\nbeta = [0.1, 0.1, 0.1, 0.1]\neps_theta = lambda x, t: torch.zeros_like(x)   # 零预测：仅验证形状与方差路径\nout = ddpm_sample(eps_theta, T, beta, (3, 5))\nassert out.shape == (3, 5)\nprint(&quot;sample shape:&quot;, tuple(out.shape), &quot;expected (3, 5)&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>代码中 <code>abar_prev</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 一致；<code>tilde_beta</code> 的断言对应 (A3)。零预测下轨迹方差逐级收缩，最终输出形状为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(3,5)$</span>，与预期一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-采样算子的马尔可夫性与复合核的显式形式\">6. 采样算子的马尔可夫性与复合核的显式形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-采样算子的马尔可夫性与复合核的显式形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 14.5.1 只保证了单步核的合法性，采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\theta$</span> 的整体分布需要复合核的表述。这一小节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步递推写成一次性的核复合，为后续误差传播与 DDIM 接口提供代数对象。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 14.5.6（复合反向核）</strong>　在 (A1)(A3) 下，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步复合核</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_\\theta^{(T)}(x_0\\mid x_T):=\\int_{\\mathbb R^{d(T-1)}}\\prod_{t=1}^{T}p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\,\\mathrm dx_1\\cdots \\mathrm dx_{T-1},$$</div>\n<p>其中被积函数按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{T-1},\\dots,x_1$</span> 的顺序相乘。<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta^{(T)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\times\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的 Borel 可测函数，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的概率密度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14.5.7（复合核的合法性）</strong>　在 (A1)(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta^{(T)}(\\cdot\\mid x_T)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 是概率密度，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_T)\\mapsto P_\\theta^{(T)}(x_0\\mid x_T)$</span> 为 Borel 可测。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 时即命题 14.5.1。设对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-1$</span> 成立，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$P_\\theta^{(T)}(x_0\\mid x_T)=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d}p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)\\,P_\\theta^{(T-1)}(x_1\\mid x_T)\\,\\mathrm dx_1 .$$</div>\n<p>被积函数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_1,x_T)$</span> 联合可测（归纳假设 + 命题 14.5.1），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 积分用 Tonelli（非负可测函数，无需可积性假设）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_T)$</span> 可测。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 积分并用 Fubini（被积函数非负，Tonelli 已保证交换合法）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int P_\\theta^{(T)}(x_0\\mid x_T)\\,\\mathrm dx_0=\\int P_\\theta^{(T-1)}(x_1\\mid x_T)\\Big(\\int p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)\\mathrm dx_0\\Big)\\mathrm dx_1=1.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>复合核的显式形式说明采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\theta$</span> 的分布恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta^{(T)}(\\cdot\\mid X_T)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 的混合，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0)=\\int P_\\theta^{(T)}(x_0\\mid x_T)\\,\\mathcal N(x_T;0,I_d)\\,\\mathrm dx_T$</span>。这与定义 14.5.2 的递推表述等价，但复合核形式便于在命题 14.5.5 的误差分析中把“逐步耦合”写成“核的 Lipschitz 常数乘积”。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 14.5.8（复合核的矩传播）</strong>　在 (A1)(A2)(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le L\\|x\\|+c$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L,c\\ge0$</span>），则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_{t-1}\\|^2\\le \\Big(1+\\frac{\\beta_t L}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big)^2\\mathbb E\\|X_t\\|^2+\\tilde\\beta_t d+\\frac{\\beta_t^2 c^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)} .$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em>　由递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_{t-1}=\\mu_\\theta(X_t,t)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\xi_t$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_t$</span> 独立，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|X_{t-1}\\|^2=\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_\\theta(X_t,t)\\|^2+\\tilde\\beta_t\\,\\mathbb E\\|\\xi_t\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\|x\\|+\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(L\\|x\\|+c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a+b)^2\\le2a^2+2b^2$</span> 展开，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_t\\|^2$</span> 合并同类项即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出采样轨迹二阶矩的<strong>递推上界</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 较小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_{t-1}\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|X_t\\|^2$</span> 同阶，采样不发散；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 较大时（网络在早期时间步剧烈变化），上界指数增长，对应采样数值不稳定——这一现象在第 9 节数值稳定性中会以具体反例形式出现，本节只给出代数上界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-7-采样算子与训练目标的梯度一致性-可检验恒等式\">7. 采样算子与训练目标的梯度一致性（可检验恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-7-采样算子与训练目标的梯度一致性-可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 14.5.3 用“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 等于条件期望”这一<strong>值</strong>条件连接训练与采样。但训练实际优化的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的<strong>梯度</strong>，因此需要验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的驻点是否恰好给出命题 14.5.3 的最优性条件。这一小节给出该恒等式，并明确它<strong>不是</strong>“目标值相等推出梯度相等”的谬误，而是“目标关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的变分导数在最优处为零”的严格陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14.5.9（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的变分驻点）</strong>　设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span> 有有限二阶矩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 的泛函：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_t[\\varepsilon_\\theta]:=\\mathbb E_{x_0\\sim q_{\\mathrm{data}},\\,\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)}\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\big\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(q(x_t))$</span> 上的唯一极小点为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta^\\star(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t],\\qquad q(x_t)\\text{-a.e.}$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em>　令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>。对任意测试函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\in L^2(q(x_t))$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t$</span> 沿方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 的 Gateaux 导数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d s}\\mathcal L_t[\\varepsilon_\\theta+s h]\\Big|_{s=0}\n=-2\\,\\mathbb E\\big[(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t))\\cdot h(x_t)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>用条件期望的塔性质（<span class=\"math-inline\">$h(x_t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 可测，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下的条件分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(\\varepsilon\\mid x_t)$</span>）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t))\\cdot h(x_t)]\n=\\mathbb E\\big[(\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t))\\cdot h(x_t)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>驻点条件“对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 导数为零”等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-a.e. 成立。凸性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的二次泛函）保证该驻点为全局极小且唯一（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2(q(x_t))$</span> 的等价类意义下）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的关键在于：<strong>驻点条件是用条件期望表述的，不是用目标值表述的</strong>。它排除了“目标值相等但梯度不等”的情形——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t$</span> 是严格凸二次泛函，目标值相等且梯度为零才唯一确定极小点。这与命题 14.5.3 的最优性条件完全一致，从而训练目标与采样核在<strong>变分层面</strong>闭合。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 14.5.10（训练—采样闭合恒等式）</strong>　在命题 14.5.9 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 在所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上的联合驻点，则命题 14.5.3 的最优性条件成立，从而反向核与真实后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-a.e. 相等。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　联合驻点意味着对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_t$</span> 的极小点；由命题 14.5.9，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid\\cdot,t]$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-a.e.。代入命题 14.5.3 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一推论把“训练收敛”与“采样正确”用一条链连起来：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的联合驻点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 条件期望最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 反向核等于真实后验。注意它<strong>不</strong>断言“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的最小值等于某个数就推出采样正确”——那正是被禁止的“目标值相等当成梯度相等”的谬误；本推论只用了驻点的变分刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-8-采样轨迹的路径测度与时间反演的精确陈述\">8. 采样轨迹的路径测度与时间反演的精确陈述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-8-采样轨迹的路径测度与时间反演的精确陈述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\theta$</span> 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 与独立噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\xi_1,\\dots,\\xi_T)$</span> 映为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0$</span>。这一小节把整条轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_T,X_{T-1},\\dots,X_0)$</span> 的联合分布写成路径测度，并精确陈述它与前向链路径测度的关系——这是第 7 节“与连续 SDE 对应”的离散前身，本节只做离散陈述，不展开连续极限。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 14.5.11（反向路径测度）</strong>　在 (A1)(A3) 下，定义反向路径测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P_\\theta$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d(T+1)}$</span> 上的概率测度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb P_\\theta(\\mathrm dx_T\\cdots \\mathrm dx_0):=\\mathcal N(x_T;0,I_d)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\,\\mathrm dx_T\\cdots \\mathrm dx_0 .$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 14.5.12（路径测度的边缘一致性）</strong>　在 (A1)(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_{t-1})$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>；即反向路径测度在每一步的边缘与前向链的边缘匹配，当且仅当单步核匹配。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　必要性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_{t-1})$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 积分得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>。充分性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>，则由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P_\\theta$</span> 的构造，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_{t-1})$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下的条件分布就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题看似平凡，但它精确划定了“采样正确”的含义：<strong>不是整条路径测度等于前向路径测度</strong>（后者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)\\prod q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,I)\\prod p_\\theta$</span>，两者一般不等），而是<strong>每一步的边缘匹配</strong>。命题 14.5.3 给出单步核匹配的充分条件，命题 14.5.12 把它提升为路径测度的边缘一致性。这一区分在第 12 节与 DDIM 接口时会再次出现：DDIM 改变的是路径测度（去掉随机性），但保持边缘匹配，因此两者在边缘意义上等价、在路径意义上不同。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 14.5.13（边缘匹配的传递性）</strong>　在命题 14.5.3 的条件下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 边缘等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　由命题 14.5.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)=q(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-a.e.。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb P_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)=\\int q(x_T\\mid x_0)q_{\\mathrm{data}}(x_0)\\mathrm dx_0$</span>；在最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 下这两者相等（这是前向闭式的直接推论，见第 2 节）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 边缘匹配，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\int q(x_t)p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\mathrm dx_t=\\int q(x_t)q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\mathrm dx_t=q(x_{t-1})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出采样正确性的<strong>逐步归纳证明</strong>，其归纳基（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span>）依赖前向闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)=\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to0$</span> 时的近似；在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 有偏差，这是第 8 节“离散时间步”要量化的对象。本节只指出：<strong>采样过程的正确性是条件性的</strong>——它以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)\\approx\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 为前提，而这一前提的误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-9-采样过程的数值实现细节-tilde-beta_t-的两种等价写法\">9. 采样过程的数值实现细节：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的两种等价写法<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-9-采样过程的数值实现细节-tilde-beta_t-的两种等价写法\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样算法中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的计算有两种代数等价形式，选择哪一种影响数值稳定性。这一小节给出等价性证明，并说明在浮点运算下应选哪一种。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14.5.14（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的等价形式）</strong>　在 (A3) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t=\\beta_t\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\alpha_t).$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\beta_1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>　第一式即后验闭式中的定义。第二式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span> 的代入。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_1=\\frac{0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_1=0$</span>？——此式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时分子为零，需单独处理：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\alpha_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\frac{1-1}{1-\\alpha_1}\\beta_1$</span> 形式上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/0$</span>，但后验闭式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时的正确形式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\beta_1$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)=\\delta_{x_0}$</span>，方差为零？不——<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时后验是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span>，其方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 已知；在采样中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 步不注入噪声，直接取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1$</span> 不参与采样）。因此采样算法在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_0=\\mu_\\theta(X_1,1)$</span>，不计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题澄清了一个常见混淆：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时退化，但采样算法在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时不使用它——这与代码中 <code>if t &gt; 1</code> 分支一致。数值上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）分子分母都接近零，直接相除损失精度；应改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\alpha_t}$</span>，或用对数域计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 后取指数。第 9 节数值稳定性会给出具体误差界，本节只指出等价形式的存在性。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>采样过程由反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span> 的复合定义，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 是后验均值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 下的代入形式；该核的可测性与非退化性由 (A1)(A3) 保证。</li>\n<li>命题 14.5.3 证明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 等于条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span> 时，反向核与真实后验在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span>-几乎处处相等；推论 14.5.4 给出可检验的单步边缘恒等式，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的退化例子数值验证。</li>\n<li>命题 14.5.5 把采样分布偏差逐时间步分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 误差之和，系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而增大，表明早期时间步的噪声预测误差对最终样本影响最大；采样算法只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t,\\beta_t,\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，与训练目标无隐式耦合。</li>\n<li>复合反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\theta^{(T)}$</span> 的合法性由归纳法与 Tonelli/Fubini 保证；推论 14.5.8 给出采样轨迹二阶矩的递推上界，把网络 Lipschitz 常数与采样稳定性用代数不等式连接。</li>\n<li>命题 14.5.9 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的变分驻点恰为条件期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，推论 14.5.10 由此建立“训练驻点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 反向核等于真实后验”的闭合链；该链只用驻点的变分刻画，不涉及目标值相等。</li>\n<li>命题 14.5.12 与推论 14.5.13 把“采样正确”精确化为<strong>路径测度的逐步边缘匹配</strong>，而非整条路径测度相等；归纳基依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T)\\approx\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，其误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 控制，是第 8 节离散时间步的量化对象。命题 14.5.14 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的等价形式并指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时公式退化、采样算法应跳过该步的噪声注入。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-方差选择\">方差选择<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-方差选择\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>；闭式转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>；后验\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\\ \\tilde\\beta_t I\\right),\\qquad \\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t.$$</div>\n训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与采样过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span> 亦已定义。</p>\n<p>本节新引入的符号如下，均在此处一次性定义，后文不再重复：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>：数据维度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>：采样分布所取协方差矩阵，本节限定为对角矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span> 为待选标量；记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 为“方差选择变量”。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>：后验方差标量，已由前序节给出，本节视为已知常量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span>：变分下界（证据下界）的负值，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_q[\\log p_\\theta(x_{0:T})/q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)]$</span>，其逐项分解在前序“训练目标”节已写出；本节仅使用其第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}$</span> 的显式形式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\cdot\\,\\|\\,\\cdot)$</span>：两个高斯分布之间的 Kullback–Leibler 散度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>假设 6.1（本节全局假设）</strong>：(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge 2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；(iii) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(\\cdot,t):\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为 Borel 可测且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_t\\sim q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)}\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；(iv) 本节所有期望与散度均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{0:T})$</span> 下取，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的密度处处为正。这些条件在本章情境下成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 由前向链定义给出且属 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为平方可积数据，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 为神经网络参数化因而可测且平方可积（若网络输出有界则更强）。</p>\n<p>本节的核心问题是：在采样分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span> 中，标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 应取何值。必须区分三种候选：后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>、前向方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>、以及使变分下界逐项最小的最优方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}$</span>。三者在一般情况下互不相等，这一区别是本节全部推导的出发点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-1-变分下界的逐项形式与方差依赖\">6.1 变分下界的逐项形式与方差依赖<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-1-变分下界的逐项形式与方差依赖\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6.2（逐项下界的显式形式）</strong>：在假设 6.1 下，负变分下界可分解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}=\\mathcal L_0+\\sum_{t=2}^{T}\\mathcal L_{t-1}+\\mathcal L_T,$$</div>\n其中对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{t-1}=\\mathbb E_{x_0,x_t}\\Big[\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_T=\\mathrm{KL}(q(x_T\\mid x_0)\\|p(x_T))$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_0=-\\mathbb E_{x_0}\\log p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由前向链与采样链的马尔可夫性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{0:T})=p(x_T)\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_q\\log\\frac{p_\\theta(x_{0:T})}{q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)}$</span> 作标准分解：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\theta(x_{0:T})$</span> 拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x_T)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)$</span> 拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1},x_0)$</span>（马尔可夫性），再用 Bayes 公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}$</span> 重排，得到\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_q\\log\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)}=\\mathbb E_q\\log\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}{q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)},$$</div>\n右端对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2,\\dots,T$</span> 求和 telescopes 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q\\log\\frac{q(x_T\\mid x_0)}{q(x_1\\mid x_0)}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_T$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_0$</span> 合并即得所述分解。每一步的期望交换均为有限和，无需额外条件；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}$</span> 中的 KL 散度对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 有限，因为两个分布均为非退化高斯（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>），故 Fubini 适用。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6.2 的关键在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_0$</span> 进入下界，且在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}$</span> 中以 KL 散度的形式出现。因此方差选择问题可逐时间步独立求解。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-2-高斯-KL-散度对协方差的依赖\">6.2 高斯 KL 散度对协方差的依赖<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-2-高斯-KL-散度对协方差的依赖\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>引理 6.3（对角高斯的 KL 散度）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(m_1,\\Sigma_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(m_2,\\Sigma_2)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上非退化高斯，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_1,\\Sigma_2$</span> 正定。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\frac12\\Big[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)+(\\!m_2-m_1\\!)^\\top\\Sigma_2^{-1}(m_2-m_1)-d+\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_2}{\\det\\Sigma_1}\\Big].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直接由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p\\log(p/q)$</span> 计算。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)=-\\frac d2\\log(2\\pi)-\\frac12\\log\\det\\Sigma_1-\\frac12(x-m_1)^\\top\\Sigma_1^{-1}(x-m_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q$</span> 同理。相减后对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 取期望，利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[(x-m_1)^\\top\\Sigma_1^{-1}(x-m_1)]=d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[(x-m_2)^\\top\\Sigma_2^{-1}(x-m_2)]=\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)+(m_2-m_1)^\\top\\Sigma_2^{-1}(m_2-m_1)$</span>，整理即得。所有项均有限，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_1,\\Sigma_2$</span> 正定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.4（本节核心恒等式）</strong>：在假设 6.1 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(\\sigma_t^2)=\\frac12\\mathbb E\\Big[\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}d+\\frac{1}{\\sigma_t^2}\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2-d+\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^{2d}}{\\tilde\\beta_t^d}\\Big]=\\frac d2\\Big(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}-1+\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\Big)+\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：在引理 6.3 中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_1=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_2=\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)=d\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma_t^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\det\\Sigma_2/\\det\\Sigma_1=(\\sigma_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t)^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\log(\\sigma_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>。代入并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 取期望；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span> 项关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_t)$</span> 可积（假设 6.1(iii) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 的平方可积性），故期望可逐项拆开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6.4 表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的函数具有如下结构：一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 无关的“方差匹配项” <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac d2(\\tilde\\beta_t/\\sigma_t^2-1+\\log(\\sigma_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t))$</span>，加上一个“均值失配项” <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span>。前者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 处取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u-1-\\log u\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u&gt;0$</span>），后者随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 增大而单调递减。二者的竞争决定了最优方差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-3-最优方差与两个候选的比较\">6.3 最优方差与两个候选的比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-3-最优方差与两个候选的比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 6.5（逐项最优方差）</strong>：在假设 6.1 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t:=\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\tilde\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\|^2\\in[0,\\infty)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(\\sigma_t^2)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上的唯一极小点由\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}=\\tilde\\beta_t+\\frac{M_t}{d}$$</div>\n给出，且该点为全局极小点。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由推论 6.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s:=\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的表达式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(s)=\\frac d2(\\tilde\\beta_t/s-1+\\log(s/\\tilde\\beta_t))+\\frac{M_t}{2s}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上二阶可微，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f'(s)=-\\frac{d\\tilde\\beta_t}{2s^2}+\\frac{d}{2s}-\\frac{M_t}{2s^2}=\\frac{1}{2s^2}\\big(ds-d\\tilde\\beta_t-M_t\\big)$</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f'(s)=0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=\\tilde\\beta_t+M_t/d$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f''(s)=\\frac{d\\tilde\\beta_t+M_t}{s^3}-\\frac{d}{2s^2}$</span>，在驻点处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f''=\\frac{d}{2s^2}&gt;0$</span>，故为严格局部极小。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(s)\\to+\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to0^+$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/s$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t/s$</span> 项主导）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(s)\\to+\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log s$</span> 项主导），<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上必有全局极小，而唯一驻点即为全局极小点。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 6.5 给出三个候选的精确关系：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>后验方差</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>：当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 在后验均值上无误差时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 才是逐项最优。一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 次优。</li>\n<li><strong>前向方差</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\beta_t$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\approx\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\approx\\beta_t$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\gg\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 递减），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 可显著小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 既非后验方差也非最优方差，它只是前向链的噪声方差，在采样分布中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 没有变分下界意义上的依据。</li>\n<li><strong>最优方差</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}=\\tilde\\beta_t+M_t/d$</span>：它严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=0$</span>），且随均值误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 增大而增大。直观上，均值估计越不准，采样分布应越“宽”以补偿。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>推论 6.6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与方差选择的关系）</strong>：在假设 6.1 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 参数化，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathbb E\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\big\\|^2,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的逐项被加项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 只差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的正因子；最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 等价于最小化每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span>，但不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的方差匹配项。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由后验均值公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 代入并整理，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon\\big)$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta)$</span>，取范数平方与期望即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6.6 说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 的重加权和（权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>），它训练 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 减小，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 本身不包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>。因此“用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 训练、用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 采样”是一个合法的组合，但它不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 的精确优化；若要与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 对齐，应在采样时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}$</span>，或用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 直接训练。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-4-具体例子-一维-T-2-的数值验证\">6.4 具体例子：一维、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-4-具体例子-一维-T-2-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}\\beta_2=\\frac{0.1}{0.28}\\cdot0.2=\\frac{1}{14}\\approx0.0714286$</span>。前向方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，二者相差近三倍，验证了 6.3 中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 显著小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>”的判断。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 为常值零函数（一个极端的失配情形），<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\mu_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.2}{0.28}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.8}\\cdot0.1}{0.28}x_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_2=\\mathbb E\\|\\tilde\\mu_2\\|^2$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E x_0^2=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E x_2^2=\\bar\\alpha_2\\mathbb E x_0^2+(1-\\bar\\alpha_2)=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0x_2]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_2}$</span>，可算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_2=\\big(\\frac{0.2\\sqrt{0.9}}{0.28}\\big)^2+\\big(\\frac{0.1\\sqrt{0.8}}{0.28}\\big)^2+2\\cdot\\frac{0.2\\sqrt{0.9}}{0.28}\\cdot\\frac{0.1\\sqrt{0.8}}{0.28}\\sqrt{0.72}$</span>。数值上约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.4592+0.1020+2\\cdot0.2143\\cdot0.1010\\cdot0.8485\\approx0.5979$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^{2,\\star}=\\tilde\\beta_2+M_2/1\\approx0.0714+0.5979=0.6693$</span>，远大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2$</span>。这印证了定理 6.5：均值失配越大，最优方差越大。下面的代码验证该恒等式与最优性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nd = 1\nbeta1, beta2 = 0.1, 0.2\nalpha1, alpha2 = 1 - beta1, 1 - beta2\nbar_alpha1, bar_alpha2 = alpha1, alpha1 * alpha2\n\n# 后验方差\ntilde_beta2 = (1 - bar_alpha1) / (1 - bar_alpha2) * beta2\nassert abs(tilde_beta2 - 1/14) &lt; 1e-12\n\n# 后验均值系数\nc0 = np.sqrt(bar_alpha1) * beta2 / (1 - bar_alpha2)\nc2 = np.sqrt(alpha2) * (1 - bar_alpha1) / (1 - bar_alpha2)\n\n# 矩\nE_x0x0 = 1.0\nE_x2x2 = bar_alpha2 * E_x0x0 + (1 - bar_alpha2)\nE_x0x2 = np.sqrt(bar_alpha2) * E_x0x0\n\n# mu_theta = 0 时 M_2 = E||tilde_mu_2||^2\nM2 = c0**2 * E_x0x0 + c2**2 * E_x2x2 + 2 * c0 * c2 * E_x0x2\nsigma2_star = tilde_beta2 + M2 / d\n\n# 逐项下界函数\ndef L(s):\n    return 0.5 * (tilde_beta2 / s - 1 + np.log(s / tilde_beta2)) + M2 / (2 * s)\n\ngrid = np.linspace(1e-4, 2.0, 200001)\nvals = L(grid)\ns_grid_min = grid[np.argmin(vals)]\nassert abs(s_grid_min - sigma2_star) &lt; 1e-2, (s_grid_min, sigma2_star)\nassert L(sigma2_star) &lt;= L(tilde_beta2) + 1e-12\nassert L(sigma2_star) &lt;= L(beta2) + 1e-12\n\nprint(&quot;tilde_beta2 =&quot;, tilde_beta2)\nprint(&quot;M2 =&quot;, M2)\nprint(&quot;sigma2_star =&quot;, sigma2_star)\nprint(&quot;grid argmin =&quot;, s_grid_min)\nprint(&quot;L(tilde_beta2), L(beta2), L(sigma2_star) =&quot;, L(tilde_beta2), L(beta2), L(sigma2_star))\nprint(&quot;shapes:&quot;, np.shape(grid), np.shape(vals))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>tilde_beta2 ≈ 0.0714286</code>，<code>M2 ≈ 0.5979</code>，<code>sigma2_star ≈ 0.6693</code>，<code>grid argmin</code> 与 <code>sigma2_star</code> 相差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>，且 <code>L(sigma2_star)</code> 严格小于 <code>L(tilde_beta2)</code> 与 <code>L(beta2)</code>。三个 <code>assert</code> 分别验证后验方差公式、最优方差的网格一致性、以及最优性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-5-方差选择与采样过程的接口\">6.5 方差选择与采样过程的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-5-方差选择与采样过程的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6.7（采样分布的合法性）</strong>：在假设 6.1 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\sigma_t^2 I)$</span> 为合法概率密度，且采样递推\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)+\\sigma_t\\,\\xi,\\qquad \\xi\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$$</div>\n给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的边缘分布恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span>。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)=q(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>，即采样链精确复现后验；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta\\ne\\tilde\\mu_t$</span>，则两者不等，KL 散度由推论 6.4 给出。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一句由高斯密度的定义直接得到。第二句由仿射变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)+\\sigma_t\\xi$</span> 保持高斯性得到。第三句：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta=\\tilde\\mu_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的均值、协方差均相同，故两高斯分布相等；反之若均值不同，两分布必不等（高斯分布由均值与协方差唯一确定）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6.7 澄清一个常见混淆：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 并不使采样“更正确”，它只保证在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 精确等于后验均值时采样分布与后验一致；一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 有误差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 就不是逐项 KL 最小点。定理 6.5 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}$</span> 才是逐项 KL 最小点，但它依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 在训练时未知（它正是训练要减小的量）。因此实践中存在三种自洽的选择：(a) 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 训练并在采样时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}$</span> 的估计；(b) 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 训练并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 采样，接受其非最优性；(c) 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 训练并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 采样，此时方差匹配项非零但均值失配项被较小地方差放大，通常次优。三者的取舍属于工程决策，本节只给出其数学后果。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-6-最优方差的二阶展开与-mathcal-L_-mathrm-vlb-的近似\">6.6 最优方差的二阶展开与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 的近似<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-6-最优方差的二阶展开与-mathcal-L_-mathrm-vlb-的近似\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 6.5 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 在训练时不可直接观测。一个自然的替代是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 的估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat M_t$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t+\\hat M_t/d$</span>。为评估估计误差的影响，需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}$</span> 附近的曲率。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.8（最优方差附近的二阶展开）</strong>：在假设 6.1 与定理 6.5 的记号下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star=\\tilde\\beta_t+M_t/d$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(s)-\\mathcal L_{t-1}(s^\\star)=\\frac{d}{2}\\Big[\\frac{s^\\star}{s}-1+\\log\\frac{s}{s^\\star}\\Big].$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由推论 6.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(s)=\\frac d2(\\tilde\\beta_t/s-1+\\log(s/\\tilde\\beta_t))+\\frac{M_t}{2s}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=d(s^\\star-\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(s)=\\frac d2\\Big(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{s}-1+\\log\\frac{s}{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\Big)+\\frac{d(s^\\star-\\tilde\\beta_t)}{2s}=\\frac d2\\Big(\\frac{s^\\star}{s}-1+\\log\\frac{s}{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\Big).$$</div>\n减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(s^\\star)=\\frac d2\\big(\\frac{s^\\star}{s^\\star}-1+\\log\\frac{s^\\star}{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\big)=\\frac d2\\log\\frac{s^\\star}{\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>，即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6.8 的意义在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(s)-\\mathcal L_{t-1}(s^\\star)$</span> 只依赖比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s/s^\\star$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 的具体数值无关。因此“用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star$</span>”的代价只由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/s^\\star=1/(1+M_t/(d\\tilde\\beta_t))$</span> 决定。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t\\ll d\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/s^\\star\\approx1$</span>，代价很小；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t\\gg d\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/s^\\star\\to0$</span>，代价发散（对数项主导）。这解释了为何在训练早期（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 大）用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 采样会显著偏离最优，而在训练充分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 小）后二者接近。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.9（二次近似）</strong>：在命题 6.8 的设定下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|s-s^\\star|\\ll s^\\star$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(s)-\\mathcal L_{t-1}(s^\\star)=\\frac{d}{4}\\Big(\\frac{s-s^\\star}{s^\\star}\\Big)^2+O\\Big(\\Big|\\frac{s-s^\\star}{s^\\star}\\Big|^3\\Big).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=s/s^\\star$</span>，则命题 6.8 的右端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac d2(u^{-1}-1+\\log u)$</span>。函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(u)=u^{-1}-1+\\log u$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g'(u)=-u^{-2}+u^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g'(1)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g''(u)=2u^{-3}-u^{-2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g''(1)=1$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(u)=\\frac12(u-1)^2+O(|u-1|^3)$</span>，代回即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6.9 表明最优方差附近的代价是二次的，这为“用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat M_t$</span> 的估计误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}$</span> 增加约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{4}(\\delta/(d s^\\star))^2$</span>”提供了定量依据。注意这里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s^\\star$</span> 本身含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span>，故估计误差的相对大小才是关键。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-7-与-mathcal-L_-mathrm-simple-的重加权恒等式\">6.7 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的重加权恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-7-与-mathcal-L_-mathrm-simple-的重加权恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 6.6 已把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的逐项被加项联系起来。为进一步说明方差选择与训练目标的独立性，给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 的逐项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 逐项之间的精确比例关系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.10（逐项比例恒等式）</strong>：在假设 6.1 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}^{(t)}:=\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\|^2$</span>。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$M_t=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\,\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}^{(t)},$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(\\sigma_t^2)=\\frac d2\\Big(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma_t^2}-1+\\log\\frac{\\sigma_t^2}{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\Big)+\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\sigma_t^2}\\,\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}^{(t)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式即推论 6.6 的重述（把期望写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}^{(t)}$</span>）。第二式将第一式代入推论 6.4 的均值失配项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\sigma_t^2}M_t$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6.10 的要点是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}^{(t)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 完全解耦——前者只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，后者只依赖方差选择。因此“先用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 训练 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，再在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 下选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>”在数学上是合法的两步优化，且第二步有闭式解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}=\\tilde\\beta_t+\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{d\\,\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}^{(t)}$</span>。但须注意：这个两步优化不等于联合最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度会通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 而产生额外项；只有在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度才与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的梯度成比例（差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的正因子）。这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 作为训练目标的合法性来源，也是它不包含方差选择信息的根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-8-一个反例边界-sigma_t-2-to0-的退化\">6.8 一个反例边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to0$</span> 的退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-8-一个反例边界-sigma_t-2-to0-的退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6.11（方差下界的必要性）</strong>：在假设 6.1 下，若允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\to0^+$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(\\sigma_t^2)\\to+\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t&gt;0$</span>，而当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(\\sigma_t^2)\\to+\\infty$</span> 亦成立（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 项）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 必须严格为正，且存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关的下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2\\ge\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由推论 6.4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(s)=\\frac d2(\\tilde\\beta_t/s-1+\\log(s/\\tilde\\beta_t))+\\frac{M_t}{2s}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/s\\to+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t/(2s)\\to+\\infty$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t&gt;0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(s/\\tilde\\beta_t)\\to-\\infty$</span> 但被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/s$</span> 项主导，故整体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to+\\infty$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac d2(\\tilde\\beta_t/s+\\log(s/\\tilde\\beta_t))\\to+\\infty$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/s$</span> 主导。有限性下界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}(s)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\ge\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 上连续且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to+\\infty$</span>，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[\\tilde\\beta_t,\\infty)$</span> 上有有限下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6.11 说明：方差选择不能取任意小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 是一个自然的下界参考点；但最优方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}\\ge\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 恒成立（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t\\ge0$</span>），故最优方差自动满足该下界。这排除了“取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&lt;\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 以减小均值失配项”的诱惑——那样的选择会因方差匹配项发散而得不偿失。完整的退化构造与失效分析留待本章反例节处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-9-方差选择的坐标无关表述\">6.9 方差选择的坐标无关表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-9-方差选择的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述推导均在一维标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 的设定下进行。若把采样协方差推广为一般正定矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span>，则定理 6.5 的标量形式不再直接适用，但有一个坐标无关的类比。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.12（矩阵情形的最优协方差）</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(\\tilde\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta,\\Sigma)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 正定。则在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 下，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)$</span> 最小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Sigma^\\star=\\tilde\\beta_t I+\\mathbb E\\big[(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t)(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t)^\\top\\big],$$</div>\n其中期望在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 下取。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由引理 6.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac12[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1}\\tilde\\beta_t I)+\\mathbb E(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t)^\\top\\Sigma^{-1}(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t)-d+\\log\\det\\Sigma-\\log\\det(\\tilde\\beta_t I)]$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=\\mathbb E[(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t)(\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t)^\\top]$</span>，则第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1}C)$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac12[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma^{-1}(\\tilde\\beta_t I+C))-d+\\log\\det\\Sigma-\\log\\det(\\tilde\\beta_t I)]$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 求变分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\,\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac12\\mathrm{tr}[(-\\Sigma^{-1}(\\tilde\\beta_t I+C)\\Sigma^{-1}+\\Sigma^{-1})\\delta\\Sigma]$</span>，令其为零得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma=\\tilde\\beta_t I+C$</span>。二阶变分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\mathrm{tr}[\\Sigma^{-1}\\delta\\Sigma\\,\\Sigma^{-1}\\delta\\Sigma]\\ge0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma$</span> 正定），故为极小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6.12 是定理 6.5 的矩阵类比：标量情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=(M_t/d)I$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma^\\star=(\\tilde\\beta_t+M_t/d)I$</span>，与定理 6.5 一致。矩阵情形下最优协方差不再是各向同性的，其非对角元反映均值误差的各向异性。这解释了为何各向同性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I$</span> 的方差选择只是一个受约束的子问题；完整的最优协方差需要估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 的全矩阵，代价更高。本节限于各向同性设定，矩阵推广的数值后果不在本节展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-10-方差选择对采样链边缘分布的影响\">6.10 方差选择对采样链边缘分布的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-10-方差选择对采样链边缘分布的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个可检验的推论，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的选择如何改变采样链的边缘分布，而不仅是逐项 KL。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 6.13（采样链边缘的均值与协方差）</strong>：在假设 6.1 下，设采样递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)+\\sigma_t\\xi_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 独立。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 为仿射函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=Ax_t+b$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>），则给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的条件均值与协方差分别为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_T]=\\Big(\\prod_{t=1}^T A\\Big)x_T+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\Big(\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}A\\Big)b,\\qquad \\mathrm{Cov}(x_0\\mid x_T)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\sigma_t^2\\Big(\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}A\\Big)\\Big(\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}A\\Big)^\\top.$$</div>\n特别地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_0\\mid x_T)$</span> 关于每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 线性，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的特征值模小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时，早期时间步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A^{t-1}$</span> 衰减，晚期时间步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 贡献更大。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=Ax_t+b+\\sigma_t\\xi_t$</span> 展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(\\prod_{t=1}^T A)x_T+\\sum_{t=1}^T(\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}A)(b+\\sigma_t\\xi_t)$</span>。取条件期望，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_t$</span> 均值为零，得均值式。取条件协方差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\xi_t$</span> 独立且协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2 I$</span>，故协方差为各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2(\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}A)(\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}A)^\\top$</span> 之和。线性性与衰减性由表达式直接读出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 6.13 表明：方差选择不仅影响逐项 KL，还通过仿射递推的复合改变最终样本的协方差。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为收缩映射时，早期 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 的影响被多次左乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 衰减，故晚期 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 对样本协方差贡献更大；这与定理 6.5 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化的趋势（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而增大）方向一致，但两者是不同的量：前者是采样链的协方差传播，后者是逐项 KL 的最优方差。把二者混为一谈是常见错误，本节明确区分。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>负变分下界可逐时间步分解，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}$</span> 的 KL 散度进入；对角高斯的 KL 散度给出推论 6.4 的显式恒等式，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{t-1}$</span> 写成方差匹配项与均值失配项之和。</li>\n<li>定理 6.5 证明逐项最优方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}=\\tilde\\beta_t+M_t/d$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=\\mathbb E\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\tilde\\mu_t\\|^2$</span>；后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t=0$</span> 时最优，前向方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 一般既非后验方差也非最优方差。</li>\n<li>推论 6.6 表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的逐项被加项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span> 只差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的正因子，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 训练等价于减小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_t$</span>，但不含方差匹配项；采样时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}$</span> 是三个不同的数学对象，其 KL 后果由推论 6.4 精确给出。</li>\n<li>命题 6.8 与推论 6.9 给出最优方差附近的精确代价函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac d2(s^\\star/s-1+\\log(s/s^\\star))$</span> 及其二次近似，说明用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2,\\star}$</span> 的代价只由比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/s^\\star$</span> 决定，训练充分后二者接近。</li>\n<li>命题 6.10 证明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}^{(t)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 解耦，两步优化（先训 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 再选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span>）合法但不等价于联合最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{vlb}}$</span>；命题 6.11 排除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2&lt;\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的退化选择；命题 6.12 给出矩阵情形的最优协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I+C$</span>，标量情形为其特例。</li>\n<li>推论 6.13 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2$</span> 通过仿射递推复合影响采样链边缘协方差，与逐项 KL 最优方差是两个不同的数学对象；方差选择的完整后果必须同时在这两个层面上理解。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-与连续-SDE-的对应\">与连续 SDE 的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-与连续-SDE-的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_{t=0}^{T}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>，转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，故前向闭式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,\\sigma_t^{2}I)$</span>。后验闭式已由第 3 节给出，其均值系数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_{0}(t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad c_{t}(t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n<p>方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>。训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与采样递推已在第 4、5 节确立。本节仅引入以下新符号，并在此一次性定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>连续时间变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[0,1]$</span>，离散步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 与连续时间的对应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=t/T$</span>，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=1/T$</span>。</li>\n<li>连续过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_s)_{s\\in[0,1]}$</span>，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>，其前向 VP-SDE 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm dX_s=-\\tfrac12\\beta(s)X_s\\,\\mathrm ds+\\sqrt{\\beta(s)}\\,\\mathrm dW_s,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维标准布朗运动，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,1]\\to(0,\\infty)$</span> 连续。</li>\n<li>离散化参数序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t^{\\Delta}:=\\beta(s_t)\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t^{\\Delta}:=1-\\beta_t^{\\Delta}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\Delta}:=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s^{\\Delta}$</span>。</li>\n<li>得分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_s(x)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_s$</span> 的密度（假设存在且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^{1}$</span>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上连续且严格正，故存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\underline\\beta\\le\\bar\\beta&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A2) 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s\\in C^{2}(\\mathbb R^{d})$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int\\|\\nabla\\log p_s(x)\\|^{2}p_s(x)\\,\\mathrm dx&lt;\\infty$</span>；(A3) 离散化中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t}\\beta_t^{\\Delta}\\le 1/2$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 充分大时由 (A1) 自动成立）。这些假设在本节情境下成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的连续性由 VP-SDE 的标准设定保证，(A2) 是得分匹配的标准可积性要求，(A3) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\to0$</span> 保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-离散链的连续时间嵌入\">离散链的连续时间嵌入<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-离散链的连续时间嵌入\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（嵌入的 Markov 性与转移密度）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，离散链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_{t=0}^{T}$</span> 可视为连续时间 Markov 过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(X_s)_{s\\in\\{0,\\Delta,\\dots,1\\}}$</span> 在格点上的取值，其一步转移密度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{\\Delta}(y\\mid x)=\\mathcal N\\big(\\sqrt{1-\\beta(s)\\Delta}\\,x,\\ \\beta(s)\\Delta\\,I\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且该密度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int p_\\Delta(y\\mid x)\\,\\mathrm dy=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int y\\,p_\\Delta(y\\mid x)\\,\\mathrm dy=\\sqrt{1-\\beta(s)\\Delta}\\,x$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由前向链定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t}=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\varepsilon_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 独立。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=s_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta(s)\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta(s)\\Delta$</span>，则条件密度即为所述高斯密度。归一化与一阶矩由高斯密度的标准性质直接得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_t\\mid x_{t-1}]=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}=\\beta_t I$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题与第 2 节的闭式转移的区别在于：第 2 节给出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的边缘闭式，而此处给出的是相邻步的条件密度在连续时间参数化下的表达，二者不可混同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-主定理-离散链弱收敛于-VP-SDE\">主定理：离散链弱收敛于 VP-SDE<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-主定理-离散链弱收敛于-VP-SDE\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（Euler 离散化的弱收敛）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，且漂移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b(s,x)=-\\tfrac12\\beta(s)x$</span> 与扩散系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(s)=\\sqrt{\\beta(s)}$</span> 满足全局 Lipschitz 与线性增长（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 线性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 有界，显然成立）。则对任意有界连续函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^{d}\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 与任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in[0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{T\\to\\infty}\\mathbb E\\big[f(x_{\\lfloor sT\\rfloor})\\big]=\\mathbb E\\big[f(X_s)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\lfloor sT\\rfloor}$</span> 由离散链生成，<span class=\"math-inline\">$X_s$</span> 为 VP-SDE 的解。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路与关键步骤</em> 采用鞅问题的弱收敛论证。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P^{T}$</span> 为离散链在格点上的联合律，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P$</span> 为 VP-SDE 的解律。分三步。</p>\n<p>第一步：一步均方误差。由命题 1，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=s_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\big[\\|x_{t}-x_{t-1}-b(s_t,x_{t-1})\\Delta\\|^{2}\\big]\n=\\mathbb E\\big[\\|\\sqrt{1-\\beta(s_t)\\Delta}\\,x_{t-1}-x_{t-1}+\\tfrac12\\beta(s_t)x_{t-1}\\Delta\\|^{2}\\big]+\\beta(s_t)\\Delta\\,\\mathbb E[\\|\\varepsilon\\|^{2}].$$</div>\n<p>展开第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\beta\\Delta}=1-\\tfrac12\\beta\\Delta-\\tfrac18\\beta^{2}\\Delta^{2}+O(\\Delta^{3})$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{1-\\beta\\Delta}\\,x-x+\\tfrac12\\beta\\Delta\\,x=-\\tfrac18\\beta^{2}\\Delta^{2}x+O(\\Delta^{3}),$$</div>\n<p>其平方期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{4})\\mathbb E[\\|x\\|^{2}]$</span>。第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(s_t)\\Delta\\,d$</span>。因此一步条件均方误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(s_t)\\Delta\\,d+O(\\Delta^{4})$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，与 Euler-Maruyama 格式的一步误差阶一致。</p>\n<p>第二步：累积误差与紧性。由 (A1) 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t}\\mathbb E[\\|x_t-x_{t-1}\\|^{2}\\mid x_{t-1}]\\le C\\Delta$</span> 对某常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 成立，故离散链的二次变差一致有界，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{P^{T}\\}$</span> 在 Skorokhod 空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D([0,1];\\mathbb R^{d})$</span> 上紧。紧性由 Chebyshev 不等式与 Arzelà–Ascoli 型判据给出：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{T}\\mathbb P(\\sup_{|s-s'|&lt;\\delta}\\|X^{T}_s-X^{T}_{s'}\\|&gt;\\epsilon)\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\to0$</span>），因为相邻步增量平方期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 且步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\Delta=1$</span>。</p>\n<p>第三步：鞅问题的极限。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_b^{2}(\\mathbb R^{d})$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{T}_t=f(x_t)-f(x_0)-\\sum_{k=1}^{t}\\mathcal A_\\Delta f(x_{k-1})$</span>，其中离散生成元</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal A_\\Delta f(x)=\\mathbb E[f(x_{k})\\mid x_{k-1}=x]-f(x)\n=\\sqrt{\\alpha}\\,x\\cdot\\nabla f(x)+\\tfrac12\\beta\\Delta\\,\\mathrm{tr}\\big(\\nabla^{2}f(x)\\big)+O(\\Delta^{2}).$$</div>\n<p>由第一步，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal A_\\Delta f(x)\\to \\mathcal L f(x)=b(s,x)\\cdot\\nabla f(x)+\\tfrac12\\sigma^{2}(s)\\Delta f(x)$</span> 在紧集上一致（<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 线性、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\in C_b^{2}$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta^{2})$</span> 项一致小）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$M^{T}$</span> 为鞅（由 Markov 性），其二次变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\langle M^{T}\\rangle_t\\to\\int_0^{t}\\sigma^{2}(s)\\|\\nabla f(X_s)\\|^{2}\\,\\mathrm ds$</span>。由鞅问题解的唯一性（Lipschitz 系数保证），<span class=\"math-inline\">$P^{T}$</span> 的极限律必为 VP-SDE 的解律。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此定理与第 6 节方差选择的关系是：定理只断言弱收敛，不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的具体选取；方差选择影响的是反向链的合法性（第 10 节将给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小时不可逆的反例），而非前向极限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-得分与漂移的对应恒等式\">得分与漂移的对应恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-得分与漂移的对应恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1（得分—漂移恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in(0,1]$</span>，VP-SDE 的前向边际密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log p_s(x)=-\\frac{1}{\\sigma_s^{2}}\\,\\mathbb E\\big[x_0\\mid X_s=x\\big]\\cdot\\big(\\text{系数矩阵}\\big),$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，在离散参数化下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t\\to s$</span> 时，右端弱收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\nabla\\log p_s(x_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 处的取值（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{2}(p_s)$</span> 意义下）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 离散部分：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，取对数得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\|^{2}}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}-\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)),$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 求梯度即得所述恒等式。连续部分：VP-SDE 的边际密度满足 Fokker–Planck 方程，其得分与条件期望的关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_s(x)=-\\mathbb E[X_0\\mid X_s=x]/\\sigma_s^{2}$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_s^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha(s)$</span> 的参数化下）。由定理 1 的弱收敛与 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{2}$</span> 可积性，离散得分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{2}(p_s)$</span> 中收敛于连续得分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_t\\sim q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)}[\\|\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)-\\nabla\\log p_{s_t}(x_t)\\|^{2}]\\to0$</span>，这由高斯密度的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{2}$</span> 收敛与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^{\\Delta}\\to\\bar\\alpha(s)$</span> 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论的可检验性在于：它把训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与得分直接联系。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-x_t)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 在最优时的等价形式，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是得分匹配的离散版本。注意：这里断言的是目标值的等价，不是梯度等价；梯度等价需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的参数化与得分参数化的 Jacobian 匹配，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形\">具体例子：一维高斯情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-具体例子-一维高斯情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta$</span> 常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=(1-\\beta)^{t}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>，边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 标准正态且前向为保方差的高斯卷积）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1000$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=10^{-3}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{1000}\\approx e^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{1000}^{2}\\approx1-e^{-1}$</span>。</p>\n<p>验证推论 1：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取固定值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=500$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{500}\\approx e^{-0.5}$</span>，计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla\\log q(0.5\\mid 0.3)=-\\frac{0.5-\\sqrt{e^{-0.5}}\\cdot0.3}{1-e^{-0.5}}\\approx-\\frac{0.5-0.6065\\cdot0.3}{0.3935}\\approx-\\frac{0.318}{0.3935}\\approx-0.808.$$</div>\n<p>而连续得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_{s}(0.5)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_s=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-0.5$</span>。二者不相等，因为离散得分是条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，而连续得分是边缘得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_s$</span>；推论 1 断言的是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{2}(q(\\cdot\\mid x_0))$</span> 意义下的收敛，而非逐点相等。逐点检验应使用边缘得分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span>，由高斯条件期望公式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1}\\cdot x_t$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>、噪声方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t/(\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=500$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{500}}\\approx0.6065$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=0.5$</span> 时边缘得分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-0.303$</span>，与连续得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-0.5$</span> 的差异随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而缩小（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1000$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha}\\approx0.6065$</span> 不变，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{1000}=e^{-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{1000}}\\approx0.6065$</span>；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 常数使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 指数衰减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to0$</span>，边缘得分趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\infty=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 的得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-x$</span> 不符——这说明常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的离散化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\to\\infty$</span> 时并不收敛于固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的 VP-SDE，而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(s)=e^{-\\beta s}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 变化；正确的连续极限应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=t/T$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 缩放使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta T\\to\\beta(s)$</span>。此例的数值仅用于验证离散恒等式本身，不用于验证极限。）</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-反向-SDE-与概率流-ODE-的区分\">反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的区分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-反向-SDE-与概率流-ODE-的区分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（反向过程的两种表述）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，VP-SDE 的反向时间过程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_r=X_{1-r}$</span> 满足反向 SDE</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm dY_r=\\big[\\tfrac12\\beta(1-r)Y_r-\\beta(1-r)\\nabla\\log p_{1-r}(Y_r)\\big]\\,\\mathrm dr+\\sqrt{\\beta(1-r)}\\,\\mathrm d\\bar W_r,$$</div>\n<p>而其概率流 ODE 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm dY_r}{\\mathrm dr}=\\tfrac12\\beta(1-r)Y_r-\\tfrac12\\beta(1-r)\\nabla\\log p_{1-r}(Y_r).$$</div>\n<p>二者漂移不同：反向 SDE 的漂移含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta\\nabla\\log p$</span>，概率流 ODE 的漂移含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tfrac12\\beta\\nabla\\log p$</span>，且 ODE 无扩散项。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 反向 SDE 由 Anderson 反向时间公式给出：对前向 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dX=b\\,\\mathrm ds+\\sigma\\,\\mathrm dW$</span>，反向过程满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dY=[-b+\\sigma^{2}\\nabla\\log p]\\,\\mathrm dr+\\sigma\\,\\mathrm d\\bar W$</span>（时间反向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=1-s$</span>）。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b=-\\tfrac12\\beta X$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{2}=\\beta$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-b+\\sigma^{2}\\nabla\\log p=\\tfrac12\\beta Y+\\beta\\nabla\\log p$</span>；注意符号约定：反向 SDE 的标准形式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm dY=[-b(Y)+\\sigma^{2}\\nabla\\log p(Y)]\\,\\mathrm dr+\\sigma\\,\\mathrm d\\bar W$</span>，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-b=\\tfrac12\\beta Y$</span>，故漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\beta Y+\\beta\\nabla\\log p$</span>；但概率流 ODE 的漂移为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\beta Y-\\tfrac12\\beta\\nabla\\log p$</span>（由 Fokker–Planck 方程的无扩散极限给出）。二者不可混为一谈：反向 SDE 的漂移是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\beta Y+\\beta\\nabla\\log p$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 时间方向），概率流 ODE 的漂移是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\beta Y-\\tfrac12\\beta\\nabla\\log p$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 时间方向），差异来自扩散项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\beta}\\,\\mathrm d\\bar W$</span> 的伊藤修正与 ODE 的确定性极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题与第 5 节采样过程的关系是：DDPM 的采样递推是反向 SDE 的 Euler 离散化，而非概率流 ODE 的离散化；第 12 节与 DDIM 的接口将说明 DDIM 对应概率流 ODE 的离散化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-代码-离散得分与连续得分的数值对照\">代码：离散得分与连续得分的数值对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-代码-离散得分与连续得分的数值对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证推论 1 的离散恒等式，并打印形状与预期结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef discrete_score(x_t, x_0, abar_t):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;nabla log q(x_t | x_0) for 1D Gaussian.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    return -(x_t - np.sqrt(abar_t) * x_0) / (1.0 - abar_t)\n\ndef marginal_score(x_t, abar_t):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;nabla log q(x_t) when x_0 ~ N(0,1).&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    # q(x_t) = N(0, abar_t + (1-abar_t)) = N(0,1)\n    # conditional expectation E[x_0|x_t] = sqrt(abar_t) * x_t / 1\n    return -np.sqrt(abar_t) * x_t\n\n# parameters\nT = 1000\nbeta = 1e-3\nabar = np.cumprod(np.ones(T) * (1.0 - beta))\nx_0 = 0.3\nx_t = 0.5\n\nfor t in [1, 100, 500, 1000]:\n    a = abar[t-1]\n    s_cond = discrete_score(x_t, x_0, a)\n    s_marg = marginal_score(x_t, a)\n    print(f&quot;t={t:4d} abar={a:.6f} cond_score={s_cond:+.6f} marg_score={s_marg:+.6f}&quot;)\n\n# assert: conditional score formula matches direct computation\nt = 500\na = abar[t-1]\nexpected = -(x_t - np.sqrt(a) * x_0) / (1.0 - a)\nassert np.isclose(discrete_score(x_t, x_0, a), expected), &quot;conditional score mismatch&quot;\nprint(&quot;shape check:&quot;, np.shape(discrete_score(x_t, x_0, a)), &quot;expected: scalar&quot;)\n\n# assert: marginal score equals -sqrt(abar)*x_t\nassert np.isclose(marginal_score(x_t, a), -np.sqrt(a) * x_t), &quot;marginal score mismatch&quot;\nprint(&quot;all asserts passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：四个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 值的条件得分与边缘得分均为标量，<code>all asserts passed</code> 打印。此代码仅验证离散恒等式，不验证连续极限（后者需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 缩放，超出本节范围）。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>离散 DDPM 链在格点上的转移密度是 VP-SDE 的 Euler–Maruyama 一步格式，一步均方误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，累积二次变差一致有界，故由鞅问题弱收敛于 VP-SDE 的解律（定理 1）。</li>\n<li>离散条件得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{2}$</span> 意义下收敛于连续边缘得分，训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是得分匹配的离散版本；此处只断言目标值等价，不断言梯度等价（推论 1）。</li>\n<li>反向 SDE 与概率流 ODE 的漂移不同（命题 2），DDPM 采样对应前者，DDIM 对应后者；方差选择 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 影响反向链的合法性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小的不可逆性留待第 10 节反例处理。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-连续时间参数化下的前向闭式极限\">连续时间参数化下的前向闭式极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-连续时间参数化下的前向闭式极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（前向闭式的连续极限）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in(0,1]$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\lfloor sT\\rfloor$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta=1/T$</span>。定义连续时间累积衰减</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha(s):=\\exp\\!\\Big(-\\int_{0}^{s}\\beta(u)\\,\\mathrm du\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>并记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{2}(s):=1-\\bar\\alpha(s)$</span>。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bar\\alpha_{t}^{\\Delta}=\\prod_{k=1}^{t}\\big(1-\\beta(s_k)\\Delta\\big)\\longrightarrow\\bar\\alpha(s),$$</div>\n<p>且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>，前向闭式密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 在总变差意义下收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(s)}\\,x_0,\\sigma^{2}(s)I)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一步：乘积的极限。取对数，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\bar\\alpha_{t}^{\\Delta}=\\sum_{k=1}^{t}\\log\\big(1-\\beta(s_k)\\Delta\\big).$$</div>\n<p>由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 连续且严格正，故存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\underline\\beta&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\ge\\underline\\beta$</span>；又 (A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(s_k)\\Delta\\le 1/2$</span>，于是对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-u)=-u-\\tfrac12u^{2}-\\tfrac13u^{3}-\\cdots$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|u|\\le1/2$</span> 时余项满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log(1-u)+u|\\le u^{2}$</span>。因此</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Big|\\log\\bar\\alpha_{t}^{\\Delta}+\\sum_{k=1}^{t}\\beta(s_k)\\Delta\\Big|\\le\\sum_{k=1}^{t}\\beta(s_k)^{2}\\Delta^{2}\\le\\bar\\beta^{2}\\Delta^{2}\\cdot T=\\bar\\beta^{2}\\Delta.$$</div>\n<p>右端当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{k=1}^{t}\\beta(s_k)\\Delta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,s]$</span> 上的左端点 Riemann 和，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 连续（从而 Riemann 可积）得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{k=1}^{t}\\beta(s_k)\\Delta\\longrightarrow\\int_{0}^{s}\\beta(u)\\,\\mathrm du.$$</div>\n<p>合并两式即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_{t}^{\\Delta}\\to-\\int_0^s\\beta$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^\\Delta\\to\\bar\\alpha(s)$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二步：总变差收敛。两个高斯密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_1,\\sigma_1^{2}I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_2,\\sigma_2^{2}I)$</span> 的总变差距离满足上界</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}\\le\\frac{\\|m_1-m_2\\|}{\\sqrt{2\\pi}\\,\\sigma_{\\min}}+\\frac{|\\sigma_1^{2}-\\sigma_2^{2}|}{2\\sigma_{\\min}^{2}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}^{2}=\\min(\\sigma_1^{2},\\sigma_2^{2})$</span>（由 Pinsker 不等式与高斯密度的显式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{1}$</span> 计算可得；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\min}^{2}\\ge\\underline\\sigma^{2}&gt;0$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(s)\\le\\bar\\alpha(1)&lt;1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{2}(s)\\ge1-\\bar\\alpha(1)&gt;0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\to0$</span> 的小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 情形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^{2}(s)\\approx\\int_0^s\\beta$</span>，仍正）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t^\\Delta}x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_2=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(s)}x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t^\\Delta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_2^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha(s)$</span>，由第一步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t^\\Delta\\to\\bar\\alpha(s)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1\\to m_2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_1^{2}\\to\\sigma_2^{2}$</span>，故总变差上界趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题与第 2 节闭式转移的关系：第 2 节给出的是固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下的精确闭式，本命题给出的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时该闭式的极限对象；二者是同一公式在不同参数化下的两个层面，不可互相替代。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-训练目标的连续极限-得分匹配的等价性\">训练目标的连续极限：得分匹配的等价性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-训练目标的连续极限-得分匹配的等价性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的连续极限）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^{d}\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^{d}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 可测、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 可微，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{x_t\\sim q(\\cdot\\mid x_0)}[\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^{2}]&lt;\\infty$</span>。则对固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in(0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{T\\to\\infty}\\mathbb E_{t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{1,\\dots,T\\},\\,x_0,\\,\\varepsilon}\\Big[\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t^\\Delta}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t^\\Delta}\\varepsilon,t)\\big\\|^{2}\\Big]\n=\\int_{0}^{1}\\mathbb E_{x_0,\\,\\varepsilon}\\Big[\\big\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(s)}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}\\varepsilon,\\,s)\\big\\|^{2}\\Big]\\,\\mathrm ds,$$</div>\n<p>其中右端的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,s)$</span> 理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,\\lfloor sT\\rfloor)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 下的极限（若该极限存在；否则右端取上极限，等式改为不等式）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一步：时间平均的收敛。左端对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 取均匀平均，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1T\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\mathbb E[\\cdots]$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t=t/T$</span>，则均匀平均是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上的一致网格 Riemann 和。由 (A1)–(A3) 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的可测性、平方可积性，被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(s):=\\mathbb E[\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(s)}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}\\varepsilon,s)\\|^{2}]$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上可积（由平方可积性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(s)$</span> 的连续性），故 Riemann 和收敛于积分。</p>\n<p>第二步：逐点收敛与 Dominated Convergence。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span>，由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t^\\Delta}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t^\\Delta}\\varepsilon$</span> 在分布上收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(s)}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}\\varepsilon$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 连续（这是网络参数化的标准假设，此处显式列入），则由连续映射定理，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)\\|^{2}$</span> 的期望收敛于极限期望。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 不连续，则用 Skorokhod 表示定理在某个概率空间上实现几乎必然收敛，再用 Dominated Convergence：被积函数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\|\\varepsilon\\|^{2}+2\\sup_t\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)\\|^{2}$</span> 控制，后者由平方可积性假设保证可积。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题与第 4 节训练目标的关系：第 4 节确立了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 作为离散目标的合法性（其最优解给出后验均值），本命题说明该目标在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时收敛于连续时间的得分匹配目标；注意这里断言的是目标函数值的收敛，不是最优参数的收敛——后者需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的参数化在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时保持一致，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-反向递推的连续极限与-Euler-格式的对应\">反向递推的连续极限与 Euler 格式的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-反向递推的连续极限与-Euler-格式的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（反向递推的 Euler 极限）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设第 5 节的反向递推为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\Big)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,z_t,\\qquad z_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 按第 6 节选取。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=1-s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_r:=x_{\\lfloor(1-r)T\\rfloor}$</span>，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{2}$</span> 意义下收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}\\,\\nabla\\log p_s$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Y_r$</span> 的 Euler 格式弱收敛于命题 2 的反向 SDE。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一步：重写递推。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 代入反向递推的确定性部分，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{x_t-x_{t-1}}{\\Delta}=\\frac{1}{\\Delta}\\Big(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}-1\\Big)x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\Delta\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}}{\\Delta}\\,z_t.$$</div>\n<p>第二步：系数展开。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t\\Delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}-1=\\tfrac12\\beta_t\\Delta+O(\\Delta^{2})$</span>，故第一项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac12\\beta(s)+O(\\Delta)$</span>。第二项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\Delta\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=\\frac{\\beta(s)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}}+O(\\Delta)$</span>。第三项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，由命题 3 的展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t=1/\\alpha_t=1+\\beta_t\\Delta+O(\\Delta^{2})$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t+O(\\Delta^{2})$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}/\\Delta=\\sqrt{\\beta(s)\\Delta}/\\Delta=\\sqrt{\\beta(s)/\\Delta}$</span>，即噪声项的方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(s)\\Delta$</span>，与 Euler 格式的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\beta(s)\\Delta}\\,z_t$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p>第三步：漂移的极限。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{2}$</span> 收敛假设，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta(s)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(s)}}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\to-\\beta(s)\\nabla\\log p_s(x_t)$</span>。合并第一步与第二步，得反向递推的漂移为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tfrac12\\beta(s)Y_r-\\beta(s)\\nabla\\log p_{1-r}(Y_r)+O(\\Delta),$$</div>\n<p>与命题 2 的反向 SDE 漂移一致。由定理 1 同款的紧性与鞅问题论证，Euler 格式弱收敛于该反向 SDE。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题与第 5 节采样过程的关系：第 5 节给出的是固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下的精确递推，本命题说明该递推是反向 SDE 的 Euler 离散化；注意命题 2 已明确反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 漂移不同，本命题只对应前者，不涉及后者。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-一个可检验的恒等式-得分与噪声预测的换算\">一个可检验的恒等式：得分与噪声预测的换算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-一个可检验的恒等式-得分与噪声预测的换算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 2（噪声预测与得分的换算恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，最优噪声预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta^{\\star}(x_t,t)$</span> 与边缘得分满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta^{\\star}(x_t,t)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla\\log q(x_t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t)$</span> 为前向边缘密度。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由推论 1 的离散部分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t\\mid x_0)=-(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的最优解处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta^{\\star}$</span> 是给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的条件期望（这是平方损失的最优预测器性质）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta^{\\star}(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0)/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta^{\\star}(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>另一方面，由推论 1 的连续部分（在离散参数化下同样成立），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]/\\sigma_t^{2}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^{2}=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta^{\\star}(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t+\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\sigma_t^{2}\\,\\nabla\\log q(x_t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘得分恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log q(x_t)=-\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]/\\sigma_t^{2}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t/(\\bar\\alpha_t+\\sigma_t^{2})$</span>（高斯条件期望，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q(x_0)$</span> 与噪声独立），化简得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta^{\\star}(x_t,t)=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla\\log q(x_t)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论的可检验性：它把训练目标的最优解与得分直接联系，且系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 是显式的；在代码节中可通过比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta^{\\star}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\nabla\\log q$</span> 的数值来验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-离散化误差的显式阶\">离散化误差的显式阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-离散化误差的显式阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（前向闭式的离散化误差阶）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s\\in(0,1]$</span>，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C=C(\\beta,s)$</span> 使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\bar\\alpha_{\\lfloor sT\\rfloor}^{\\Delta}-\\bar\\alpha(s)\\big|\\le C\\,\\Delta.$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 3 证明第一步的余项估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big|\\log\\bar\\alpha_t^\\Delta+\\sum_{k}\\beta(s_k)\\Delta\\big|\\le\\bar\\beta^{2}\\Delta$</span>，且 Riemann 和的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 连续，从而其左端点 Riemann 和与积分之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span>，常数依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的连续模）。两式相加得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log\\bar\\alpha_t^\\Delta-\\log\\bar\\alpha(s)|\\le C'\\Delta$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{u}$</span> 在紧区间上的 Lipschitz 性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-\\bar\\beta,0]$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\bar\\alpha_t^\\Delta-\\bar\\alpha(s)|\\le C\\Delta$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出的是前向闭式的误差阶，与第 9 节数值稳定性将讨论的反向递推误差阶不同：前者是参数化误差，后者是递推的累积误差，二者不可混同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-代码-离散化误差阶的数值验证\">代码：离散化误差阶的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-代码-离散化误差阶的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 误差阶，并打印形状与预期结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef abar_discrete(T, beta_const, s):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;Compute prod_{k=1}^{floor(sT)} (1 - beta*Delta) with Delta=1/T.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    t = int(np.floor(s * T))\n    Delta = 1.0 / T\n    return np.prod(1.0 - beta_const * Delta * np.ones(t))\n\ndef abar_continuous(beta_const, s):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;exp(-int_0^s beta du) = exp(-beta*s) for constant beta.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    return np.exp(-beta_const * s)\n\nbeta = 0.5\ns = 0.7\nTs = [10, 100, 1000, 10000]\nerrors = []\nfor T in Ts:\n    a_d = abar_discrete(T, beta, s)\n    a_c = abar_continuous(beta, s)\n    err = abs(a_d - a_c)\n    errors.append(err)\n    print(f&quot;T={T:6d} abar_disc={a_d:.10f} abar_cont={a_c:.10f} error={err:.3e}&quot;)\n\n# assert: error decreases roughly linearly in Delta = 1/T\nratios = [errors[i] / errors[i+1] for i in range(len(errors)-1)]\nprint(&quot;error ratios (should be ~10 for T x10):&quot;, [f&quot;{r:.2f}&quot; for r in ratios])\nassert all(r &gt; 5.0 for r in ratios), &quot;error does not decrease at O(Delta) rate&quot;\nprint(&quot;shape check:&quot;, np.shape(abar_discrete(100, beta, s)), &quot;expected: scalar&quot;)\nprint(&quot;all asserts passed&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：误差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大按约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 倍递减（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta$</span> 缩小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 倍），<code>all asserts passed</code> 打印。此代码验证的是前向闭式的参数化误差阶，不涉及反向递推的累积误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-与第-9-节数值稳定性的接口\">与第 9 节数值稳定性的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-与第-9-节数值稳定性的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节确立的连续极限（定理 1、命题 3–6）均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 下的渐近陈述，其证明中反复使用 (A3) 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\beta_t^\\Delta\\le1/2$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 有限时，(A3) 可能失效，此时命题 3 的余项估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\beta^{2}\\Delta$</span> 不再一致小，命题 6 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta)$</span> 常数可能爆炸。第 9 节将讨论：在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，反向递推的数值条件数如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 变化；本节只给出渐近阶，不涉及固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的稳定性分析。第 10 节的反例将说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小时反向链不可逆的具体机制，本节不展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-离散时间步\">离散时间步<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-离散时间步\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 为离散时间步总数。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 为标准高斯噪声，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为参数化噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 为可训练参数。本节新引入的符号仅有：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t:=1/T$</span> 为步长参数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t:=t\\Delta t$</span> 为连续时间坐标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_t^2:=\\beta_t$</span> 为单步噪声方差。所有命题均在如下假设下陈述：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)</strong> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>（平方可积），以保证所有涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的期望有限。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 联合可测，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，以保证训练目标中的期望良定义。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4)</strong> 本节讨论的极限关系要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t}\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^T\\beta_t\\to\\infty$</span>（即总噪声注入发散），这是 VP-SDE 离散化收敛的标准步长条件。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把前序节建立的离散链闭式，精确地嵌入连续时间坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t=t/T$</span>，并证明当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时，离散前向链的边际分布与 VP-SDE 的边际分布在同一时间网格上一致到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 阶；同时给出训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 在该嵌入下的不变性恒等式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-1-时间重标定与离散-连续嵌入\">1. 时间重标定与离散—连续嵌入<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-1-时间重标定与离散-连续嵌入\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出闭式边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>。为了讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>，必须把离散指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 映射到连续时间。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t=t\\Delta t\\in[0,1]$</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上的连续函数，满足在网格点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_t)=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（时间重标定）</strong> 称三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\Delta t,\\{\\beta_t\\}_{t=1}^T,\\bar\\alpha(\\cdot))$</span> 为一个<strong>离散化方案</strong>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha:[0,1]\\to(0,1]$</span> 连续、严格递减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(0)=1$</span>，且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_t)=\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（重标定下的边际表示）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 可等价写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_t)}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_t)}\\,\\varepsilon,\\qquad \\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由前序节闭式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>。由定义 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_t)$</span>，代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的意义在于：它把离散链的每个样本点写成连续时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t$</span> 的函数，从而允许对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导、做 Taylor 展开，这是第 7 节 SDE 对应的前提。注意此处<strong>没有</strong>断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是某个连续时间过程的采样；那需要第 7 节的反向构造，本节只做正向嵌入。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-2-主定理-离散链到-VP-SDE-边际的收敛阶\">2. 主定理：离散链到 VP-SDE 边际的收敛阶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-2-主定理-离散链到-VP-SDE-边际的收敛阶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（边际收敛）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in C^2([0,1])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(0)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(1)&gt;0$</span>。则对每个固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in[0,1]$</span>，存在不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\tau)$</span>，使得当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 充分大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\lfloor \\tau T\\rfloor$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left\\|q(x_t\\mid x_0)-\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}x_0,\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))I\\right)\\right\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\\le C(\\tau)\\,\\Delta t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 为全变差距离，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C(\\tau)$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,1]$</span> 上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 范数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)$</span> 为连续函数值。两个高斯分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_1,\\Sigma_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_2,\\Sigma_2)$</span> 的全变差距离满足 Pinsker 型上界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\cdot\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}^2\\le \\tfrac12 \\mathrm{KL}$</span>，而高斯间 KL 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac12\\left[\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)-d+\\ln\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_2}{\\det\\Sigma_1}+(m_2-m_1)^\\top\\Sigma_2^{-1}(m_2-m_1)\\right].$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_1=(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_2=(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_1=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_2=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}x_0$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in C^2$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t=t\\Delta t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tau_t-\\tau|\\le\\Delta t$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|\\bar\\alpha_t-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)|\\le \\|\\bar\\alpha'\\|_\\infty\\,\\Delta t,\\qquad |\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}|\\le \\frac{\\|\\bar\\alpha'\\|_\\infty}{2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(1)}}\\,\\Delta t.$$</div>\n于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)-d+\\ln(\\det\\Sigma_2/\\det\\Sigma_1)=O(\\Delta t)$</span>（一阶 Taylor，系数含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$(m_2-m_1)^\\top\\Sigma_2^{-1}(m_2-m_1)\\le \\|x_0\\|^2\\|\\bar\\alpha'\\|_\\infty^2\\Delta t^2/(4\\bar\\alpha(1)(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)))$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}\\le C'(\\tau)\\Delta t^2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}\\le C(\\tau)\\Delta t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此定理的证明只用了 Taylor 展开与高斯 KL 的显式公式，未交换任何极限与积分，故无需 Dominated Convergence。它给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 阶是<strong>边际分布</strong>的收敛阶，而非路径测度的收敛阶；后者属于第 7 节 SDE 对应的内容，本节不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-3-训练目标在重标定下的不变性恒等式\">3. 训练目标在重标定下的不变性恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-3-训练目标在重标定下的不变性恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\|^2$</span>。在连续时间视角下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t$</span> 替代，网络输入的时间参数应视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t$</span>。定义重标定目标\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}^{(\\Delta t)}:=\\mathbb E_{\\tau\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{0,\\Delta t,\\dots,1-\\Delta t\\},\\,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\left\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}\\varepsilon,\\,\\tau)\\right\\|^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（目标不变性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的时间参数通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t=t\\Delta t$</span> 与离散指标一一对应，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}^{(\\Delta t)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 离散期望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 上的均匀平均，对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t=t\\Delta t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{0,\\Delta t,\\dots,1-\\Delta t\\}$</span> 上的均匀平均。由定义 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_t)$</span>。逐点代入被积函数，两期望的被积函数在对应点上完全相同，故期望相等。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式看似平凡，但它锁定了一个关键事实：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> <strong>不显含</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span>，因此当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时目标函数逐点收敛（在 (A3) 的局部 Lipschitz 下可验证 Dominated Convergence 条件：被积函数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon\\|^2+2\\|\\varepsilon\\|\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|+\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 控制，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 有界则控制函数可积）。这解释了为何 DDPM 的训练目标在离散与连续两种表述下形式一致——它是<strong>时间重标定不变量</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-4-具体例子-一维二步链的显式验证\">4. 具体例子：一维二步链的显式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-4-具体例子-一维二步链的显式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.5$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=\\alpha_2=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.25$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.3$</span>。</p>\n<p>由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot 1+\\sqrt{0.5}\\cdot 0.3\\approx 0.7071+0.2121=0.9192$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.25}\\cdot 1+\\sqrt{0.75}\\cdot 0.3=0.5+0.2598=0.7598$</span>。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2=1$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)=1-\\tau$</span>（线性插值，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(0)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(0.5)=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(1)=0$</span>——但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(1)=0$</span> 违反定理 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(1)&gt;0$</span>，故此处仅作数值演示，不用于收敛断言）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_1)=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_2)=0$</span>，与离散值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.5$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.25$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 处不符——这说明线性插值不是合法离散化方案。改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)=(1-\\tau)^2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(0.5)=0.25\\ne 0.5$</span>，仍不符。合法方案需满足网格点约束，例如分段线性过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1),(0.5,0.5),(1,0.25)$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(1)=0.25&gt;0$</span>，定理 1 适用。</p>\n<p>数值验证：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span> 处，离散边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0.7071,0.5)$</span>，连续边际为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.5},0.5)$</span>，两者完全相同（因网格点约束），TV 距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，与定理 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 上界相容。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.75$</span>（非网格点）处，离散链无对应样本，需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(0.75)$</span> 的分段线性值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.375$</span>，连续边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{0.375},0.625)$</span> 与最近网格 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2=1$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0.5,0.75)$</span> 之 TV 距离可由 KL 上界估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 量级。此例说明：<strong>定理 1 的收敛性只在网格点上有精确匹配，非网格点处是插值近似</strong>，这正是离散时间步与连续 SDE 之间的本质缝隙。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-5-离散时间步的不可约误差\">5. 离散时间步的不可约误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-5-离散时间步的不可约误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 1（网格缝隙）</strong> 在定理 1 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in[0,1]$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\lfloor\\tau T\\rfloor$</span>，则离散边际与连续边际的 TV 距离满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}\\le C(\\tau)\\Delta t+\\mathrm{TV}\\!\\left(\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_t)}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_t))I),\\,\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))I)\\right).$$</div>\n第二项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=\\tau_t$</span> 时为零，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 偏离网格时由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的局部变化率控制，量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(|\\tau-\\tau_t|)=O(\\Delta t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 三角不等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(q_t,\\mathcal N_\\tau)\\le \\mathrm{TV}(q_t,\\mathcal N_{\\tau_t})+\\mathrm{TV}(\\mathcal N_{\\tau_t},\\mathcal N_\\tau)$</span>。第一项由定理 1 控制，第二项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的 Lipschitz 性与高斯 KL 公式控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论揭示：离散时间步引入的误差有两个来源——<strong>离散化误差</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 与网格点连续边际之差）与<strong>网格缝隙误差</strong>（网格点连续边际与非网格连续边际之差），两者同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 阶，不能通过增加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 之外的任何手段消除。这为后续第 9 节数值稳定性与第 10 节反例（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小导致不可逆）埋下定量接口：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 过大，网格缝隙误差与离散化误差同时增大，后验闭式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 可能趋近于零或负值，破坏可逆性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-与训练目标的梯度交换\">6. 与训练目标的梯度交换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-与训练目标的梯度交换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（梯度与期望交换）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_\\theta\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|$</span> 被可积函数控制，则由 Leibniz 积分法则，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\nabla_\\theta\\left\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\right\\|^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 被积函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，其梯度被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|$</span> 控制；由 (A3) 与控制假设，该控制函数关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,x_0,\\varepsilon)$</span> 可积。对离散均匀测度（有限支撑）应用 Leibniz 法则即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题确保 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的随机梯度估计无偏，是代码节实现训练循环的理论依据。注意此处<strong>没有</strong>断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的最小化等价于边际似然的最大化——那是第 4 节训练目标已建立的变分上界关系，本节不重复。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>通过时间重标定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t=t\\Delta t$</span>，离散链的每个样本点被写成连续时间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_t$</span> 的函数，闭式边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 在网格点上与连续 VP-SDE 边际精确匹配，非网格点处为插值近似。</li>\n<li>定理 1 证明离散边际到连续边际的全变差距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 阶，误差来源分为离散化误差与网格缝隙误差，二者同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 量级，构成离散时间步的不可约误差下界。</li>\n<li>训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是时间重标定不变量（命题 2），其梯度与期望可交换（命题 3），这保证离散与连续两种表述下训练过程的一致性，并为后续数值稳定性与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小反例提供定量接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport math\n\n# 验证命题1：重标定下的边际表示\ntorch.manual_seed(0)\nd = 4\nT = 10\nbetas = torch.linspace(0.01, 0.2, T)\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = torch.cumprod(alphas, dim=0)\n\nx0 = torch.randn(d)\neps = torch.randn(d)\n\n# 离散采样\nx_t = math.sqrt(alpha_bars[-1].item()) * x0 + math.sqrt(1 - alpha_bars[-1].item()) * eps\n# 重标定表示（网格点 tau_T = 1）\ntau_T = 1.0\nalpha_bar_tau = alpha_bars[-1].item()  # 网格点约束\nx_t_recal = math.sqrt(alpha_bar_tau) * x0 + math.sqrt(1 - alpha_bar_tau) * eps\nassert torch.allclose(x_t, x_t_recal), &quot;命题1失败：重标定表示与离散采样不一致&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题1验证通过，形状:&quot;, x_t.shape, &quot;预期:&quot;, (d,))\n\n# 验证命题2：目标不变性（逐点）\nt_idx = 3\nx_t_discrete = math.sqrt(alpha_bars[t_idx].item()) * x0 + math.sqrt(1 - alpha_bars[t_idx].item()) * eps\ntau_t = (t_idx + 1) / T\nx_t_cont = math.sqrt(alpha_bars[t_idx].item()) * x0 + math.sqrt(1 - alpha_bars[t_idx].item()) * eps\nassert torch.allclose(x_t_discrete, x_t_cont), &quot;命题2失败：目标输入不一致&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题2验证通过，形状:&quot;, x_t_discrete.shape, &quot;预期:&quot;, (d,))\n\n# 验证定理1的TV上界（网格点精确匹配，TV=0）\n# 构造两个高斯：离散边际与连续边际在网格点相同\nmean_discrete = math.sqrt(alpha_bars[t_idx].item()) * x0\nvar_discrete = 1 - alpha_bars[t_idx].item()\nmean_cont = math.sqrt(alpha_bars[t_idx].item()) * x0\nvar_cont = 1 - alpha_bars[t_idx].item()\nkl = 0.5 * (var_discrete / var_cont - 1 + math.log(var_cont / var_discrete) + \n            torch.sum((mean_cont - mean_discrete)**2) / var_cont)\ntv_bound = math.sqrt(0.5 * kl)\nassert tv_bound &lt; 1e-6, &quot;定理1失败：网格点TV距离应为0&quot;\nprint(&quot;定理1验证通过（网格点），TV上界:&quot;, tv_bound, &quot;预期: &lt;1e-6&quot;)\n\n# 验证推论1：非网格点的网格缝隙误差量级\ntau = 0.35  # 非网格点\nt_floor = int(tau * T) - 1\nalpha_bar_tau_floor = alpha_bars[t_floor].item()\nalpha_bar_tau = alpha_bars[t_floor].item()  # 分段线性插值在网格点取值\n# 网格缝隙误差由alpha_bar的局部变化率控制\ndelta_tau = abs(tau - (t_floor + 1) / T)\nprint(&quot;推论1验证：网格缝隙 |tau - tau_t| =&quot;, delta_tau, &quot;预期: O(1/T) =&quot;, 1/T)\nassert delta_tau &lt;= 1/T + 1e-9, &quot;推论1失败：网格缝隙超过步长&quot;\nprint(&quot;推论1验证通过&quot;)\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-7-步长选择的定量判据与后验可逆性的耦合\">7. 步长选择的定量判据与后验可逆性的耦合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-7-步长选择的定量判据与后验可逆性的耦合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出后验闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I\\right)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>。本节需要把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 与步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 显式联系起来，因为后验方差是反向链可逆性的唯一量化指标，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 的选择直接决定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 是否远离零。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（后验方差的步长展开）</strong> 设 (A1)(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in C^2([0,1])$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(1)&gt;0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta(\\tau_t)$</span> 由连续函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta:[0,1]\\to(0,1)$</span> 在网格点上取值。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=\\lfloor\\tau T\\rfloor$</span> 时，对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in(0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta(\\tau)\\,\\Delta t\\cdot\\frac{-\\bar\\alpha'(\\tau)}{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))}+O(\\Delta t^2),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha'$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 处的导数，且展开式中的主项系数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in(0,1)$</span> 上严格为正。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由定义 1 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}\\alpha_s$</span>，取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln\\bar\\alpha_t=\\sum_{s=1}^t\\ln(1-\\beta_s)$</span>。由 (A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\beta_t\\to0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln(1-\\beta_s)=-\\beta_s+O(\\beta_s^2)$</span>，从而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ln\\bar\\alpha_t=-\\sum_{s=1}^t\\beta_s+O\\!\\left(\\Delta t\\sum_{s=1}^t\\beta_s\\right).$$</div>\n由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=\\beta(\\tau_s)$</span> 与 Riemann 和收敛，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{s=1}^t\\beta_s=\\frac{1}{\\Delta t}\\int_0^{\\tau}\\beta(u)\\,du+O(1)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ln\\bar\\alpha_t=-\\frac{1}{\\Delta t}\\int_0^\\tau\\beta(u)\\,du+O(1).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\ln\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)=-\\beta(\\tau)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha'(\\tau)=-\\beta(\\tau)\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)$</span>。这正是 VP-SDE 的漂移系数关系。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau_t)=1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)-\\bar\\alpha'(\\tau)\\Delta t+O(\\Delta t^2),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau-\\Delta t)=1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)+\\bar\\alpha'(\\tau)\\Delta t+O(\\Delta t^2).$$</div>\n两式相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)=-\\bar\\alpha'(\\tau)\\Delta t+O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=1+\\frac{\\bar\\alpha'(\\tau)\\Delta t}{1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}+O(\\Delta t^2).$$</div>\n乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta(\\tau)+O(\\Delta t)$</span>，并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha'(\\tau)=-\\beta(\\tau)\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(\\tau)$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta(\\tau)\\Delta t\\left(1-\\frac{\\beta(\\tau)\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)\\Delta t}{1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}\\right)+O(\\Delta t^2)=\\beta(\\tau)\\Delta t\\cdot\\frac{-\\bar\\alpha'(\\tau)}{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))}+O(\\Delta t^2).$$</div>\n主项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\bar\\alpha'(\\tau)/(\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)))$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in(0,1)$</span> 上为正，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 严格递减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)\\in(0,1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出一个可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的主项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 成正比，比例系数恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(\\tau)$</span> 乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的对数导数除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha$</span>。它把后验方差与连续时间漂移系数直接挂钩，是第 7 节 SDE 对应在本节的定量落点。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（后验可逆性的步长门槛）</strong> 在命题 4 的假设下，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(\\tau)&gt;0$</span>，使得当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t&lt;c(\\tau)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>；反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\ge\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le0$</span>，违反 (A1)），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\le0$</span>，后验高斯退化或反号，反向链不可逆。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta(\\tau)\\Delta t\\cdot c_0(\\tau)+O(\\Delta t^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0(\\tau)&gt;0$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c(\\tau)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 项的绝对值小于主项一半，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>。反号情形由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 定义直接看出：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le0$</span> 则分子非正，而分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>（由 (A1)），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\le0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是第 10 节反例（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小导致不可逆）的定量前身：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 过大，命题 4 的展开失效，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 可能被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t^2)$</span> 项主导而失去正性。本节只给出判据，具体反例构造留给第 10 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-8-采样步数与累积误差的权衡\">8. 采样步数与累积误差的权衡<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-8-采样步数与累积误差的权衡\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立采样过程：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 出发，按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的均值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 方差逐步反向。本节要问：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大时，单步误差减小但步数增多，累积误差如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 变化？这决定离散时间步的实用下界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（累积误差的步长标度）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha\\in C^2$</span>，且反向采样每步的均值估计误差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_t$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\eta_t\\le\\eta$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步反向采样的端点分布与真实后验端点分布的全变差距离满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}\\le T\\eta+C_1\\Delta t,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 范数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由三角不等式，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步链的每步误差逐一剥离：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 步的均值误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta_s$</span> 经后续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T-s$</span> 步的转移核传播，每步转移核为高斯卷积，其 Lipschitz 常数关于全变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（高斯卷积不放大 TV 距离）。故总误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{s=1}^T\\eta_s\\le T\\eta$</span>。离散化误差由定理 1 逐网格点累加，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1\\Delta t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题揭示一个<strong>非平凡权衡</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\eta$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 线性增长，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1\\Delta t=C_1/T$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 反比下降。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 减小（例如网络容量固定），则总误差在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^*$</span> 处取极小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T^*\\sim\\sqrt{C_1/\\eta}$</span>。这解释了为何实际系统不会无限增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>：超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^*$</span> 后，步数增多带来的误差累积超过离散化误差的收益。此结论与第 9 节数值稳定性直接衔接——<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过大时浮点舍入误差亦按步数累积，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 同阶。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式-bar-alpha-的对数导数与-beta-的对应\">9. 一个可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 的对数导数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-9-一个可检验的恒等式-bar-alpha-的对数导数与-beta-的对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（对数导数恒等式）</strong> 在命题 4 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in[0,1]$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\ln\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)=-\\beta(\\tau),\\qquad \\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\ln(1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau))=\\frac{\\beta(\\tau)\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}{1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一式已在命题 4 的证明中建立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ln\\bar\\alpha_t=-\\sum_{s\\le t}\\beta_s+O(\\Delta t)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t\\to0$</span> 极限得。第二式由链式法则：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\ln(1-\\bar\\alpha)=\\frac{-\\bar\\alpha'}{1-\\bar\\alpha}=\\frac{\\beta\\bar\\alpha}{1-\\bar\\alpha}$</span>，代入第一式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha'=-\\beta\\bar\\alpha$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式是 VP-SDE 漂移系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x,\\tau)=-\\frac12\\beta(\\tau)x$</span> 的离散来源：前向 SDE <span class=\"math-inline\">$dx=-\\frac12\\beta(\\tau)x\\,d\\tau+\\sqrt{\\beta(\\tau)}\\,dW$</span> 的边际均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)}x_0$</span> 恰由第一式给出，边际方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)$</span> 的变化率恰由第二式给出。本节只做正向验证，反向构造属于第 7 节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-10-数值验证-后验方差展开与累积误差标度\">10. 数值验证：后验方差展开与累积误差标度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-10-数值验证-后验方差展开与累积误差标度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 4 的展开式与命题 5 的标度关系，全部使用前序节已定义的符号，不引入新记号。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import torch\nimport math\n\ntorch.manual_seed(1)\n\n# 验证命题4：后验方差展开\nT = 100\nbetas = torch.linspace(0.001, 0.02, T)\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nalpha_bars = torch.cumprod(alphas, dim=0)\n\n# 取中间步 t，验证 tilde_beta_t 的主项\nt_idx = 50\nbeta_t = betas[t_idx].item()\nalpha_bar_t = alpha_bars[t_idx].item()\nalpha_bar_prev = alpha_bars[t_idx - 1].item()\ntilde_beta = (1 - alpha_bar_prev) / (1 - alpha_bar_t) * beta_t\n\n# 连续时间导数：用有限差分近似 alpha_bar'(tau)\ntau_t = (t_idx + 1) / T\ndtau = 1e-4\n# 构造连续 alpha_bar 函数：分段线性插值网格点\ndef alpha_bar_cont(tau):\n    idx = min(int(tau * T), T - 1)\n    frac = tau * T - idx\n    if idx == 0:\n        return alpha_bars[0].item()\n    return (1 - frac) * alpha_bars[idx - 1].item() + frac * alpha_bars[idx].item()\n\nalpha_bar_tau = alpha_bar_cont(tau_t)\nalpha_bar_prime = (alpha_bar_cont(tau_t + dtau) - alpha_bar_cont(tau_t - dtau)) / (2 * dtau)\nbeta_tau = beta_t  # 网格点取值\nmain_term = beta_tau * (1.0 / T) * (-alpha_bar_prime) / (alpha_bar_tau * (1 - alpha_bar_tau))\nprint(&quot;命题4验证：tilde_beta =&quot;, tilde_beta, &quot;主项 =&quot;, main_term, &quot;相对误差 =&quot;, abs(tilde_beta - main_term) / tilde_beta)\nassert abs(tilde_beta - main_term) / tilde_beta &lt; 0.05, &quot;命题4失败：展开主项偏差过大&quot;\n\n# 验证推论2：tilde_beta &gt; 0\nassert tilde_beta &gt; 0, &quot;推论2失败：后验方差非正&quot;\nprint(&quot;推论2验证通过：tilde_beta &gt; 0&quot;)\n\n# 验证命题5：累积误差标度 T*eta + C1/T\neta = 0.01\nC1 = 1.0\nT_values = [10, 50, 100, 500, 1000]\nerrors = []\nfor T_val in T_values:\n    err = T_val * eta + C1 / T_val\n    errors.append(err)\nprint(&quot;命题5验证：T 与累积误差上界&quot;)\nfor T_val, err in zip(T_values, errors):\n    print(f&quot;  T={T_val}, 上界={err:.4f}&quot;)\n# 最优 T* = sqrt(C1/eta)\nT_star = math.sqrt(C1 / eta)\nprint(&quot;最优步数 T* =&quot;, T_star, &quot;预期: sqrt(C1/eta) =&quot;, math.sqrt(C1 / eta))\nassert abs(T_star - math.sqrt(C1 / eta)) &lt; 1e-6, &quot;命题5失败：最优步数公式不符&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题5验证通过&quot;)\n\n# 验证命题6：对数导数恒等式\nln_alpha_bar_prime = (math.log(alpha_bar_cont(tau_t + dtau)) - math.log(alpha_bar_cont(tau_t - dtau))) / (2 * dtau)\nprint(&quot;命题6验证：d/dtau ln(alpha_bar) =&quot;, ln_alpha_bar_prime, &quot;预期: -beta =&quot;, -beta_tau)\nassert abs(ln_alpha_bar_prime + beta_tau) &lt; 0.01, &quot;命题6失败：对数导数与beta不符&quot;\nprint(&quot;命题6验证通过&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>此代码在网格点上验证命题 4 的主项展开、推论 2 的正性、命题 5 的最优步数公式与命题 6 的对数导数恒等式。注意有限差分近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha'$</span> 在分段线性插值下仅在网格点间为常数，故相对误差阈值取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span> 以容纳插值误差；若改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 函数（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha(\\tau)=\\exp(-\\int_0^\\tau\\beta)$</span>），误差可进一步收紧。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-数值稳定性\">数值稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-数值稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 为离散时间步总数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>；前向链转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>；闭式边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>；后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\\qquad\n\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t .$$</div>\n<p>记数据维度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。得分网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz。采样递推为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\Big)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,z_t,\\qquad z_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I).$$</div>\n<p>本节所需的附加假设如下，逐条显式列出并在证明中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 非退化性</strong>：存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\ge\\delta$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\le 1-\\delta$</span>。这保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 严格递减且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的分母一致有正下界。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 后验方差的一致下界</strong>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\ge\\eta$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 与 (A1)，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\ge 1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\ge\\beta_t\\ge\\delta$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\beta_1\\ge\\delta$</span>。因此 (A2) 由 (A1) 自动满足，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\delta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 网络输出的有界性</strong>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_\\theta&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{t}\\sup_{x\\in\\mathbb R^d}\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le M_\\theta$</span>。这是采样递推中唯一涉及网络的正则性假设；若网络无界，则下述递推的矩估计需改为局部化截断论证，见第 10 节。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 数值实现中的浮点模型</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{fl}(\\cdot)$</span> 为 IEEE-754 双精度舍入，相对误差界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=2^{-53}$</span>。凡涉及“数值稳定性”的命题，均在实数运算与浮点运算两种语义下分别陈述；实数语义下的结论是浮点语义下结论的前提。</p>\n<p>本节核心定义如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（数值稳定性）</strong>：称采样递推在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 上数值稳定，若存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1,C_2&gt;0$</span>，使得对任意初值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 与任意两组独立同分布的标准高斯噪声序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{z_t\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{z_t'\\}$</span>，由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 生成的两条轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t'\\}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t-1}-x_{t-1}'\\|^2\\le C_1\\,\\mathbb E\\|x_t-x_t'\\|^2,\\qquad\n\\mathbb E\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2\\le C_2\\big(1+\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1,C_2$</span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta,M_\\theta$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t,T$</span>。此定义与“前向链的遍历性”不同：后者刻画的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的遗忘速率，而此处刻画的是采样递推作为随机映射的 Lipschitz 常数与矩增长。两者通过第 7 节的 SDE 对应发生联系，但不可互相替代。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-1-采样递推的压缩性\">1. 采样递推的压缩性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-1-采样递推的压缩性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（实数语义下的压缩估计）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\theta$</span>（对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 一致）。—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>设两条轨迹由同一噪声序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{z_t\\}$</span> 驱动（耦合），初值分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T,x_T'$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_t=x_t-x_t'$</span>。由递推，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_{t-1}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(\\Delta_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t',t)\\big)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>取范数并用三角不等式与 Lipschitz 条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\Delta_{t-1}\\|\\le\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(1+\\frac{\\beta_t L_\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big)\\|\\Delta_t\\|.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(1+\\frac{\\beta_t L_\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big)$</span>。由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\ge\\delta$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\le\\delta^{-1/2}$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\le\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge 1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 固定时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\le \\delta^{-1/2}\\big(1+L_\\theta(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)^{-1/2}\\big)=:C_1^{1/2}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 无关。两边平方取期望即得定义中的第一式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>（通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span>），这是本节要处理的核心问题：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 随之增大。下一命题给出与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关的版本，代价是引入对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较大时的额外假设。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关的压缩估计）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t_0\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 与常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_0$</span>，使得对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge t_0$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t L_\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\le L_0$</span>，而对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;t_0$</span> 用命题 1 的逐点界。—<strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge t_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\le\\delta^{-1/2}(1+L_0)$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&lt;t_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 只有有限多个，取最大值。两者取最大即得与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 的假设在 DDPM 的典型参数化下成立：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调增（线性或余弦 schedule），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 单调减，故比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 控制、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小时由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 控制，整体有界。这一有界性是第 8 节离散时间步选取的直接约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-2-矩的一致有界性\">2. 矩的一致有界性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-2-矩的一致有界性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（二阶矩增长控制）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)。—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>由递推与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|a+b\\|^2\\le 2\\|a\\|^2+2\\|b\\|^2$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2\\le 2\\mathbb E\\Big\\|\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\Big)\\Big\\|^2+2\\tilde\\beta_t d.$$</div>\n<p>对第一项再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|a-b\\|^2\\le 2\\|a\\|^2+2\\|b\\|^2$</span> 与 (A3)：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2\\le \\frac{4}{\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2+\\frac{4\\beta_t^2 M_\\theta^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}+2\\tilde\\beta_t d.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{4}{\\alpha_t}\\le 4\\delta^{-1}$</span>；由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\le 1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t\\le\\beta_t\\le 1$</span>）；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\le\\frac{1}{\\delta(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)}$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2\\le \\frac{4}{\\delta}\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2+\\frac{4M_\\theta^2}{\\delta(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)}+2d.$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2=\\max\\{4\\delta^{-1},\\, \\frac{4M_\\theta^2}{\\delta(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)}+2d\\}$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>与命题 1 同样，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 发散。这不是估计的缺陷，而是真实现象：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时，前向链已把信号完全淹没在噪声中，采样递推的漂移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}M_\\theta$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 很小时该量级可以很大。数值稳定性的工程含义正是：必须选择 schedule 使该量级在浮点动态范围内。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-3-浮点语义下的误差传播\">3. 浮点语义下的误差传播<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-3-浮点语义下的误差传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（舍入误差的单步放大）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)、(A4)。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_t$</span> 为浮点递推产生的轨迹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为实数递推在同一噪声下的轨迹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t=\\hat x_t-x_t$</span>。—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>浮点递推的每一步引入至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 相对误差的若干次运算。将递推写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=F_t(x_t,z_t)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_{t-1}=\\mathrm{fl}(F_t(\\hat x_t,z_t))$</span>。由标准舍入模型，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\rho_t\\|\\le c\\,u\\,(\\|F_t(\\hat x_t,z_t)\\|+1)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 有关的常数），使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_{t-1}=F_t(\\hat x_t,z_t)+\\rho_t.$$</div>\n<p>减去实数递推得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\epsilon_{t-1}=\\big(F_t(\\hat x_t,z_t)-F_t(x_t,z_t)\\big)+\\rho_t.$$</div>\n<p>对第一项用命题 1 的压缩界，对第二项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\rho_t\\|\\le c\\,u\\,(\\|F_t\\|+1)$</span>，并注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|F_t\\|\\le \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}(\\|x_t\\|+\\frac{\\beta_t M_\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}})+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\|z_t\\|$</span>。取期望并用命题 3 的矩界，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_{t-1}\\|^2\\le 2C_1\\mathbb E\\|\\epsilon_t\\|^2+2c^2u^2\\big(C_2'(1+\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2)+\\mathbb E\\|z_t\\|^2\\big).$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 足够小（双精度下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\approx 10^{-16}$</span>）且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 有界时，右端第二项可忽略，误差不累积放大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的要点是：舍入误差的放大率与信号误差的放大率同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span>。因此只要命题 2 的与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关的压缩界成立，浮点误差就不会随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 指数增长。反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增长，则舍入误差与信号误差以同一速率放大，这是第 10 节反例的机制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-4-可检验的恒等式-后验方差与信噪比的乘积\">4. 可检验的恒等式：后验方差与信噪比的乘积<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-4-可检验的恒等式-后验方差与信噪比的乘积\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 5（方差—信噪比恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)。—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>记信噪比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t=\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1},\\qquad\n\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\frac{1}{\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>两式相乘并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，得恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\beta_t}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}_{t-1}}{\\mathrm{SNR}_t}=\\frac{1}{\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}_t}{\\mathrm{SNR}_{t-1}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此恒等式可用于代码验证：给定任意 schedule，逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 计算两端应在浮点误差内相等。它同时说明后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 与相邻两步信噪比之比成正比，这解释了为何在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{SNR}_t$</span> 很小）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 仍保持与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 同量级——信噪比之比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm{SNR}_t}{\\mathrm{SNR}_{t-1}}=\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-5-具体例子-线性-schedule-下的稳定性常数\">5. 具体例子：线性 schedule 下的稳定性常数<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-5-具体例子-线性-schedule-下的稳定性常数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1000$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=10^{-4}$</span> 线性增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_T=0.02$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=10^{-4}+\\frac{0.02-10^{-4}}{T-1}(t-1)$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=\\prod_{t}(1-\\beta_t)$</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_T=\\sum_t\\log(1-\\beta_t)\\approx-\\sum_t\\beta_t$</span> 估计，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\beta_t\\approx T\\cdot\\frac{10^{-4}+0.02}{2}\\approx 10$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\approx e^{-10}\\approx 4.5\\times 10^{-5}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T\\approx 1$</span>。于是命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1^{1/2}\\le\\delta^{-1/2}(1+L_\\theta)\\approx 100(1+L_\\theta)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 已接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。这正是线性 schedule 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1000$</span> 时数值稳定的定量依据。若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^5$</span> 而保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_T=0.02$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\beta_t\\approx 10^3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\approx e^{-1000}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T\\approx 1$</span> 仍成立，稳定性常数不变；但若保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\beta_t\\approx 10$</span> 而把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 量级降至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 变小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 增大——这是第 8 节离散时间步与第 10 节反例的交界处。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-采样递推的谱半径与逐坐标稳定性\">6. 采样递推的谱半径与逐坐标稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-采样递推的谱半径与逐坐标稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 给出的是算子范数意义下的压缩估计，它对所有方向一致。但 DDPM 采样递推的漂移项是逐坐标的（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 输出与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 同维），其线性化算子的谱结构决定了误差在哪些方向上被放大、哪些方向上被压缩。本节给出逐坐标的稳定性判据，它与命题 1 互补：命题 1 给充分条件，谱判据给必要条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（线性化算子的谱界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t)$</span> 在采样轨迹附近可微，其 Jacobian <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t(x)=\\partial_x\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|J_t(x)\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\le L_\\theta$</span>。—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>将递推在固定点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 处线性化，忽略噪声项（噪声项与状态无关，不贡献谱），得线性算子</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(I-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}J_t(x_t)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>对任意单位向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|A_t v\\|\\le\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(1+\\frac{\\beta_t L_\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big)=c_t$</span>，故谱半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(A_t)\\le c_t$</span>。另一方面，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 在某个方向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 上的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t$</span> 在该方向的特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(1-\\frac{\\beta_t\\lambda}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda&lt;0$</span>（网络输出在该方向上与输入反相关）时，该特征值的模为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\big(1+\\frac{\\beta_t|\\lambda|}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big)$</span>，达到上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 的量级。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 的推论是：采样递推的稳定性不仅取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的大小，还取决于网络 Jacobian 的负特征值。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 在某个方向上系统性地“反向预测”（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 有显著负特征值），则该方向的误差放大率接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 的上界。这与命题 1 的算子范数估计一致，但谱判据更精细：它指出放大发生在特定方向，而非各向同性。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（逐坐标方差传播）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：同命题 6，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 可对角化，其特征值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_1,\\dots,\\lambda_d$</span>。—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J_t$</span> 的特征基下，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon_t$</span> 的每个坐标分量独立传播，第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 个分量的方差按因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}(1-\\frac{\\beta_t\\lambda_i}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}})\\big)^2$</span> 缩放。取所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 的最大值即得命题 1 的界；取最小值则给出该步的最优压缩方向。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论的实际意义：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 很小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 可能很大，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_i&gt;0$</span> 则对应特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}(1-\\frac{\\beta_t\\lambda_i}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}})$</span> 可能接近零甚至变号——这是采样递推在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时出现数值振荡的谱机制。第 8 节的离散时间步选取正是要避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t\\lambda_i}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 越过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-7-前向链的遍历性与采样稳定性的分离\">7. 前向链的遍历性与采样稳定性的分离<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-7-前向链的遍历性与采样稳定性的分离\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一个常见的混淆是：把前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 的遍历性（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的遗忘）当作采样递推数值稳定的依据。本节明确指出这两者不是同一回事，并给出分离的定量表述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（遗忘速率与压缩常数的分离）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)。—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>前向链的遗忘速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 刻画：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的均值对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的依赖为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时该依赖消失。这是前向链的混合性质，与采样递推的算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t$</span> 无关。采样递推的压缩常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}(1+\\frac{\\beta_t L_\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}})$</span> 依赖的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。两者可以独立变化：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 快速趋于零（前向链快速遗忘），同时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 小），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\approx 1$</span>（采样稳定）；反之取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 小），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 大（采样不稳定），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 也快速趋于零（前向链仍快速遗忘）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 的结论是：前向链的遍历性不能推出采样递推的数值稳定性，反之亦然。数值稳定性必须由命题 1、命题 2 的压缩常数单独判定。这一分离在第 7 节的 SDE 对应中有对应物：前向 SDE 的漂移系数与反向 SDE 的漂移系数通过得分函数联系，但两者的数值刚性（stiffness）不同——前向 SDE 是线性的、刚性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta(t)$</span> 控制；反向 SDE 的刚性由得分函数的 Lipschitz 常数控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-8-数值稳定性的可检验判据\">8. 数值稳定性的可检验判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-8-数值稳定性的可检验判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节给出一个不依赖网络具体形式、只依赖 schedule 与网络 Lipschitz 常数的判据，可在训练前对 schedule 做数值稳定性筛查。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（schedule 筛查判据）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)，且已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\theta$</span> 的上界估计。—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>由命题 1，采样递推在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 上数值稳定的充分条件是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\max_{1\\le t\\le T}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\Big(1+\\frac{\\beta_t L_\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big)\\le C_1^{1/2},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1^{1/2}$</span> 是预设的稳定性阈值（例如取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span>，对应每步误差放大不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 倍）。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 代入，逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 计算左端，若最大值超过阈值则 schedule 不满足充分条件。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此判据的实用形式是：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 序列与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\theta$</span> 估计，计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\beta_t}}\\Big(1+\\frac{\\beta_t L_\\theta}{\\sqrt{1-\\prod_{s=1}^{t}(1-\\beta_s)}}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_t c_t$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_t c_t\\le 10$</span> 则通过。对第 5 节的线性 schedule（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1000$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_T=0.02$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 的最大值出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 处：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\approx 0.02$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\approx 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\approx\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.98}}(1+0.02 L_\\theta)\\approx 1.01(1+0.02 L_\\theta)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\theta\\le 10$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\le 1.21$</span>，远低于阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span>。这说明线性 schedule 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1000$</span> 时对 Lipschitz 常数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 的网络是数值稳定的。</p>\n<p>反之，若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^5$</span> 而保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\beta_t\\approx 10$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\approx 1-10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\approx 1+5\\times 10^{-5}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\approx 1$</span>，判据仍通过。但此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=10^{-4}$</span>，命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1^{1/2}\\le\\delta^{-1/2}(1+L_\\theta)\\approx 100(1+L_\\theta)$</span>，远大于阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span>——这说明命题 1 的充分条件过于保守，而命题 9 的逐点判据更精确。两者的差异来自命题 1 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 统一控制 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span>，而命题 9 逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 计算实际值。数值稳定性筛查应使用命题 9 的逐点判据，命题 1 的界仅用于理论分析。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-9-与第-8-节离散时间步的接口\">9. 与第 8 节离散时间步的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-9-与第-8-节离散时间步的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 8 节讨论的是离散时间步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t=1/T$</span> 与连续 SDE 的对应，本节讨论的是离散递推的数值稳定性。两者的接口是：连续 SDE 的 Euler-Maruyama 离散化稳定性要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 小于漂移项 Lipschitz 常数的倒数，而 DDPM 的离散递推是精确的（每一步都是高斯转移的精确采样），不存在 Euler 离散化的截断误差。因此 DDPM 的数值稳定性问题不是离散化误差问题，而是浮点运算与网络 Lipschitz 常数的问题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（精确转移与 Euler 离散的稳定性对比）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)、(A3)。—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>DDPM 采样递推的每一步是后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的精确采样（在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 下），其转移核是高斯，均值和方差由闭式给出，无截断误差。因此其稳定性只由命题 1 的压缩常数与命题 4 的舍入误差决定。相比之下，若把反向 SDE 用 Euler-Maruyama 离散化，则漂移项的 Lipschitz 常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t&lt;1/L$</span> 才能稳定；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta t$</span> 必须小，这对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 必须大。DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 选取不受此约束，因为每步是精确转移而非 Euler 近似。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题澄清了一个常见误解：DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 不需要满足 Euler 稳定性条件，因为 DDPM 不是 SDE 的 Euler 离散化，而是离散马尔可夫链的精确采样。第 7 节的 SDE 对应是极限关系（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 时 DDPM 收敛到 VP-SDE），而非数值离散化关系。数值稳定性分析应针对离散链本身，而非其 SDE 极限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-10-浮点下溢与-bar-alpha_t-的计算\">10. 浮点下溢与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-10-浮点下溢与-bar-alpha_t-的计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个实现层面的稳定性问题：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s\\le t}\\alpha_s$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 大时可能下溢至零，导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 的计算出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/0$</span>。这不是数学问题，而是浮点表示问题，但其处理方式影响数值稳定性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11（对数域计算的稳定性）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A4)。—<strong>证明</strong>：</p>\n<p>直接连乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 大时下溢：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;2^{-1074}$</span>（双精度最小次正规数）时，浮点结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，此后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=1$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的信息已丢失。改用对数域：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t=\\sum_{s\\le t}\\log\\alpha_s$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=e^{\\ell_t}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t&lt;-745$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\ell_t}$</span> 下溢至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 本身仍是有限浮点数，可用于计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下溢时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=1$</span>，无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的具体值。因此对数域计算避免了中间量下溢导致的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实现含义：在代码中应存储 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，在需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\ell_t)$</span>，在需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\exp(\\ell_t)}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_t$</span> 很负时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\ell_t)$</span> 下溢为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-0}=1$</span>，结果正确）。这与第 13 节代码节的实现直接对应。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>采样递推的信号压缩常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta^{-1/2}(1+L_\\theta(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)^{-1/2})$</span> 控制；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 有正下界时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关，这是数值稳定的充分条件。</li>\n<li>二阶矩增长常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2$</span> 含项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{M_\\theta^2}{\\delta(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to 0$</span> 时发散；数值稳定要求 schedule 使该项处于浮点动态范围内。</li>\n<li>舍入误差与信号误差以同一压缩常数传播（命题 4），故浮点稳定性不引入额外的、与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 相关的放大机制；后验方差—信噪比恒等式（推论 5）给出可逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 验证的自洽性检验。</li>\n<li>命题 6 与推论 7 给出采样递推的谱判据：误差放大发生在网络 Jacobian 负特征值对应的方向，放大率接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 的上界；逐坐标方差传播因子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}(1-\\frac{\\beta_t\\lambda_i}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}})\\big)^2$</span>。</li>\n<li>命题 8 分离了前向链的遍历性与采样递推的数值稳定性：前者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 刻画，后者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 刻画，两者可独立变化，不能互相推出。</li>\n<li>命题 9 给出可逐 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 计算的 schedule 筛查判据 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_t c_t\\le C_1^{1/2}$</span>，命题 10 澄清 DDPM 的精确转移不受 Euler 稳定性条件约束，命题 11 给出对数域计算避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 下溢的实现准则。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-反例-T-过小导致不可逆\">反例：T 过小导致不可逆<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-反例-T-过小导致不可逆\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t=0}^{T}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>，转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>。闭式边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>。后验\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\\ \\tilde\\beta_t I\\right),\n\\qquad \\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t .$$</div>\n记反向生成核为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(t))$</span>。本节仅讨论“不可逆”的精确含义，不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的训练细节。</p>\n<p>本节引入的辅助符号（仅本节使用）：对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，记前向边缘密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d}$</span> 上关于 Lebesgue 测度的 Radon–Nikodym 密度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_t(x\\mid x_0)$</span>；记两个概率测度间的全变差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(\\cdot,\\cdot)$</span>；记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{T}$</span> 为末端累积乘积。</p>\n<p>假设（本节全局）：</p>\n<p>(A1) 维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 成立，故每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(A2) 前向链的每个转移核是高斯核，因而对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的支撑同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>，且密度处处严格正。</p>\n<p>(A3) 反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d}$</span> 上的概率核（可测、归一），不预设其形式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 匹配。</p>\n<p>“不可逆”的精确表述：称该 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步离散链在末端<strong>不可逆</strong>，若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 使前向末端边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_T(\\cdot\\mid x_0)$</span> 与反向起点分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 的支撑不交于一个正测度集，或更弱地，若从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 出发经反向核复合得到的联合分布与前向联合分布的全变差有下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 且该下界不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 缩小。本节给出的是<strong>支撑层面</strong>的不可逆反例，它比全变差下界更强、更易验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-反例构造-T-1-且-bar-alpha_1-退化时的支撑断裂\">反例构造：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1$</span> 退化时的支撑断裂<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-反例构造-T-1-且-bar-alpha_1-退化时的支撑断裂\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=1-\\alpha_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1\\in(0,1)$</span>。此时前向只有一步：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_1\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_0,\\ \\beta_1),\\qquad \\bar\\alpha_1=\\alpha_1 .$$</div>\n后验节公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 退化为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)=\\delta_{x_0},$$</div>\n因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=x_0$</span> 被条件化，后验是点质量。这不是反例，是退化恒等式。</p>\n<p>真正的反例出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 很小但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 被压到接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 的参数化下。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=1-\\alpha$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=\\alpha^2$</span>。前向末端\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_2\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\alpha x_0,\\ 1-\\alpha^2).$$</div>\n反向链从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 出发（标准高斯先验），经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_1\\mid x_2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)$</span> 复合。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 恰为前向反转（即理想贝叶斯反转），则复合分布在支撑上等于前向联合分布的边缘，此时可逆。反例要说明的是：<strong>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 小到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 使前向末端几乎不携带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 信息时，理想反转的后验方差爆炸，任何有限精度的反向核都无法在支撑上覆盖前向边缘的正测度集</strong>。下面把这个直觉做成可验证的命题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-1-小-T-下后验方差的下界\">命题 1（小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下后验方差的下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-1-小-T-下后验方差的下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^{d}$</span> 固定。仅用后验节公式，不引入新假设。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t\\ \\ge\\ \\beta_t\\ \\ge\\ 1-\\bar\\alpha_t .$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_T\\ge 1-\\bar\\alpha_T\\to1$</span>，后验标准差下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1-(1-\\beta_t)\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}.$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\n=\\frac{1}{1+\\dfrac{\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}.$$</div>\n因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\ge0$</span>，该比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\le\\beta_t$</span>；又因分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1+\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\le1$</span>，直接计算得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\ \\ge\\ \\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\ \\ge\\ \\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t).$$</div>\n最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\le\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\le1$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界情形拆解</strong>：若去掉假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 而允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=0$</span>，后验退化为点质量，反向核成为确定性映射，支撑断裂以另一种方式出现（见命题 3）。若允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span>，前向末端与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 完全独立，后验公式分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span> 仍良定义但分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，后验均值只剩 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 项，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的信息彻底丢失。这两种退化都说明 (A1) 的严格开区间不能放宽。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-2-支撑断裂的定量下界\">命题 2（支撑断裂的定量下界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-2-支撑断裂的定量下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>。前向末端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_T(\\cdot\\mid0)=\\mathcal N(0,1-\\bar\\alpha_T)$</span>。反向起点取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T=\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_T^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T&gt;0$</span> 任意有限。反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为任意概率核。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：存在仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T,\\sigma_T$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>，使对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 落在集合\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$E_T=\\{x_T\\in\\mathbb R:\\ |x_T|\\ge 2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_T}+\\sigma_T\\}$$</div>\n上，前向密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_T(x_T\\mid0)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_T(x_T\\mid0)\\le c\\,\\exp(-2)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 在该集合上的质量可正。更关键的是：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\le \\varepsilon$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T\\le\\sqrt{\\varepsilon}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(q_T(\\cdot\\mid0),p_T)\\ge 1/2-O(\\sqrt{\\varepsilon})$</span>，且该下界不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 缩小。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：前向密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_T(x\\mid0)=(2\\pi(1-\\bar\\alpha_T))^{-1/2}\\exp(-x^2/(2(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)))$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|\\ge2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_T}$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-x^2/(2(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)))\\le\\exp(-2)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_T\\le(2\\pi(1-\\bar\\alpha_T))^{-1/2}e^{-2}=:c\\,e^{-2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T$</span> 的质量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$E_T$</span> 上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\Phi(-(2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_T}+\\sigma_T)/\\sigma_T)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T\\le\\sqrt{\\varepsilon}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 时该质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi$</span> 为标准正态分布函数）。由全变差与支撑质量的关系，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}(q_T,p_T)\\ge \\frac12\\left|q_T(E_T)-p_T(E_T)\\right|.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_T(E_T)\\le c e^{-2}\\cdot|E_T|$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to0$</span> 时可估为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\varepsilon})$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T(E_T)\\to1$</span>，故下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge1/2-O(\\sqrt{\\varepsilon})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若去掉“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T\\le\\sqrt{\\varepsilon}$</span>”而令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T$</span> 固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T(E_T)$</span> 不再趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，下界退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\varepsilon})$</span>，命题 2 的“不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 缩小”结论失效。这说明反例的强度依赖于反向起点方差与前向末端方差同阶这一条件；若反向起点方差远大于前向末端方差，支撑断裂仍存在但全变差下界变弱。若去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span> 的平移归一化，结论对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 平移成立，因为高斯密度对平移等变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-3-beta_t-0-时的确定性断裂\">命题 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0$</span> 时的确定性断裂）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-3-beta_t-0-时的确定性断裂\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=1-\\beta_2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：前向链第一步为恒等映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=x_0$</span>，第二步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_2\\mid x_1)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{1-\\beta_2}\\,x_1,\\beta_2)$</span>。后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_1\\mid x_2,x_0)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 时由后验节公式给出，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span>。反向链若从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2=\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span> 出发，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_1\\mid x_2)$</span> 必须把质量集中到单点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 才能匹配前向，而任意连续核在单点上的质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}$</span> 下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=x_0$</span> 几乎必然，故前向联合分布支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_1=x_0\\}$</span> 上。反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_1\\mid x_2)$</span> 若关于 Lebesgue 测度有密度，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\{x_0\\}\\mid x_2)=0$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2$</span> 成立，故复合分布在前向支撑上的质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，而前向质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补什么条件</strong>：要避免命题 3 的断裂，需假设所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>（即 (A1) 的严格正性），使每个转移核的支撑为全空间，从而前向联合分布的支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d(T+1)}$</span>，反向核的连续密度才能在其上逐点匹配。命题 1 与命题 2 则说明：即使 (A1) 成立，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 小到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时，前向末端方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，后验方差下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，反向核需要覆盖的支撑尺度与先验同阶，理想反转的数值实现需要至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sqrt{\\varepsilon})$</span> 的精度才能把全变差压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 以下。这就是“<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小导致不可逆”的定量含义：不是链在数学上不可逆（高斯核可逆），而是<strong>在给定反向起点与有限精度下，反向复合分布与前向联合分布的全变差有与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关的正下界</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>“<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小导致不可逆”的精确内容是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to0$</span> 时前向末端方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T\\to1$</span>，后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_T\\ge1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 有与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关的正下界（命题 1），反向起点与前向末端的全变差下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge1/2-O(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T})$</span>（命题 2），该下界不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 缩小。</li>\n<li>拆掉 (A1) 的严格正性（允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0$</span>）会使前向转移退化为确定性映射，前向联合分布支撑降维，任意连续反向核在其上的质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，全变差下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（命题 3）；拆掉反向起点方差与前向末端方差同阶的条件会使命题 2 的下界退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T})$</span>。</li>\n<li>正确表述需要补充的条件是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，且反向起点方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 同阶；在此条件下，理想反转的全变差可由后验方差下界控制，数值实现所需精度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_T})$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-4-反向复合的全变差下界-从末端到起点的传递\">命题 4（反向复合的全变差下界：从末端到起点的传递）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-4-反向复合的全变差下界-从末端到起点的传递\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立（(A1)），<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>。前向联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{0:T}=q(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\delta_0$</span>。反向联合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{0:T}=p_T\\prod_{t=1}^{T}p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T=\\mathcal N(0,\\sigma_T^2)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_t$</span> 分别为前向、反向在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的边缘。设反向核满足：存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t&gt;0$</span> 使对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度的密度满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_t)\\|_\\infty\\le L_t$</span>（即反向核密度有界）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}(Q_t,P_t)\\ \\le\\ \\mathrm{TV}(Q_T,P_T)+\\sum_{s=t+1}^{T}\\mathbb E_{Q_s}\\big[\\mathrm{TV}\\big(q(\\cdot\\mid x_{s-1}),p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_s)\\big)\\big],$$</div>\n其中右侧第二项是逐步核失配的累积。特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(Q_T,P_T)\\ge\\delta$</span> 且逐步核失配之和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\eta$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(Q_t,P_t)\\ge\\delta-\\eta$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：用全变差的三角不等式与数据处理的链式分解。对相邻时刻，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{s-1,s}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s-1,s}$</span> 为联合边缘，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}(Q_{s-1},P_{s-1})\\le \\mathrm{TV}(Q_{s-1,s},P_{s-1,s}).$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{s-1,s}=Q_{s-1}\\otimes q(\\cdot\\mid x_{s-1})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s-1,s}=P_{s-1}\\otimes p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_s)$</span> 的耦合形式不对称（前向条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{s-1}$</span>，反向条件在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s$</span>），故需先对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s$</span> 取期望。由全变差的凸性（对测度的混合是凸的），\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}(Q_{s-1,s},P_{s-1,s})\\le \\mathrm{TV}(Q_s,P_s)+\\mathbb E_{Q_s}\\big[\\mathrm{TV}(q(\\cdot\\mid x_{s-1}),p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_s))\\big],$$</div>\n这一步用 Fubini 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}$</span> 对第二变量的凸性：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{s-1,s}$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int P_{s-1}(\\mathrm dx_{s-1})\\,p_\\theta(\\cdot\\mid x_s)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_{s-1,s}$</span> 逐点比较，凸性给出上界。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s=t+1,\\dots,T$</span> 求和并用三角不等式即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>拆假设展示失效</strong>：若去掉反向核密度有界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t&lt;\\infty$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{Q_s}[\\mathrm{TV}]$</span> 可能发散，命题 4 的累积项无界，下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta-\\eta$</span> 失去意义。若去掉 (A1) 使某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_s$</span> 支撑降维，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{Q_s}$</span> 关于 Lebesgue 测度的密度不存在，命题 4 的期望项需改为关于降维测度的积分，全变差比较退化为命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 下界。</p>\n<p><strong>与命题 2 的衔接</strong>：命题 2 给出末端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(Q_T,P_T)\\ge1/2-O(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T})$</span>。命题 4 说明该末端失配在反向复合中<strong>不会被放大抵消</strong>：只要逐步核失配之和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span>，起点边缘的全变差仍有正下界。这补足了“不可逆”的传递性论证——末端支撑断裂会沿反向链传播到起点，而非仅在末端局部出现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-5-后验均值的信息衰减率\">命题 5（后验均值的信息衰减率）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-5-后验均值的信息衰减率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\in(0,1)$</span>。后验均值\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t .$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t:=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t:=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t=1$</span> 不成立；正确的恒等式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^2/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}+d_t^2/\\alpha_t=1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 不成立，而<strong>精确恒等式</strong>为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}+d_t\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\ \\text{不恒为}\\ 1,$$</div>\n真正成立的是后验均值作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t$</span> 的线性组合，其系数满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad d_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad c_t+d_t\\le 1,$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t\\to1$</span>。即后验均值对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的依赖以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t$</span> 的速率消失，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的依赖趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t\\le1$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\le1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>。左端两项均非负且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\le1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\le1$</span>，直接比较：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t\\le\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\le1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，故左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\beta_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=1-\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，此式未必 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，需更精细估计。改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t\\le\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\alpha_t)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\le(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，合并得左端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\alpha_t)+(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时该上界趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0+1=1$</span>，与右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 一致；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to1$</span> 时上界趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\alpha_t)+0=\\beta_t$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to\\beta_t$</span>，亦一致。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t\\le1$</span> 在两端渐近成立，中间由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\cdot}$</span> 的凹性保证不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>边界情形</strong>：若去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 而令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t=1$</span>，后验均值退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 信息完全丢失——这与命题 3 的确定性断裂一致。若令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=0$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 分子含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span> 时可能非零，需单独处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的退化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-6-T-与-bar-alpha_T-的权衡-给定精度所需的最小步数\">命题 6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 的权衡：给定精度所需的最小步数）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-6-T-与-bar-alpha_T-的权衡-给定精度所需的最小步数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=(1-\\beta)^T$</span>。给定目标全变差精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1/2)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：为使命题 2 的下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(Q_T,P_T)\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 可能成立（即末端失配可被压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 以下），必须\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T\\ \\ge\\ T_{\\min}(\\beta,\\varepsilon):=\\left\\lceil\\frac{\\log\\varepsilon}{\\log(1-\\beta)}\\right\\rceil .$$</div>\n反之，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;T_{\\min}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T&gt;\\varepsilon$</span>，命题 2 的下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge1/2-O(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T})$</span> 仍为常数阶，末端失配无法被压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T=(1-\\beta)^T\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\log(1-\\beta)\\le\\log\\varepsilon$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta)&lt;0$</span>，除以负数翻转不等号得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge\\log\\varepsilon/\\log(1-\\beta)$</span>，取整即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\min}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>定量估计</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.01$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\min}=\\lceil\\log0.01/\\log0.9\\rceil=\\lceil(-4.605)/(-0.105)\\rceil=\\lceil43.8\\rceil=44$</span>。即在该参数化下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T&lt;44$</span> 时末端方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 仍显著大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span>，命题 2 的全变差下界不能压到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.01$</span>。这给出“<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小”的可操作阈值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 必须至少与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/\\varepsilon)/\\beta$</span> 同阶（小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta)\\approx-\\beta$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>拆假设</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 非常数，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{\\min}$</span> 需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\log(1-\\beta_t)\\le\\log\\varepsilon$</span> 求解，命题 6 的闭式仅适用于常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>。若去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&lt;1/2$</span>，命题 2 的下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2-O(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T})$</span> 可能小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，此时“不可逆”的定量陈述需改用全变差本身而非其下界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-7-理想反转下后验方差与先验方差的匹配条件\">命题 7（理想反转下后验方差与先验方差的匹配条件）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-7-理想反转下后验方差与先验方差的匹配条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>。前向末端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_T=\\mathcal N(0,1-\\bar\\alpha_T)$</span>。理想反转的反向起点应取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_T=Q_T$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：在理想反转下，反向第一步的后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_T$</span> 与先验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T^2$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_T=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{T-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_T}\\beta_T,\\qquad \\sigma_T^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_T,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_T/\\sigma_T^2=\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{T-1}}{(1-\\bar\\alpha_T)^2}\\beta_T$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to0$</span> 时该比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\beta_T$</span>，故后验方差与先验方差同阶（均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>），反向核的支撑尺度与先验一致，命题 2 的支撑断裂条件（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T\\le\\sqrt{\\varepsilon}$</span>）在理想反转下自动满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_T}\\approx1$</span>，此时命题 2 的下界退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T})$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：直接代入后验方差公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to0$</span> 的极限即得比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\beta_T$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>正确表述需补什么条件</strong>：命题 2 的强下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/2-O(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T})$</span> 依赖于反向起点方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T^2$</span> 与前向末端方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> <strong>不同阶</strong>（具体地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T\\le\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_T}\\ll\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_T}$</span>）。若采用理想反转 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_T^2=1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span>，则末端失配本身为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Q_T=P_T$</span>），命题 2 不适用；此时“不可逆”只能通过逐步核失配（命题 4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 项）来度量，而非末端支撑断裂。这澄清了反例的适用范围：<strong>“<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小导致不可逆”针对的是反向起点被错误设为窄分布（如标准高斯而非匹配前向末端）的情形</strong>；若起点匹配，则小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的问题转化为训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下方差估计的困难，而非支撑层面的不可逆。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-8-mathcal-L_-mathrm-simple-在小-T-下的梯度偏差\">命题 8（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下的梯度偏差）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-8-mathcal-L_-mathrm-simple-在小-T-下的梯度偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>。网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 可微，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> Lipschitz。损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to\\varepsilon$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时的最优解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\approx x_t$</span>（恒等映射），此时损失对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度仅通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的依赖传递，梯度尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})=O(1)$</span>。反之当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\to x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的信息被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 压缩，梯度尺度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})\\to0$</span>，即小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的梯度信号消失。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial\\mathcal L/\\partial\\theta=2\\mathbb E[(\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)-\\varepsilon)\\cdot\\partial_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)]$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial x_t/\\partial\\varepsilon=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，链式法则给出梯度中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的显式依赖乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1$</span> 时该因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>，梯度信号被压缩；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to0$</span> 时因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to1$</span>，梯度信号完整。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>与反例的关系</strong>：命题 8 说明小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的另一面——若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小使所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 都远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 本身小），则<strong>所有步</strong>的梯度信号都接近满幅，训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下并不退化；退化的恰是反向起点与末端分布的匹配（命题 2、命题 7）。因此“<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小导致不可逆”不是训练目标的问题，而是采样起点选择的问题：小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 时前向末端方差大，若采样仍从标准高斯出发而非匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span>，则支撑断裂；若匹配，则需接受命题 4 的逐步核失配累积。两条路径都指向同一结论：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 必须足够大，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 足够小且末端方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 与先验方差可匹配，否则反向链的起点选择与核匹配之间存在不可消除的张力</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-条件后验的推导\">条件后验的推导<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-条件后验的推导\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t)_{t=0}^{T}$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>，转移核\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N\\bigl(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\,\\beta_t I\\bigr),\\qquad \\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t,\\quad \\beta_t\\in(0,1),$$</div>\n累积乘积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>。前序节已证闭式边缘\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N\\bigl(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0,\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I\\bigr).$$</div>\n本节新引入的符号仅有：给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 的联合密度记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>；其后验密度记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>；后验均值向量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\in\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>，后验协方差记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 为标量。指标范围 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span> 为整数维数。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设逐条列出，并在证明中逐处引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 非退化性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。此假设保证所有出现的协方差矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t I$</span> 正定，高斯密度处处为正，条件密度由 Bayes 公式逐点定义而无零测集歧义。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^{d}$</span> 固定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^{d}$</span> 任意；所有涉及的高斯密度属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^{1}(\\mathbb R^{d})\\cap L^{2}(\\mathbb R^{d})$</span>，故 Fubini 与 Dominated Convergence 可用。此假设在本情境下自动成立，因为高斯密度具有有限各阶矩。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 维度与坐标</strong>：所有向量为列向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 单位阵；协方差矩阵的逆与行列式按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维标准公式计算。本节所有等式均为无坐标的向量—矩阵表述，逐分量成立。</p>\n<p>本节的核心定义是<strong>条件后验</strong>：它指在联合高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)\\mid x_0$</span> 下，以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 为条件的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的条件分布。它与前序节已定义的“边缘闭式” <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 的区别在于：边缘只涉及单一时刻，而后验涉及相邻两时刻的联合；它与“反向转移” <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 的区别在于：后验以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件，是可计算的闭式，而反向转移以参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 近似、不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>。本节只推导前者，不涉及后者。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-联合高斯的显式密度\">联合高斯的显式密度<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-联合高斯的显式密度\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（联合密度分解）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0),$$</div>\n且右端两个因子分别为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N\\bigl(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\,\\beta_t I\\bigr),\\qquad\nq(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N\\bigl(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0,\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I\\bigr).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由前向链的马尔可夫性与转移核定义，给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)$</span> 的联合密度等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span>，这是链式法则的直接应用，无需额外条件。两个因子均为高斯密度：第一个由转移核定义，第二个由前序节的闭式边缘（取指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span>）给出。在 (A1) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&gt;0$</span>，两密度处处为正且可积，故分解在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d}\\times\\mathbb R^{d}$</span> 上逐点成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 的关键在于：联合密度是两个高斯的乘积，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_{t-1},x_t)\\mid x_0$</span> 是联合高斯。这一点使后验条件化可以用配方法精确完成，而不需要一般测度论条件化的抽象工具。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-配方法-后验均值与协方差\">配方法：后验均值与协方差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-配方法-后验均值与协方差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 2（条件后验闭式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 为高斯\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\bigl(\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\,\\tilde\\beta_t I\\bigr),$$</div>\n其中\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t,\\qquad\n\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{\\beta_t\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 1，联合密度的对数（忽略与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 无关的常数）为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q(x_{t-1},x_t\\mid x_0)=-\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1}\\|^{2}-\\frac{1}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\|x_{t-1}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0\\|^{2}+C(x_t,x_0).$$</div>\n将右端视为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的二次型。展开两项：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{\\beta_t}\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}\\|^2=\\frac{1}{\\beta_t}\\bigl(\\|x_t\\|^2-2\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_t^{\\top}x_{t-1}+\\alpha_t\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2\\bigr),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\|x_{t-1}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\bigl(\\|x_{t-1}\\|^2-2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0^{\\top}x_{t-1}+\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\|x_0\\|^2\\bigr).$$</div>\n合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的二次项系数：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q=\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}.$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，通分得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Q=\\frac{(1-\\beta_t)(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t}{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\n=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\beta_t+\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}+\\beta_t}{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\n=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}.$$</div>\n故后验协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q^{-1}I=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，与定理陈述一致。</p>\n<p>再合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的一次项。线性项为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}\\,x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0,$$</div>\n其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的贡献是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-2L^{\\top}x_{t-1}$</span>。高斯密度的均值满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=Q^{-1}L$</span>，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\right).$$</div>\n逐项化简：第一项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，第二项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。这正是定理陈述中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>。由于二次型系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q&gt;0$</span>（由 (A1) 保证），配方式给出的密度在全空间可积且归一，故条件密度确为该高斯。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 2 的证明只用了代数配方，没有交换积分与极限，也没有求导与积分交换，因此无需引用 Dominated Convergence 或 Leibniz；唯一需要的可积性由 (A2) 保证，用于确认配方式得到的函数确是概率密度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-可检验恒等式-均值是两端的凸组合\">可检验恒等式：均值是两端的凸组合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-可检验恒等式-均值是两端的凸组合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 3（凸组合恒等式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_0(t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},\\qquad c_t(t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0(t)+c_t(t)=1$</span> 不成立为一般等式；成立的是如下<strong>加权恒等式</strong>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t\\,x_0+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\,x_t\\cdot\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\,1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\,}\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n更简洁且可直接检验的恒等式是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\Bigl(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t\\,x_0+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\,x_t\\Bigr),$$</div>\n且系数满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})=1-\\bar\\alpha_t+\\bigl(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})-(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)\\bigr),$$</div>\n右端括号内一般不为零；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的凸组合，而是仿射组合，其系数之和为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　直接由定理 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 表达式读出系数，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 即可。系数之和一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，例如取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0=\\frac{1\\cdot 0.1}{0.1}=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot 0}{0.1}=0$</span>，和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；但取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.81$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.1}{0.19}\\approx0.499$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.1}{0.19}\\approx0.499$</span>，和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.998\\neq1$</span>。故凸组合断言为假，仿射组合断言为真。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 的价值在于纠正一个常见误读：后验均值并非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的凸组合；它的系数之和一般略小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，差额由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的尺度吸收。这一恒等式可直接在代码中检验（见后文代码节接口）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-具体例子-d-1-t-1-的逐项验证\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的逐项验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-具体例子-d-1-t-1-的逐项验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=1.5$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>。由定理 2：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\frac{0.1\\cdot(1-1)}{1-0.9}=0,$$</div>\n这暴露了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span> 的退化。这说明定理 2 的陈述在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时协方差退化为零，条件密度成为点质量；此时 (A1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\in(0,1)$</span> 的要求在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 不满足（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>）。因此定理 2 的严格适用范围是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时后验退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 与转移核完全确定（在无噪声极限下）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=1.2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.81$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.9$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{0.1\\cdot(1-0.9)}{1-0.81}=\\frac{0.01}{0.19}\\approx0.0526,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.1}{0.19}\\cdot2+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot(1-0.9)}{0.19}\\cdot1.2\n\\approx\\frac{0.0949}{0.19}\\cdot2+\\frac{0.0949}{0.19}\\cdot1.2\n\\approx0.999\\cdot2+0.499\\cdot1.2\\approx2.597.$$</div>\n直接代入定理 2 公式可得同一数值，验证了配方法的代数正确性。此例同时说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的退化不是定理 2 的错误，而是假设 (A1) 在边界指标处不成立所致；本章第 10 节已集中处理此类边界情形，本节不再展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-与训练目标的接口\">与训练目标的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-与训练目标的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 2 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 是训练目标节中参数化反向均值的<strong>目标值</strong>。必须强调：目标值相等不等于梯度相等。训练目标节定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 通过重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测来间接拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>，其梯度结构由该节的链式法则给出，本节不重复。本节只确认：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的闭式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 中噪声预测目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的代数来源，即把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的仿射函数后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 的倒数关系。这一代数关系在代码节中被逐项 assert。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-后验均值作为-x_t-的仿射算子-矩阵形式与谱性质\">后验均值作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射算子：矩阵形式与谱性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-后验均值作为-x_t-的仿射算子-矩阵形式与谱性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（后验均值的仿射算子结构）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mapsto\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d}\\to\\mathbb R^{d}$</span> 的仿射算子\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=A_t\\,x_t+b_t(x_0),$$</div>\n其中\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,I\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d},\\qquad\nb_t(x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0\\in\\mathbb R^{d}.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t$</span> 是标量矩阵，其特征值全为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，重数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>；且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3)，并额外要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\in(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　仿射结构由定理 2 的表达式直接读出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的系数是标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span> 乘单位阵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的贡献与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 无关，故为平移项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t$</span>。特征值断言由标量矩阵的谱性质给出。正性与上界：由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\in(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t&gt;0$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lambda_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}&lt;\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}&lt;1.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的意义在于：后验均值对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的依赖是<strong>压缩</strong>的，压缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t&lt;1$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而减小（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而减小，分子缩小、分母增大）。这与前向链的“信息逐步被噪声淹没”一致：越靠后的时刻，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 后验均值的直接影响越弱，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的先验贡献相对越强。注意这是对<strong>均值算子</strong>的谱断言，不是对后验协方差的断言；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的尺度由另一条代数关系给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-后验协方差的单调性与极限行为\">后验协方差的单调性与极限行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-后验协方差的单调性与极限行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的单调性与两个极限）</strong>　在 (A1) 下，序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\beta_t)_{t=2}^{T}$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t\\cdot\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t},$$</div>\n且因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\in(0,1)$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span> 成立。此外：</p>\n<p>(i) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0^{+}$</span>（其余参数固定）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to0^{+}$</span>，后验退化为点质量；</p>\n<p>(ii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to0^{+}$</span>（即前向链已充分混合、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 很大）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to1$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t\\to1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)；极限陈述 (i)(ii) 额外要求其余参数在该极限过程中保持不变，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的依赖关系可追踪。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　因子恒等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的定义直接改写。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&gt;0$</span>，故因子属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p>(i) 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to0$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\to1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，因子趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t\\cdot(\\text{因子})\\to0$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to0$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to0$</span>，分子与分母同时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，因子趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t\\to1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 给出两个可检验的边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 永远严格小于当步前向方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>，这是“以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为条件”所获得的方差缩减；而在链的末端，缩减消失，后验方差回到前向方差量级。这与本章第 6 节方差选择节的讨论衔接：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 是反向方差的一个自然候选下界，但反向转移的参数化不必等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，二者的关系属于方差选择节的内容，本节不展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-条件后验的对数密度梯度-与得分函数的恒等关系\">条件后验的对数密度梯度：与得分函数的恒等关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-条件后验的对数密度梯度-与得分函数的恒等关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（后验对数梯度恒等式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，条件密度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的对数梯度满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_{t-1}}\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=-\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}\\bigl(x_{t-1}-\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\bigr).$$</div>\n进一步，将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 代入并整理，得到与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的显式关系\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_{x_{t-1}}\\log q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-x_{t-1}\\right).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3)。求导与期望的交换在此不需要：本命题只对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span> 的密度求梯度，属于逐点微分，不涉及积分号下求导。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由定理 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 是协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 的高斯密度，其对数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log q=-\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\|x_{t-1}-\\mu_t\\|^2-\\frac{d}{2}\\log(2\\pi\\tilde\\beta_t).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 求梯度，第二项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 无关，第一项给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}(x_{t-1}-\\mu_t)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的表达式即得第二式。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>（命题 5），逆存在。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 是本节与后续“与连续 SDE 的对应”节之间的代数桥梁：在连续极限下，后验对数梯度对应反向 SDE 的漂移中的得分项。但必须严格区分：命题 6 给出的是<strong>离散条件后验</strong>的对数梯度，它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的函数；而反向 SDE 的漂移是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的函数，二者通过时间指标与变量替换相联系，这一替换属于 SDE 对应节的内容。本节只确认离散侧的恒等式成立，不主张连续侧的等价性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-一个可检验的恒等式-后验均值与边缘均值的相容性\">一个可检验的恒等式：后验均值与边缘均值的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-一个可检验的恒等式-后验均值与边缘均值的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7（边缘—后验相容恒等式）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}\\bigl[\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\bigr]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0.$$</div>\n即后验均值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的边缘分布下的期望，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的边缘均值。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3)。期望的存在性由 (A2) 保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射函数，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span> 是有限二阶矩的高斯，故期望有限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由命题 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=A_t x_t+b_t(x_0)$</span>。取期望：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}[\\mu_t]=A_t\\,\\mathbb E[x_t]+b_t(x_0).$$</div>\n由前序节的闭式边缘，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_t]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+b_t(x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0.$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，第一项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\alpha_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>。与第二项合并，提取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>，括号内为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t=(1-\\beta_t)(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\beta_t+\\beta_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}+\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t.$$</div>\n故合并结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 是一个<strong>可检验的相容性恒等式</strong>：它把后验均值、边缘均值与闭式边缘三者绑定。任何数值实现若违反此恒等式，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的递推有误。代码节将以此恒等式作为 assert 之一。该恒等式也解释了命题 4 中“仿射而非凸”的系数结构：正因为系数之和小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，取期望后才能精确抵消到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>；若误以为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 是凸组合，则期望会给出错误的边缘均值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-维度与坐标的说明\">维度与坐标的说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-维度与坐标的说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有命题均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d}$</span> 上以无坐标向量—矩阵形式陈述。逐分量地，对每个坐标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>，定理 2 给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q\\bigl((x_{t-1})_i\\mid x_t,x_0\\bigr)=\\mathcal N\\bigl((\\mu_t)_i,\\,(\\tilde\\beta_t)_{ii}\\bigr),$$</div>\n且不同坐标在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span> 后条件独立，因为协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 是对角的。这一条件独立性是前向链各坐标独立加噪的直接后果，不构成额外假设。命题 4 的标量矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A_t$</span> 在逐分量表述下即每个坐标乘以同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t$</span>；命题 6 的梯度在逐分量表述下即每个坐标的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}((x_{t-1})_i-(\\mu_t)_i)$</span>。坐标独立性使得本节所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维断言可逐坐标验证，代码节利用这一点对每个坐标分别 assert。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-后验密度与反向转移的代数接口\">后验密度与反向转移的代数接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-后验密度与反向转移的代数接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 6 给出的后验对数梯度是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的函数，而训练目标节中的噪声预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为输入。二者之间的接口不是恒等，而是<strong>变量替换下的代数重写</strong>。本小节只做这一步重写，不主张任何梯度等价性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（后验均值的噪声重参数化）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R^{d}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 由前向闭式的重参数化给出）。则后验均值可写成\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon\\right).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3)；重参数化等式作为代数恒等式使用，不涉及概率测度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 代入定理 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 表达式。先处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 项的合并：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\bigl(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon\\bigr).$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的总系数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\bigl(\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\bigr)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}},$$</div>\n其中第二步用了命题 7 证明中的同一恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}x_t-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n第一项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的总系数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=-\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n通分，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，分子为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})=-(1-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\alpha_t-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\n=-1+\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}+\\alpha_t-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=\\alpha_t-1=-\\beta_t.$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的总系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\beta_t/(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>，与命题陈述一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 的用途是明确的：它把定理 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的仿射函数，系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span> 是训练目标节中噪声预测网络输出所乘的标量。注意命题 8 是<strong>代数重写</strong>，不是分布断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 在此只是一个满足重参数化等式的向量，命题不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 服从标准正态，也不声称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的梯度等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的梯度。后者属于训练目标节的链式法则，本节不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-后验协方差的逆与精度矩阵\">后验协方差的逆与精度矩阵<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-后验协方差的逆与精度矩阵\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9（精度矩阵的加法分解）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，后验精度矩阵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}I$</span> 满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}I=\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}I+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}I.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　由定理 2 证明中的二次项系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Q=\\dfrac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\dfrac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=Q^{-1}$</span> 直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 说明后验精度是<strong>两个前向精度之和</strong>：一项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mid x_{t-1}$</span> 的转移精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t/\\beta_t$</span>，另一项来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\mid x_0$</span> 的边缘精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>。这是高斯条件化的标准精度加法，在标量情形下即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sigma^2=1/\\sigma_1^2+1/\\sigma_2^2$</span>。它给出一个可检验的数值恒等式：任何实现若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}$</span> 不等于上述两项之和，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的递推有误。命题 9 与命题 5 互补：命题 5 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的乘积形式与单调性，命题 9 给出其倒数形式的加法结构；两者在代数上等价，但分别适用于不同的数值检验场景（前者检验尺度，后者检验精度累加）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-条件后验的-KL-散度-两个高斯之间的闭式\">条件后验的 KL 散度：两个高斯之间的闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-条件后验的-KL-散度-两个高斯之间的闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 10（后验与前向边缘的 KL）</strong>　在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\mid x_0$</span> 的边缘，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t=\\mathcal N(\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span> 为条件后验。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q_t\\,\\|\\,p_t)=\\frac{d}{2}\\left(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}+\\frac{\\|\\mu_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-\\log\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}-1\\right).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)–(A3)。KL 的存在性由两高斯协方差正定保证，无需额外可积性。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>　两高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_1,\\Sigma_1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(m_2,\\Sigma_2)$</span> 的 KL 闭式为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)+(\\mu_2-\\mu_1)^{\\top}\\Sigma_2^{-1}(\\mu_2-\\mu_1)-d+\\log\\frac{\\det\\Sigma_2}{\\det\\Sigma_1}\\right).$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_1=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_2=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{tr}(\\Sigma_2^{-1}\\Sigma_1)=d\\,\\tilde\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\det\\Sigma_2/\\det\\Sigma_1)=d\\log\\bigl((1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/\\tilde\\beta_t\\bigr)$</span>，二次项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>。合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 的意义在于：它把“后验偏离边缘多少”写成可计算的标量，且该标量只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的比值与均值差的范数。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 恰好取边缘均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span> 时，由命题 7 的推导可知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>，二次项为零，KL 退化为纯方差项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}(\\rho-1-\\log\\rho)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=\\tilde\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})&lt;1$</span>，故 KL 为正。这与命题 5 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>（因因子小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span>）一致。本命题不涉及反向转移的参数化，只作为后验闭式的一个可检验推论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-一个数值恒等式的显式验证\">一个数值恒等式的显式验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-一个数值恒等式的显式验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=\\beta_2=\\beta_3=0.2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(1,-1)^{\\top}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=(0.5,0.5)^{\\top}$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.8$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.64$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_3=0.512$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_3=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_3}=\\sqrt{0.488}\\approx0.6986$</span>。由重参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_3=\\sqrt{0.512}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{0.488}\\,\\varepsilon\\approx(0.7155\\cdot1+0.3493,\\,0.7155\\cdot(-1)+0.3493)\\approx(1.0648,-0.3662)$</span>。</p>\n<p>由定理 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_3=\\dfrac{0.2\\cdot(1-0.64)}{1-0.512}=\\dfrac{0.072}{0.488}\\approx0.1475$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_3$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{0.64}\\cdot0.2}{0.488}\\approx\\dfrac{0.16}{0.488}\\approx0.3279$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_3$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{0.8}\\cdot(1-0.64)}{0.488}\\approx\\dfrac{0.8944\\cdot0.36}{0.488}\\approx0.6598$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_3\\approx0.3279\\cdot(1,-1)+0.6598\\cdot(1.0648,-0.3662)\\approx(0.3279+0.7026,\\,-0.3279-0.2416)\\approx(1.0305,-0.5695)$</span>。</p>\n<p>由命题 8 的噪声重参数化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_3=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{0.8}}\\bigl(x_3-\\dfrac{0.2}{\\sqrt{0.488}}\\varepsilon\\bigr)\\approx1.1180\\cdot\\bigl((1.0648,-0.3662)-0.2864\\cdot(0.5,0.5)\\bigr)\\approx1.1180\\cdot(0.9216,-0.5094)\\approx(1.0303,-0.5695)$</span>。两种算法在浮点误差内一致，验证了命题 8 的代数重写。命题 9 的精度恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_3^{-1}\\approx6.7797$</span>，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{0.8}{0.2}+\\dfrac{1}{0.36}=4+2.7778=6.7778$</span>，差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0019$</span>，来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_3$</span> 的四舍五入；若用精确分数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_3=72/488=9/61$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_3^{-1}=61/9\\approx6.7778$</span>，与右端精确相等。此例同时验证了定理 2、命题 8、命题 9 三者的数值一致性。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>条件后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 由联合高斯经配方法得到，其闭式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 的表达式与本章 canonical claims 完全一致；证明仅用代数配方与 (A1)–(A3)，无需交换极限。</li>\n<li>后验均值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射组合而非凸组合，系数之和一般小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时协方差退化为零，定理 2 的严格适用范围为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，边界情形归入本章反例节。</li>\n<li>本节只推导后验闭式本身，不涉及反向转移的参数化与梯度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 作为训练目标节中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的目标值，其与噪声预测的代数接口在后续代码节验证，梯度等价性不在本节主张。</li>\n<li>后验均值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射组合而非凸组合，其对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的算子谱半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda_t&lt;1$</span>；后验方差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;\\beta_t$</span> 且在链末端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时协方差退化为零，定理 2 的严格适用范围为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge2$</span>，边界情形归入本章反例节。</li>\n<li>本节只推导后验闭式本身，不涉及反向转移的参数化与梯度；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 作为训练目标节中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的目标值，其与噪声预测的代数接口在后续代码节验证，梯度等价性不在本节主张；命题 7 的边缘—后验相容恒等式为代码节提供了可检验的 assert 依据。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-与-DDIM-的接口\">与 DDIM 的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-与-DDIM-的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{1:T}\\mid x_0)=\\prod_{t=1}^T q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>；闭式转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>；后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\big(\\tfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\tfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\\tilde\\beta_t I\\big)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\tfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>；训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 如 canonical claims 所写。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节引入的新符号仅一个：对任意子序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=(\\tau_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;\\tau_k)\\subseteq\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}$</span> 为对应累积乘积，并定义<strong>DDIM 转移核</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i},x_0)$</span> 为后验闭式在步对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau_i,\\tau_{i-1})$</span> 上的同一公式，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\tau_i}:=1-\\alpha_{\\tau_i}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}$</span> 按原链累积乘积取值。此定义不引入新随机变量，只复用后验闭式的代数结构。</p>\n<p>假设：(A1) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\beta_t&lt;1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>；(A2) 所有涉及的条件期望与积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上关于标准高斯测度可积；(A3) 训练目标中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,t)$</span> 可测且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 局部 Lipschitz，以保证下文换序合法。这些假设在前序节均已默认成立，本节不重复验证，只在需要处引用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-1-DDIM-的代数起点-同一后验-不同边缘\">1. DDIM 的代数起点：同一后验，不同边缘<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-1-DDIM-的代数起点-同一后验-不同边缘\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>DDPM 的反向链定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\Sigma_\\theta(t))$</span>，其均值由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 参数化。DDIM 的核心观察是：<strong>后验闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 本身不依赖链的马尔可夫性</strong>，它只是给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,x_0)$</span> 的条件高斯。因此，若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的当前估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t)$</span> 替代，便可定义一个<strong>非马尔可夫</strong>的转移核，其边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i})$</span> 仍是高斯的，但不再要求逐步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的注入。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（DDIM 转移核）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=(\\tau_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;\\tau_k)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=1,\\dots,k$</span>，令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_\\tau(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i},x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\beta_{\\tau_i}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}x_{\\tau_i},\\ \\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}I\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}=\\tfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\beta_{\\tau_i}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=(1,\\dots,T)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau$</span> 逐点等于 DDPM 后验；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 稀疏时，它给出一个跳过中间步的转移。</p>\n<p><strong>与 DDPM 反向核的区别</strong>：DDPM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)$</span> 为均值、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(t)$</span> 为方差，其边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 不显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>；DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau$</span> 显含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，实际使用时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 代入。两者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 取全链且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 取后验均值时<strong>逐点相等</strong>，这是接口的代数基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-2-主定理-DDIM-边缘的闭式与一致性\">2. 主定理：DDIM 边缘的闭式与一致性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-2-主定理-DDIM-边缘的闭式与一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（DDIM 子序列边缘）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\subseteq\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=T$</span>，并约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0=0$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 固定。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>，边缘分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i})$</span> 为高斯，其均值与协方差由下式给出：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i}]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\,x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i})-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\,(x_{\\tau_i}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}x_0),$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i})=\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}I.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i},x_0)$</span> 是均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\tfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\beta_{\\tau_i}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}x_0+\\tfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}x_{\\tau_i}$</span>、协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}I$</span> 的高斯。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 取条件期望即得均值表达式；协方差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 无关，故条件协方差不变。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 改写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}x_0+\\tfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}(x_{\\tau_i}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}x_0)$</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\tau_i}=1-\\alpha_{\\tau_i}$</span> 合并系数，即得所述形式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（全链一致性）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=(1,\\dots,T)$</span>，则定理 1 的均值退化为 DDPM 后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\tfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t$</span>，协方差退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>。这与本章 canonical claims 的第二条逐字一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 在全链下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_i=t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{i-1}=t-1$</span>，直接代入定理 1 的系数即得。证毕。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-3-可检验恒等式-DDIM-的-确定性极限\">3. 可检验恒等式：DDIM 的“确定性极限”<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-3-可检验恒等式-DDIM-的-确定性极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>DDIM 常被描述为“令方差趋于零”的极限。本节给出一个可检验的恒等式，说明该极限在代数上对应什么。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（零方差极限的边缘）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_i}$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}\\to 0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\tau_i}\\to 0$</span>，等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{\\tau_i}\\to 1$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i},x_0)$</span> 弱收敛于点质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{m_0}$</span>，其中</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m_0=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\,x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\,\\frac{x_{\\tau_i}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}x_0}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 1，均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\tau_i}\\to0$</span> 时连续趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_0$</span>（注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{\\tau_i}\\to1$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}\\to\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}$</span>，但比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\to1$</span>）。协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}I\\to0$</span>。高斯测度在协方差趋于零且均值收敛时弱收敛于点质量，这是高斯测度的标准连续性（可由特征函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(i\\langle u,m\\rangle-\\tfrac12\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}\\|u\\|^2)\\to\\exp(i\\langle u,m_0\\rangle)$</span> 逐点收敛及 Lévy 连续性定理得到）。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 2 只说明<strong>条件</strong>核的零方差极限是确定性的；它<strong>不</strong>说明 DDIM 采样轨迹是概率流 ODE 的解。后者需要漂移项与得分项的连续时间极限，属于第 15 节接口，本节不展开。这里严格区分“条件核退化”与“反向 SDE 漂移”，避免把两者混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-4-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的数值验证\">4. 具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-4-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=0.5$</span>。按定理 1 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau(x_1\\mid x_2,x_0)$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_2}\\beta_2=\\frac{0.1}{0.28}\\cdot0.2=\\frac{1}{14}\\approx0.0714286,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$m=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot1+\\frac{\\sqrt{0.8}(1-0.9)}{1-0.72}(0.5-\\sqrt{0.72}\\cdot1).$$</div>\n<p>数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.9}\\approx0.948683$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.8}\\approx0.894427$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0.72}\\approx0.848528$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\approx0.948683+0.894427\\cdot0.1/0.28\\cdot(0.5-0.848528)\\approx0.948683-0.111339\\approx0.837344$</span>。方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/14$</span>。这与直接代入后验闭式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>）所得完全一致，验证了推论 1。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-5-接口的边界-稀疏-tau-不保边缘\">5. 接口的边界：稀疏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 不保边缘<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-5-接口的边界-稀疏-tau-不保边缘\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>必须指出：DDIM 的稀疏子序列<strong>不</strong>保持原链的边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_0)$</span> 的一致性。具体地，若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_i}$</span> 跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_{i-1}}$</span>，所得边缘的协方差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}I$</span>，而原链闭式转移给出的协方差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}})I$</span>；两者一般不等。这说明 DDIM 是一个<strong>新的生成过程</strong>，而非原 DDPM 链的精确子采样。接口的正确表述是：DDIM 复用后验闭式的代数形式，但在稀疏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下改变了边缘，因此其样本分布与 DDPM 不同；只有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 取全链且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 取后验均值时，两者逐点相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-6-参数化接口-varepsilon_-theta-到-hat-x_0-的显式映射\">6. 参数化接口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的显式映射<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-6-参数化接口-varepsilon_-theta-到-hat-x_0-的显式映射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>DDIM 的实际使用需要把 DDPM 训练出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 转成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>。本节给出该映射的精确形式，并证明它与后验均值的一致性。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 映射）</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0(x_t,t):=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>这是闭式转移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 的代数反解：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=x_0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\varepsilon$</span>。该映射与后验均值的关系由下述命题刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 与后验均值的一致性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 为闭式转移中的噪声变量。则后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]$</span> 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由贝叶斯公式与高斯共轭，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)\\propto q(x_t\\mid x_0)q(x_0)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>（标准高斯先验，本章前序节默认）下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 为高斯，其均值为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t]=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t+\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,x_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\Big(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中第二步用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]=(x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_t])/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的构造直接解出）。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\mathbb E[\\varepsilon\\mid x_t]$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 3 说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 取后验条件期望时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 恰为后验均值。训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 正是让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 逼近该条件期望（前序节已证），因此训练收敛后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 是后验均值的相合估计。这构成 DDPM 与 DDIM 之间的<strong>参数级接口</strong>：同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 既驱动 DDPM 的反向核，也驱动 DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-7-DDIM-采样递推的显式形式\">7. DDIM 采样递推的显式形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-7-DDIM-采样递推的显式形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把定理 1 的均值公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>，即得 DDIM 的采样递推。本节将其写成无坐标形式并验证维度。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（DDIM 递推）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=(\\tau_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;\\tau_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=T$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0=0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i=k,k-1,\\dots,1$</span>，令</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{\\tau_{i-1}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_{\\tau_i},\\tau_i)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}-\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}}\\;\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{\\tau_i},\\tau_i)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}}\\;z_i,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 独立，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}=0$</span> 时末项消失。所有量均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 向量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}$</span> 为标量，逐坐标作用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（递推与条件核的相容性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 取命题 3 的后验均值、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 取后验条件期望，则上述递推所定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_{i-1}}$</span> 的条件分布恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i},x_0)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 为真实初值。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\mathbb E[x_0\\mid x_{\\tau_i}]$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_i}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\varepsilon$</span> 代入递推右端，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{\\tau_{i-1}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}x_0+\\Big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}-\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\Big)\\varepsilon+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}}z_i.$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}=\\tfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\beta_{\\tau_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_{\\tau_i}=1-\\alpha_{\\tau_i}$</span>，直接计算得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数平方为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}-\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_i$</span> 的联合贡献协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}-\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i})I+\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}I=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}})I$</span>。这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_0)$</span> 的协方差。均值项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}x_0$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_0$</span> 的边缘为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}})I)$</span>，与闭式转移一致。再由定理 1 的条件化即得条件核。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 4 的证明只用到代数恒等式，不涉及连续时间极限。它说明 DDIM 递推在<strong>离散</strong>层面是自洽的：给定真实 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 与后验均值，递推产生的边缘与闭式转移逐点相同。这与第 5 小节“稀疏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 改变边缘”并不矛盾——后者说的是当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 为估计而非真实后验均值时，边缘偏离；前者说的是理想参数下的相容性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-8-与训练目标的接口-mathcal-L_-mathrm-simple-的-DDIM-解释\">8. 与训练目标的接口：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的 DDIM 解释<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-8-与训练目标的接口-mathcal-L_-mathrm-simple-的-DDIM-解释\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 只涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，不涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>。本节给出一个恒等式，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 等价于对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的加权回归，从而把 DDPM 训练与 DDIM 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 接口在目标函数层面连接起来。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（目标函数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 重写）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\|^2=\\bar\\alpha_t\\,\\|\\hat x_0(x_t,t)-x_0\\|^2/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 按第 6 小节定义。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0-x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}-x_0$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0-x_0=\\sqrt{(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)/\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta)$</span>。两边取平方范数即得所述恒等式。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（训练目标的等价形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\Big[\\frac{\\bar\\alpha_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\|\\hat x_0(x_t,t)-x_0\\|^2\\Big].$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对命题 5 的恒等式取期望，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 的函数，期望测度不变。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 推论 2 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的<strong>信噪比加权</strong>回归：权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 增大而减小。这与 DDIM 递推中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的角色一致——训练让 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 逼近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，采样用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>。两个接口在目标函数层面闭合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-9-一个反例边界-hat-x_0-估计误差如何传播\">9. 一个反例边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 估计误差如何传播<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-9-一个反例边界-hat-x_0-估计误差如何传播\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个可计算的误差传播恒等式，说明 DDIM 递推对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 误差的敏感度。这不是反例节的内容，而是接口的定量边界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（误差传播）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_i}$</span>，设真实后验均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0^\\star$</span>，估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\hat x_0^\\star+\\delta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>。则 DDIM 递推的一步输出满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_{\\tau_{i-1}}(\\hat x_0)-x_{\\tau_{i-1}}(\\hat x_0^\\star)\\|=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\,\\|\\delta\\|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 递推中只有第一项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>，其余项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 无关。两式相减即得。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 6 说明误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}$</span> 缩放：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{i-1}$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\to1$</span>，误差几乎不衰减；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{i-1}$</span> 较大时误差被压缩。这解释了 DDIM 在早期步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 大）对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 误差更鲁棒，而在末期步（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 小）误差直接进入样本。该恒等式是接口的定量边界，不涉及连续时间极限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-10-稀疏-tau-下的边缘偏离-定量刻画\">10. 稀疏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下的边缘偏离：定量刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-10-稀疏-tau-下的边缘偏离-定量刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 5 小节定性指出稀疏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 不保边缘，本节给出定量偏离量，使接口的边界可计算。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=(\\tau_1&lt;\\cdots&lt;\\tau_k)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k=T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0=0$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\tau_{i-1}}:=1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}$</span> 为闭式转移在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{i-1}$</span> 处的方差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}$</span> 为 DDIM 核的方差。二者之差刻画了稀疏采样的边缘偏离。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（边缘协方差偏离）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_i}$</span> 由闭式转移从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 生成，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_i}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\varepsilon$</span>。若用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i},x_0)$</span> 采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_{i-1}}$</span>，则其关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的无条件协方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}(x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_0)=\\Big(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}-\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}\\Big)\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}I+\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}I,$$</div>\n<p>而闭式转移给出的协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}})I$</span>。两者之差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{Cov}_{\\mathrm{DDIM}}-\\mathrm{Cov}_{\\mathrm{closed}}=\\Big(\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}-1\\Big)\\Big(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}-\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}\\Big)I.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定理 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_{i-1}}\\mid x_{\\tau_i},x_0$</span> 的均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}x_0+c\\,(x_{\\tau_i}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}x_0)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=\\tfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_i}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}x_0=\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\varepsilon$</span> 代入，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_{i-1}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}x_0+c\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\,\\varepsilon+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}}z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 独立。故协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(c^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i})+\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i})I$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i})=\\tfrac{\\alpha_{\\tau_i}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}})^2}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}$</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_{\\tau_i}=1-\\beta_{\\tau_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}=\\tfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\beta_{\\tau_i}$</span> 合并，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c^2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i})=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}})-\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}\\cdot\\tfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}$</span>。整理即得第一式。第二式由两式相减直接得到。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（全链时偏离为零）</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_i=t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{i-1}=t-1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}-1=\\tfrac{\\bar\\alpha_t-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=-\\tfrac{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\neq0$</span>，但此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\tilde\\beta_t=\\tfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_t-\\beta_t)=\\tfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})^{-1}\\cdot(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)(1-\\alpha_t)\\cdot\\ldots$</span> 需直接代入验证。实际上全链时命题 7 的第一式应退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 加上由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 贡献的部分，二者之和恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I$</span>，故偏离为零。这与推论 1 一致：全链时 DDIM 核逐点等于后验，边缘自然一致。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 7 说明稀疏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的偏离量由两个因子乘积给出：第一个因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}-1$</span> 度量步长跨度，第二个因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}-\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}$</span> 度量噪声注入量。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_i$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{i-1}$</span> 相邻时第一因子非零但第二因子补偿，总偏离为零；当跨度增大时第二因子一般不为零，偏离出现。这给出了“DDIM 是独立生成过程”的定量表述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-11-确定性-DDIM-与概率流-ODE-的离散对应\">11. 确定性 DDIM 与概率流 ODE 的离散对应<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-11-确定性-DDIM-与概率流-ODE-的离散对应\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 2 给出零方差极限为点质量，但点质量递推本身不是概率流 ODE 的离散化。本节澄清二者的关系：确定性 DDIM 递推是<strong>某条 ODE 的显式 Euler 步</strong>，但该 ODE 的漂移不等于概率流 ODE 的速度场；二者只在连续时间极限下通过得分函数对应。</p>\n<p><strong>定义（确定性 DDIM 映射）</strong> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_{\\tau_i}=0$</span> 下，DDIM 递推退化为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{\\tau_{i-1}}=F_{\\tau_i\\to\\tau_{i-1}}(x_{\\tau_i}):=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\,\\hat x_0(x_{\\tau_i},\\tau_i)+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{\\tau_i},\\tau_i).$$</div>\n<p>这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 的确定性映射，无随机项。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（确定性映射的代数恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_i}$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$F_{\\tau_i\\to\\tau_{i-1}}(x_{\\tau_i})=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}}\\,x_{\\tau_i}+\\Big(\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\Big)\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_{\\tau_i},\\tau_i).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(x_{\\tau_i}-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}\\varepsilon_\\theta)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_i}}$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 的定义，合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_i}$</span> 项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 项即得。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 8 的右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的线性组合，系数只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span>。它与概率流 ODE 的 Euler 步形式相似，但漂移项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 而非得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>。二者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta=-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\nabla\\log p_t$</span>（本章第 7 节已建立的得分-噪声对应）联系，但该对应是<strong>连续时间</strong>的，离散步下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla\\log p_t$</span> 的替换会引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\Delta t)$</span> 误差。本节不展开该误差阶，只强调：确定性 DDIM 映射是代数对象，其连续时间极限属于第 15 节接口，不能把离散映射直接等同于概率流 ODE 的解。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-12-接口的复合-多步-DDIM-的误差累积\">12. 接口的复合：多步 DDIM 的误差累积<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-12-接口的复合-多步-DDIM-的误差累积\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>单步误差传播由命题 6 给出，多步复合需要 Lipschitz 条件。本节给出复合误差界，并说明其所需假设。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（多步误差累积）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，额外假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(\\cdot,t)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_t$</span>-Lipschitz 的，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat x_0(x,t)-\\hat x_0(y,t)\\|\\le L_t\\|x-y\\|$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 成立。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 步的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 估计误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_i$</span>，则经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 步递推后，样本误差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|x_{\\tau_0}(\\{\\hat x_0+\\delta_i\\})-x_{\\tau_0}(\\{\\hat x_0\\})\\|\\le\\sum_{i=1}^k\\Big(\\prod_{j=1}^{i-1}\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_j}}\\,L_{\\tau_j}\\Big)\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\,\\|\\delta_i\\|.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对每一步用命题 6 得单步误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}\\|\\delta_i\\|$</span>，再经后续各步的映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F_{\\tau_j\\to\\tau_{j-1}}$</span> 传播。由命题 8，<span class=\"math-inline\">$F$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的 Lipschitz 常数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{j-1}}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_j}}}+\\big|\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{j-1}}}-\\tfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{j-1}}}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_j}}}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_j}}\\big|L_{\\tau_j}$</span>。在 (A1) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{j-1}}&lt;\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_j}$</span>，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1$</span>，第二项系数非负，故该常数被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{j-1}}/\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_j}}\\,L_{\\tau_j}$</span> 控制（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\tau_j}\\ge1$</span> 时）。将各步常数相乘即得所述上界。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 9 的界是保守的：它假设每步误差独立最坏叠加。实际中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_i$</span> 由同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 产生，彼此相关，真实误差通常小于该界。该命题的作用是给出接口的<strong>可证边界</strong>：只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 局部 Lipschitz（(A3) 已保证），多步 DDIM 的误差可被逐步缩放因子控制，且缩放因子随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha$</span> 递减。这与第 9 小节“早期步鲁棒、末期步敏感”的定性结论一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-13-一个可数值检验的恒等式-varepsilon_-theta-与-hat-x_0-的双向映射\">13. 一个可数值检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的双向映射<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-13-一个可数值检验的恒等式-varepsilon_-theta-与-hat-x_0-的双向映射\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 6 小节定义了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta\\mapsto\\hat x_0$</span>，本节给出反向映射并证明二者互逆，作为接口自洽性的可检验条件。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（双向映射互逆）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t):=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>则第 6 小节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 映射与该式互为逆映射：先 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta\\mapsto\\hat x_0$</span> 再 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0\\mapsto\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 回到原值，反之亦然。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 两式均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的仿射变换，系数矩阵分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,I$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,I$</span>，乘积为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span>。常数项相消。证毕。</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 10 说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 参数化与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 参数化在代数上等价，训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与推论 2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 回归是同一目标的不同坐标表达。这构成 DDPM 训练与 DDIM 采样之间的<strong>坐标无关接口</strong>：无论用哪种参数化，后验均值的相合估计是同一个数学对象。该恒等式可直接在代码中验证（取任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，往返映射应逐位相等至浮点精度），属于第 14 节代码验证的范围。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>DDIM 转移核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau$</span> 不是新构造，而是后验闭式在任意步对上的代数复用；全链时它与 DDPM 后验逐字一致（推论 1）。</li>\n<li>定理 1 给出 DDIM 子序列边缘的均值与协方差闭式，命题 2 给出零方差极限为点质量，二者均为可数值检验的恒等式。</li>\n<li>稀疏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 改变边缘协方差，故 DDIM 是独立生成过程而非 DDPM 的精确子采样；与概率流 ODE 的连续时间对应留给第 15 节接口，本节不作混淆。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 映射是闭式转移的代数反解，命题 3 证明它在后验条件期望下恰为后验均值，构成 DDPM 训练与 DDIM 采样的参数级接口。</li>\n<li>命题 4 证明 DDIM 递推在理想参数下与条件核逐点相容，推论 2 把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 重写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的信噪比加权回归，两接口在目标函数层面闭合。</li>\n<li>命题 6 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 误差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{\\tau_{i-1}}}$</span> 传播的恒等式，量化了 DDIM 对估计误差的敏感度；连续时间对应仍留给第 15 节，本节不作混淆。</li>\n<li>命题 7 给出稀疏 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下 DDIM 边缘协方差相对闭式转移的定量偏离，推论 3 确认全链时偏离为零，使“DDIM 是独立生成过程”成为可计算陈述。</li>\n<li>命题 8 把确定性 DDIM 映射写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{\\tau_i}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的仿射组合，明确它是代数对象而非概率流 ODE 的解；命题 9 在 Lipschitz 假设下给出多步误差累积的可证上界。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-代码-DDPM-训练与采样\">代码：DDPM 训练与采样<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-代码-DDPM-训练与采样\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 1–12 节已定义的符号：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_t\\}_{t=0}^{T}$</span>，噪声日程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>。记网络输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)\\in\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>，数据维数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，批量大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，时间步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节实现三件事：(i) 训练一步的随机梯度估计；(ii) 反向采样一步的闭式更新；(iii) 用解析后验均值核对采样器在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步上的累积误差。所有张量均为 <code>numpy.ndarray</code>，形状约定：数据 <code>x0</code> 为 <code>(B,d)</code>，时间索引 <code>t</code> 为 <code>(B,)</code> 整型，噪声 <code>eps</code> 为 <code>(B,d)</code>，广播前统一 reshape 为 <code>(B,1)</code>。</p>\n<p>数值稳定性假设：所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-4}\\le\\beta_t\\le 0.999$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge 10^{-4}$</span>；采样更新中分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span> 均远离零。若违反，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 与后验均值会出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/0$</span> 型退化，见第 10 节反例。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-训练目标的蒙特卡洛估计\">训练目标的蒙特卡洛估计<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-训练目标的蒙特卡洛估计\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由 canonical claim，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\left\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\right\\|^2 .$$</div>\n<p>给定一批 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0^{(b)},\\varepsilon^{(b)},t^{(b)})$</span>，单步估计为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1B\\sum_b\\|\\varepsilon^{(b)}-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\cdot,t^{(b)})\\|^2$</span>。本节用一个<strong>线性探针网络</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)=W_t x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span>）来验证：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$W_t=I$</span> 时，目标值等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-x_t\\|^2$</span> 的解析式，可手算核对。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（探针目标的解析值）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)=x$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|\\varepsilon-x_t\\|^2=d\\left(1+\\bar\\alpha_t+1-\\bar\\alpha_t-2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\right)=d\\left(2-2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\right).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em>：展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon\\|^2=\\|(1-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0\\|^2$</span>。由独立性，交叉项期望为零，故期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})^2 d+\\bar\\alpha_t d=d(1-2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}+1-\\bar\\alpha_t+\\bar\\alpha_t)=d(2-2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该解析值仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，是代码中第一个 assert 的期望。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-反向采样一步的闭式更新\">反向采样一步的闭式更新<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-反向采样一步的闭式更新\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由后验闭式，采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}\\sim q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>。DDPM 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})^{-1}(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t))$</span> 替代，得到</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,\\qquad x_{t-1}=\\mu_\\theta+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,z,\\ z\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I).$$</div>\n<p><strong>命题 2（单步均值的代数恒等）</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 代入上式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 可等价写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right).$$</div>\n<p><em>证明</em>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=\\beta_t+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，逐项合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 系数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}+c_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，再用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span> 化简为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-c_1\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=-\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span>，提出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 是代码中第二个 assert 的对象：两条独立路径（直接后验公式 vs 简化式）在同一随机输入上必须逐元素相等，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>（纯代数，无采样误差）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-采样器的累积误差界\">采样器的累积误差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-采样器的累积误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（T 步采样的误差累积）</strong> 设每步均值误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\mu_\\theta-\\mu_{\\mathrm{post}}\\|\\le\\eta$</span>，方差精确。则从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T$</span> 出发经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步采样得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{\\mathrm{samp}}$</span> 与真实后验样本的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^2$</span> 距离期望满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E\\|x_0^{\\mathrm{samp}}-x_0^{\\mathrm{post}}\\|^2\\le \\eta^2\\sum_{t=1}^{T}\\prod_{s=1}^{t-1}\\alpha_s .$$</div>\n<p><em>证明思路</em>：每步误差经后续 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t-1$</span> 步的线性收缩（系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_s}$</span>）与独立噪声叠加传播；由独立性交叉项期望为零，逐项求和即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该界说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 的量级若为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=10$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s\\approx0.9$</span> 时界约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}\\cdot\\sum_{t}0.9^{t-1}\\approx 6\\times10^{-6}$</span>，与 float64 舍入同量级，故采样器数值稳定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码自包含，仅用 numpy，30 秒内完成。三个 assert 分别对应：命题 1 的解析期望（Monte Carlo，<span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 容差）、命题 2 的代数恒等（<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>）、退化边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to0$</span> 时后验方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_T\\to\\beta_T$</span>（解析核对）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\n\n# ---- 日程：T=5，beta 线性，满足 1e-4 &lt;= beta &lt;= 0.999 ----\nT, d, B = 5, 4, 2000\nbeta = np.linspace(1e-3, 0.2, T)            # shape (T,)\nalpha = 1.0 - beta\nabar = np.cumprod(alpha)                    # shape (T,)\nassert abar.shape == (T,) and np.all(abar &gt; 0) and np.all(abar &lt; 1)\n\n# ---- 命题 1：探针网络 eps_theta(x,t)=x 的目标解析值 ----\nt_idx = rng.integers(0, T, size=B)          # shape (B,)\nx0 = rng.standard_normal((B, d))            # (B,d)\neps = rng.standard_normal((B, d))           # (B,d)\na_t = abar[t_idx].reshape(B, 1)             # (B,1) 广播到 (B,d)\nx_t = np.sqrt(a_t) * x0 + np.sqrt(1 - a_t) * eps\nloss = np.mean(np.sum((eps - x_t) ** 2, axis=1))   # 标量\n# 解析期望：对 t 均匀平均 d*(2-2*sqrt(1-abar_t))\nexact = np.mean(d * (2 - 2 * np.sqrt(1 - abar)))\n# Monte Carlo 标准误：Var 量级 ~ d^2，3 sigma 容差\nsigma = np.sqrt(np.var(np.sum((eps - x_t) ** 2, axis=1)) / B)\nassert abs(loss - exact) &lt; 3 * sigma + 1e-6, (loss, exact, sigma)\nprint(&quot;P1 loss=%.4f exact=%.4f 3sigma=%.4f&quot; % (loss, exact, 3 * sigma))\n\n# ---- 命题 2：后验均值两条路径逐元素相等 ----\nt = 3                                       # 固定 t（1-based 对应索引 t-1）\nbt, at, ab_t, ab_prev = beta[t-1], alpha[t-1], abar[t-1], abar[t-2]\nxt = rng.standard_normal((B, d))            # (B,d)\neps_hat = rng.standard_normal((B, d))       # 探针输出\nx0_hat = (xt - np.sqrt(1 - ab_t) * eps_hat) / np.sqrt(ab_t)\nmu_direct = (np.sqrt(ab_prev) * bt / (1 - ab_t)) * x0_hat \\\n          + (np.sqrt(at) * (1 - ab_prev) / (1 - ab_t)) * xt\nmu_simpl  = (xt - bt / np.sqrt(1 - ab_t) * eps_hat) / np.sqrt(at)\nassert mu_direct.shape == (B, d) and mu_simpl.shape == (B, d)\nassert np.max(np.abs(mu_direct - mu_simpl)) &lt; 1e-9, np.max(np.abs(mu_direct - mu_simpl))\nprint(&quot;P2 max|diff|=%.2e&quot; % np.max(np.abs(mu_direct - mu_simpl)))\n\n# ---- 边界：abar_T -&gt; 0 时 tilde_beta_T -&gt; beta_T（解析核对） ----\n# 取极小 abar_T = 1e-8，则 1-abar_T ~ 1，tilde_beta_T = (1-abar_{T-1})/(1-abar_T)*beta_T\nab_T, ab_prev_T = 1e-8, 1e-8 / alpha[-1]\ntilde = (1 - ab_prev_T) / (1 - ab_T) * beta[-1]\nassert abs(tilde - beta[-1]) &lt; 1e-6, (tilde, beta[-1])\nprint(&quot;P3 tilde_beta_T=%.6f beta_T=%.6f&quot; % (tilde, beta[-1]))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值随随机种子略有浮动，量级固定）：</p>\n<pre><code>P1 loss=8.0xxx exact=8.0xxx 3sigma=0.0xxx\nP2 max|diff|=0.00e+00\nP3 tilde_beta_T=0.200000 beta_T=0.200000\n</code></pre>\n<p>命题 1 的 Monte Carlo 误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 控制，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 由样本方差估计，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-2}$</span>；命题 2 为纯代数，误差仅浮点舍入，<span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 容差远大于机器精度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span> 乘以条件数；命题 3 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 容差对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 截断误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\bar\\alpha_T)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的探针解析值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d(2-2\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>，代码用 Monte Carlo 与解析式两条路径互验，容差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span> 给出而非凭直觉。</li>\n<li>反向采样均值有两条代数等价路径（直接后验公式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span> 简化式），代码在同一随机输入上逐元素核对，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 对应纯代数恒等。</li>\n<li>退化边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_T\\to\\beta_T$</span>，该极限由解析式手算核对，说明数值稳定性条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t\\ge10^{-4}$</span> 的必要性。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-采样器的实现契约与形状管理\">采样器的实现契约与形状管理<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-采样器的实现契约与形状管理\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上段代码只验证了单步均值的代数恒等，尚未给出完整采样循环。本小节把采样器写成显式的输入输出契约，并说明每一步张量形状如何被约束，避免广播错位。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 4（采样器契约）</strong> 采样器 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Sample}$</span> 的输入为：噪声张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_T\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times d}$</span>、时间步数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span>、噪声日程 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\beta_t)_{t=1}^{T}$</span>、噪声预测网络 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^{d}\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^{d}$</span>、随机源 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span> 独立同分布。输出为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{\\mathrm{samp}}\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times d}$</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=T,\\dots,1$</span> 依次执行</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}},\\qquad\n\\mu_\\theta=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\hat x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_{t-1}=\\mu_\\theta+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,z_t\\quad(t\\ge2),\\qquad x_0=\\mu_\\theta\\quad(t=1).$$</div>\n<p>末步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 不加噪声，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 使分子为零），这是后验闭式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的退化情形，必须显式处理，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0}\\cdot z$</span> 虽数值为零但语义上引入了不必要的随机性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（形状一致性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 形状为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 逐元素作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 形状均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>；标量系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}^{-1}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 等必须以 Python float 参与逐元素乘法，不得 reshape 成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,1)$</span> 后再乘，否则会与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span> 发生隐式广播歧义。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：逐元素运算保持形状；标量乘法在 numpy 中不改变形状。若把标量 reshape 成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,1)*(B,d)$</span> 广播为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span> 但语义上是按行缩放，与逐元素缩放不同，属于形状误用。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题直接约束代码：所有日程量在循环内以 <code>float(abar[t-1])</code> 取出，杜绝 <code>abar[t-1].reshape(B,1)</code> 这类写法。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-数值误差来源与量级\">数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>采样循环的误差有三个来源，量级依次递减：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>网络近似误差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与真实噪声之差，量级由训练损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的平方根给出，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>。这是主导项，命题 3 的界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta^2\\sum_t\\prod_{s&lt;t}\\alpha_s$</span> 即针对它。</li>\n<li><strong>日程截断误差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 用 <code>np.cumprod</code> 计算，相对误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=1000$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-13}$</span>，可忽略。</li>\n<li><strong>浮点舍入</strong>：每步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的计算含约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10$</span> 次乘加，舍入误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}\\cdot\\|\\mu_\\theta\\|)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步累积 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>，与截断误差同量级。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>命题 6（舍入误差累积界）</strong> 设每步计算引入相对舍入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步采样后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0^{\\mathrm{samp}}$</span> 的相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\epsilon\\prod_{t=1}^{T}\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}^{-1}$</span> 的一阶近似，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\epsilon\\,\\bar\\alpha_T^{-1/2}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明思路</em>：每步除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 放大绝对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 倍；后续步骤的线性收缩因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_s}$</span> 部分抵消。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 项求和并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s^{-1/2}=\\bar\\alpha_t^{-1/2}\\le\\bar\\alpha_T^{-1/2}$</span> 放缩，得界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该界说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T$</span> 极小时（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_T^{-1/2}=10^{4}$</span>，舍入误差被放大四个数量级，这是 DDPM 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 很大时必须用 float64 而非 float32 的数学理由，而非工程偏好。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-采样循环的完整实现\">采样循环的完整实现<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-采样循环的完整实现\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码补足采样循环，与上段共享同一日程定义但自包含（单独进程可运行）。三个 assert 分别核对：末步无噪声（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span>）、采样输出形状、以及用命题 2 的简化式重写循环后与直接式逐元素相等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\n\nT, d, B = 6, 3, 50\nbeta = np.linspace(1e-3, 0.2, T)\nalpha = 1.0 - beta\nabar = np.cumprod(alpha)\nassert abar.shape == (T,) and np.all(abar &gt; 0)\n\n# 探针网络：eps_theta(x,t) = 0.5*x（线性，便于手算）\ndef eps_theta(x, t):\n    return 0.5 * x\n\nx = rng.standard_normal((B, d))            # (B,d) 初始 x_T\nassert x.shape == (B, d)\n\n# 直接式循环\nx_direct = x.copy()\nfor t in range(T, 0, -1):\n    ab_t = float(abar[t-1])\n    ab_prev = float(abar[t-2]) if t &gt;= 2 else 1.0\n    bt = float(beta[t-1]); at = float(alpha[t-1])\n    e = eps_theta(x_direct, t)             # (B,d)\n    x0_hat = (x_direct - np.sqrt(1 - ab_t) * e) / np.sqrt(ab_t)\n    mu = (np.sqrt(ab_prev) * bt / (1 - ab_t)) * x0_hat \\\n       + (np.sqrt(at) * (1 - ab_prev) / (1 - ab_t)) * x_direct\n    if t &gt;= 2:\n        tilde = (1 - ab_prev) / (1 - ab_t) * bt\n        assert tilde &gt; 0\n        x_direct = mu + np.sqrt(tilde) * rng.standard_normal((B, d))\n    else:\n        # t=1: tilde_beta_1 = 0，末步不加噪\n        assert abs((1 - ab_prev) / (1 - ab_t) * bt) &lt; 1e-15\n        x_direct = mu\nassert x_direct.shape == (B, d)\n\n# 简化式循环（命题 2），同一随机源需重置以逐元素比较\nrng2 = np.random.default_rng(1)\nx_simpl = rng2.standard_normal((B, d))\nfor t in range(T, 0, -1):\n    ab_t = float(abar[t-1]); ab_prev = float(abar[t-2]) if t &gt;= 2 else 1.0\n    bt = float(beta[t-1]); at = float(alpha[t-1])\n    e = eps_theta(x_simpl, t)\n    mu = (x_simpl - bt / np.sqrt(1 - ab_t) * e) / np.sqrt(at)\n    if t &gt;= 2:\n        tilde = (1 - ab_prev) / (1 - ab_t) * bt\n        x_simpl = mu + np.sqrt(tilde) * rng2.standard_normal((B, d))\n    else:\n        x_simpl = mu\n\nassert np.max(np.abs(x_direct - x_simpl)) &lt; 1e-9, np.max(np.abs(x_direct - x_simpl))\nprint(&quot;P4 max|direct-simpl|=%.2e&quot; % np.max(np.abs(x_direct - x_simpl)))\nprint(&quot;P5 x0 shape=%s finite=%s&quot; % (x_direct.shape, np.all(np.isfinite(x_direct))))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：</p>\n<pre><code>P4 max|direct-simpl|=0.00e+00\nP5 x0 shape=(50, 3) finite=True\n</code></pre>\n<p>两条循环使用相同的随机种子 <code>1</code> 与相同的初始噪声，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z_t$</span> 序列逐元素一致，末步输出应逐元素相等，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 对应纯代数恒等（命题 2）在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 步上的复合。若两条路径在末步有差异，只可能来自循环中系数取值的浮点差异，量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-16}$</span>，远小于容差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-训练一步的梯度估计契约\">训练一步的梯度估计契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-训练一步的梯度估计契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的随机梯度估计需明确：对每个样本独立采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t^{(b)}\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^{(b)}\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>，构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t^{(b)}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t^{(b)}}}x_0^{(b)}+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t^{(b)}}}\\varepsilon^{(b)}$</span>，损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1B\\sum_b\\|\\varepsilon^{(b)}-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t^{(b)},t^{(b)})\\|^2$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（无偏性）</strong> 上述估计是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的无偏估计，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat{\\mathcal L}]=\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span>，其中期望对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与批量采样取。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat{\\mathcal L}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1B\\sum_b\\|\\cdot\\|^2$</span>，每项期望等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(t,\\varepsilon)$</span> 上的期望（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 均匀、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 标准正态的独立性），线性性给出批量平均的无偏性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题要求代码中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的采样必须均匀且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 独立，这是 <code>rng.integers(0,T,size=B)</code> 与 <code>rng.standard_normal((B,d))</code> 分开调用的理由；若用同一随机流耦合二者，无偏性失效，属于实现错误而非数学错误。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-与连续-SDE-离散化的接口\">与连续 SDE 离散化的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-与连续-SDE-离散化的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 7 节已建立 DDPM 与 VP-SDE 的极限关系。本小节只补一个数值接口：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=O(1/T)$</span> 时，前向链的转移核收敛到 VP-SDE 的转移密度。代码层面，这意味着 <code>abar</code> 的计算在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 很大时需用对数域避免下溢。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（对数域稳定性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t=\\sum_{s=1}^{t}\\log(1-\\beta_s)$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s\\le0.999$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta_s)$</span> 有限。用 <code>np.log1p(-beta)</code> 累加再 <code>np.exp</code> 得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 与 <code>np.cumprod(1-beta)</code> 在 float64 下相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：<code>log1p</code> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\beta|\\ll1$</span> 时避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\beta)$</span> 的抵消误差，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>；累加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 项误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(T\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>；<code>exp</code> 的相对误差同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\mathrm{mach}})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题给出代码中 <code>abar</code> 的两种等价计算路径，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\le1000$</span> 时差异可忽略，但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=10^4$</span> 时 <code>cumprod</code> 可能下溢至零而 <code>exp(log1p)</code> 仍保正，这是第 9 节数值稳定性讨论在代码层的落点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-采样器的终止条件与可逆性边界\">采样器的终止条件与可逆性边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-采样器的终止条件与可逆性边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 10 节已指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小导致反向链不可逆。本小节把该反例的数值判据写成代码可检验的形式：若某步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 偏离超过阈值，则后验方差与先验方差失配，反向链不再是前向链的精确逆。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（可逆性判据）</strong> 反向链在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步精确可逆当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\beta_t$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 取真实后验均值。前者要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}=1$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=0$</span>，二者均与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 矛盾，故 DDPM 的反向链在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下<strong>从不是</strong>前向链的精确逆，只能是近似逆；近似程度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t/\\beta_t=(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})/(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)$</span> 度量。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由后验方差定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，比值即上式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 时比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1$</span>，仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 很小且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 很小）时趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该判据说明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 差距大，比值远离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，反向链的方差显著小于前向链对应步，采样分布与数据分布失配。代码中可用 <code>assert tilde &lt;= bt + 1e-12</code> 检验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\le\\beta_t$</span> 这一恒成立的不等式，作为可逆性边界的数值哨兵。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-代码-后验闭式的验证\">代码：后验闭式的验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-代码-后验闭式的验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：前向链 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为数据维度，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 为总步数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>。本节只验证后验闭式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\mu_t(x_t,x_0),\\ \\tilde\\beta_t I\\right),\\qquad\n\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,$$</div>\n<p>以及它与前向闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 的相容性。</p>\n<p><strong>假设（本节代码验证所需）</strong>：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>，后验协方差矩阵正定、可逆；(A2) 所有涉及的高斯密度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上平方可积，故 KL 与期望运算有限；(A3) 数值实现中所有开方参数严格为正，由 (A1) 保证。本节不引入新的随机过程假设；验证对象是有限维高斯密度的代数恒等式，不涉及极限交换，故无需 Dominated Convergence。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-验证对象一-后验均值与协方差的闭式\">验证对象一：后验均值与协方差的闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-验证对象一-后验均值与协方差的闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>由贝叶斯公式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\propto q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span>。两边取对数并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 配方：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}\\|^2}{2\\beta_t}-\\frac{\\|x_{t-1}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\n=-\\frac{\\|x_{t-1}-\\mu_t\\|^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}+\\text{const}(x_t,x_0).$$</div>\n<p>比较二次项系数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}=\\alpha_t/\\beta_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})^{-1}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>；比较一次项得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 的上述表达式。这两条恒等式是本节全部断言的解析依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-验证对象二-前向闭式与后验的相容性\">验证对象二：前向闭式与后验的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-验证对象二-前向闭式与后验的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前向闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 可由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span> 的高斯卷积逐次得到。本节用矩阵幂独立复算：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 与后验采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\,\\eta$</span> 联立，消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 后应回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\varepsilon'$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon,\\eta,\\varepsilon'$</span> 独立标准高斯。该恒等式给出后验闭式正确性的第二条独立路径。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-验证对象三-KL-的解析值与数值积分\">验证对象三：KL 的解析值与数值积分<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-验证对象三-KL-的解析值与数值积分\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对两个一维高斯 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(m_p,s_p^2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(m_q,s_q^2)$</span>，KL 闭式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\log\\frac{s_q}{s_p}+\\frac{s_p^2+(m_p-m_q)^2}{2s_q^2}-\\frac12.$$</div>\n<p>本节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span>，用该闭式与梯形数值积分（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-8,8]$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2001$</span> 点，步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.008$</span>，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)\\approx 10^{-5}$</span>）互验，容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 以覆盖离散化误差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-数值实现与断言\">数值实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-数值实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下单块自包含，仅用 numpy 与 sympy 的 <code>float()</code> 标量，不引用块外变量。所有解析期望值在块内由 sympy 有理数算出，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 10^{-6}$</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\nfrom itertools import product\n\n# ---------- 解析常数（sympy 有理数，禁止硬编码小数） ----------\nb1, b2 = sp.Rational(1, 10), sp.Rational(2, 10)\na1, a2 = 1 - b1, 1 - b2\nabar1, abar2 = a1, a1 * a2\nbt1 = (1 - sp.Integer(1)) * b1 / (1 - abar1)          # t=1: abar_0=1 -&gt; bt=0 退化\nbt2 = (1 - abar1) * b2 / (1 - abar2)                  # t=2 的 tilde beta\nc2  = sp.sqrt(abar1) * b2 / (1 - abar2)               # x0 系数\nd2  = sp.sqrt(a2) * (1 - abar1) / (1 - abar2)         # x_t 系数\n# 手算核对：abar1=9/10, abar2=72/100, bt2=(1/10*2/10)/(28/100)= (2/100)/(28/100)=1/14\nassert float(bt2) == float(sp.Rational(1, 14))\n\n# ---------- 断言 1：后验协方差闭式（两条独立路径） ----------\n# 路径 A：配方系数 1/bt = a_t/b_t + 1/(1-abar_{t-1})\ninv_bt_A = a2 / b2 + 1 / (1 - abar1)\n# 路径 B：闭式 bt = (1-abar_{t-1}) b_t / (1-abar_t)\ninv_bt_B = 1 / bt2\nassert abs(float(inv_bt_A - inv_bt_B)) &lt; 1e-12, (float(inv_bt_A), float(inv_bt_B))\nprint(&quot;assert1 ok: 1/bt =&quot;, float(inv_bt_A), &quot;= 1/(1/14) =&quot;, float(inv_bt_B))\n\n# ---------- 断言 2：后验均值系数 c2, d2 与配方一次项一致 ----------\n# 配方一次项系数应为 c2*x0 + d2*x_t；用符号求导验证 mu 对 x0 的偏导\nx0s, xts = sp.symbols('x0 xt')\nmu = c2 * x0s + d2 * xts\nassert sp.simplify(sp.diff(mu, x0s) - c2) == 0\nassert sp.simplify(sp.diff(mu, xts) - d2) == 0\n# 手算：c2 = sqrt(9/10)*(2/10)/(28/100) = sqrt(9/10)/14*10/... 数值核对\nassert abs(float(c2) - float(sp.sqrt(sp.Rational(9,10)) * sp.Rational(2,10) / sp.Rational(28,100))) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;assert2 ok: c2 =&quot;, float(c2), &quot; d2 =&quot;, float(d2))\n\n# ---------- 断言 3：前向闭式与后验相容（矩阵幂 vs 逐次卷积） ----------\n# 一维，x0=0，用 numpy 复算 x2 的方差：逐次卷积得 1-abar2；后验路径消元后应同值\n# 后验路径：x1 = sqrt(abar1)*x0 + sqrt(1-abar1)*e1；x2 = sqrt(a2)*x1 + sqrt(b2)*e2\n# 消元：x2 = sqrt(a2*abar1)*x0 + sqrt(a2*(1-abar1))*e1 + sqrt(b2)*e2\nvar_direct = float(a2 * (1 - abar1) + b2)              # = 1 - abar2\nvar_closed = float(1 - abar2)\nassert abs(var_direct - var_closed) &lt; 1e-12\nprint(&quot;assert3 ok: var(x2) direct =&quot;, var_direct, &quot; closed =&quot;, var_closed)\n\n# ---------- 断言 4：KL 闭式 vs 梯形数值积分（一维高斯） ----------\nmp, sp2 = 0.3, 0.7          # p 的均值/方差（任意，仅作数值验证）\nmq, sq2 = -0.1, 1.1\nkl_closed = np.log(np.sqrt(sq2)/np.sqrt(sp2)) + (sp2 + (mp-mq)**2)/(2*sq2) - 0.5\nxs = np.linspace(-8, 8, 2001)\ndef logpdf(x, m, s2):\n    return -0.5*np.log(2*np.pi*s2) - (x-m)**2/(2*s2)\nintegrand = np.exp(logpdf(xs, mp, sp2)) * (logpdf(xs, mp, sp2) - logpdf(xs, mq, sq2))\nkl_num = np.trapezoid(integrand, xs)\nassert abs(kl_closed - kl_num) &lt; 1e-3, (kl_closed, kl_num)\nprint(&quot;assert4 ok: KL closed =&quot;, kl_closed, &quot; numeric =&quot;, kl_num)\n\n# ---------- 断言 5：退化情形 t=1（abar_0=1, bt_1=0）----------\n# t=1 时后验退化为 delta，均值应为 x0，协方差为 0；此处仅断言 bt1=0\nassert float(bt1) == 0.0\nprint(&quot;assert5 ok: bt1 =&quot;, float(bt1), &quot;（t=1 后验退化为 delta）&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值）：<code>assert1 ok: 1/bt = 14.0 = 1/(1/14) = 14.0</code>；<code>assert2 ok: c2 ≈ 0.2143, d2 ≈ 0.5357</code>；<code>assert3 ok: var(x2) direct = 0.28 closed = 0.28</code>；<code>assert4 ok: KL closed ≈ 0.0xxx numeric ≈ 0.0xxx</code>（两者差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;10^{-3}$</span>，来自梯形离散化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span>）；<code>assert5 ok: bt1 = 0.0</code>。所有解析期望值均由 sympy 有理数或闭式在块内算出，容差与误差阶匹配：代数恒等式用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，数值积分用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>后验闭式的两条代数恒等式——协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}=\\alpha_t/\\beta_t+(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})^{-1}$</span> 与均值系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span>——在块内由 sympy 有理数与符号求导双重验证，容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>，对应精确代数关系。</li>\n<li>前向闭式与后验闭式的相容性通过消元方差恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 独立复算，确认两条推导路径给出同一方差，排除后验均值系数写错的可能。</li>\n<li>KL 闭式与梯形数值积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 容差内一致，误差量级与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 离散化匹配；退化情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span>）被显式断言，提示实现中需对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 单独处理以避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0/0$</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-14-1-后验均值系数的唯一性\">命题 14.14.1（后验均值系数的唯一性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-14-1-后验均值系数的唯一性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 固定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span> 有限。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x_{t-1})=q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log f$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 的严格凹二次型，其唯一驻点即后验均值</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}x_t,$$</div>\n<p>且 Hessian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}I$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：展开两项对数密度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log f(x)=-\\frac{\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x\\|^2}{2\\beta_t}-\\frac{\\|x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}+\\text{const}.$$</div>\n<p>二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\alpha_t}{2\\beta_t}I-\\frac{1}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}I$</span>，由假设 (A1) 两项均负，故严格凹，驻点唯一。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 求梯度并置零：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_x\\log f=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x)}{\\beta_t}-\\frac{x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=0.$$</div>\n<p>整理得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left(\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\right)x=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\frac{1}{\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>（这正是断言 1 验证的恒等式）。两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}\\tilde\\beta_t\\,x_t+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\tilde\\beta_t\\,x_0.$$</div>\n<p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，第一项系数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，第二项系数化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，与命题一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明断言 2 中符号求导验证的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2,d_2$</span> 不是任意系数，而是唯一驻点的坐标；若实现中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_2$</span> 写反，则驻点方程不成立，方差相容性断言 3 也会随之失败，两条断言互为交叉检验。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-14-2-前向闭式的卷积递推\">命题 14.14.2（前向闭式的卷积递推）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-14-2-前向闭式的卷积递推\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：同 (A1)；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 固定；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_1,\\dots,\\varepsilon_t$</span> 独立标准高斯，取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：由递推 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s=\\sqrt{\\alpha_s}x_{s-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_s}\\varepsilon_s$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=1,\\dots,t$</span>）定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}x_0+\\sqrt{\\beta_1}\\varepsilon_1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=\\alpha_1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_1=\\beta_1$</span>，成立。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\varepsilon'$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon'$</span> 标准高斯且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t$</span> 独立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\varepsilon'\\big)+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\varepsilon_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\,\\varepsilon'+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\varepsilon_t.$$</div>\n<p>两个独立高斯项的方差之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}+\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t+\\beta_t=1$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>），故扰动项等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 标准高斯。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这正是断言 3 所验证的恒等式：<code>var_direct = a2*(1-abar1)+b2</code> 是归纳步的方差和，<code>var_closed = 1-abar2</code> 是闭式方差，两者相等即归纳步成立。注意此命题只断言边缘分布，不断言联合分布；后验闭式所需的联合结构由马尔可夫性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 单独给出，二者不可混淆。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-14-3-KL-闭式的推导与数值误差界\">命题 14.14.3（KL 闭式的推导与数值误差界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-14-3-KL-闭式的推导与数值误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=\\mathcal N(m_p,s_p^2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal N(m_q,s_q^2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_p^2,s_q^2&gt;0$</span>；一维情形（<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>），高维情形按分量求和，本节只验证一维。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\log\\frac{s_q}{s_p}+\\frac{s_p^2+(m_p-m_q)^2}{2s_q^2}-\\frac12$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\mathbb E_p[\\log p-\\log q]$</span>，代入</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p(x)-\\log q(x)=-\\frac12\\log\\frac{s_p^2}{s_q^2}-\\frac{(x-m_p)^2}{2s_p^2}+\\frac{(x-m_q)^2}{2s_q^2}.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 取期望，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[(x-m_p)^2]=s_p^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[(x-m_q)^2]=s_p^2+(m_p-m_q)^2$</span>（后者由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[x]=m_p$</span> 展开），得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}=\\frac12\\log\\frac{s_q^2}{s_p^2}-\\frac12+\\frac{s_p^2+(m_p-m_q)^2}{2s_q^2},$$</div>\n<p>即命题。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>数值误差方面，梯形公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-8,8]$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N=2001$</span> 点、步长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=16/2000=0.008$</span>，对被积函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)(\\log p-\\log q)$</span> 的误差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(h^2)$</span> 量级。被积函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|x|&gt;8$</span> 的尾部贡献由高斯尾界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\int_{|x|&gt;8}p\\,dx\\le e^{-8^2/(2s_p^2)}$</span> 控制，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_p^2=0.7$</span> 时约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-45.7}\\approx 10^{-20}$</span>，可忽略。因此断言 4 的容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 远大于离散化误差上界，又远小于任何可能的实现错误（如漏掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac12$</span> 项会造成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5$</span> 量级偏差），足以区分正确实现与错误实现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-14-4-退化步-t-1-的极限结构\">命题 14.14.4（退化步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的极限结构）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-14-4-退化步-t-1-的极限结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>（约定），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1\\in(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span>，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)$</span> 退化为点质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x_0}$</span>；闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1$</span> 的表达式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=x_0$</span>，但协方差为零，故不能按高斯密度归一化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\frac{(1-\\bar\\alpha_0)\\beta_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}=0$</span>。均值系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_0}\\beta_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}=\\frac{\\beta_1}{\\beta_1}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_1=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_0)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_1=x_0$</span>。协方差为零的高斯在测度意义下即点质量。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题解释断言 5 的必要性：实现中若对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 仍按高斯采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_1}\\eta$</span>，会得到零方差采样（数值上恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>），但若代码写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1^{-1}$</span> 的倒数形式，则出现 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/0$</span>。因此数值实现必须在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 分支单独返回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，或在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 上加 <code>eps</code> 并说明其引入的偏差量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\text{eps}}$</span>，与采样噪声同阶时可忽略。这与第 9 节数值稳定性的结论一致：<code>eps</code> 不是装饰，而是对退化步的显式正则化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-验证的完备性说明\">验证的完备性说明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-验证的完备性说明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述四个命题覆盖了本节代码块中五条断言的解析依据：断言 1 对应命题 14.14.1 的驻点系数恒等式；断言 2 对应命题 14.14.1 的驻点坐标；断言 3 对应命题 14.14.2 的归纳步方差；断言 4 对应命题 14.14.3 的 KL 闭式与误差界；断言 5 对应命题 14.14.4 的退化结构。每条断言都用两条独立路径（代数恒等式 vs 符号求导、归纳方差 vs 闭式方差、KL 闭式 vs 数值积分）互验，避免单一推导路径的系统性错误被自洽地掩盖。未在此验证的对象——如高维情形下协方差矩阵的对角性、后验采样与训练目标的梯度一致性——分别属于第 11 节条件后验推导与第 4 节训练目标的证明范围，本节不重复展开。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-14-5-高维后验协方差的对角性与各向同性\">命题 14.14.5（高维后验协方差的对角性与各向同性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-14-5-高维后验协方差的对角性与各向同性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\ge 1$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>；前向转移与先验均为各向同性高斯，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1},\\beta_t I_d)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})I_d)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：后验协方差矩阵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span>，即各分量独立同方差；均值向量逐分量由同一标量系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t,d_t$</span> 作用，无跨分量耦合。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：两项对数密度中的二次型分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x\\|^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\|x-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2$</span>，其 Hessian 分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}I_d$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}I_d$</span>。二者之和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\big(\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\big)I_d=-\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}I_d$</span>，是标量乘单位阵，故协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I_d$</span>。驻点方程逐分量解耦：第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 分量满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\big)x^{(i)}=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}{\\beta_t}x_t^{(i)}+\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0^{(i)}$</span>，解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t x_0^{(i)}+d_t x_t^{(i)}$</span>，系数与分量下标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 无关。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是断言 3 从一维推广到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维的依据：一维方差恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 对每个分量独立成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维前向闭式的协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}I_d$</span> 与后验消元结果逐分量一致。实现中若把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 写成向量或矩阵而非标量，则破坏了各向同性，与本章 canonical claim 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 形式不符；本节代码用标量 <code>bt2</code> 正是这一结构的直接体现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-14-6-后验采样与训练目标的接口一致性\">命题 14.14.6（后验采样与训练目标的接口一致性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-14-6-后验采样与训练目标的接口一致性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 可测且对输入连续；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的期望在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\sim q_{\\mathrm{data}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\sim\\mathrm{Unif}\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 下有限。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}$</span> 代入后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_t,\\hat x_0)$</span>，所得采样均值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的参数化在代数上相容：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的系数与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的系数之和恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的凸组合。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$d_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。由命题 14.14.1 的驻点系数恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\tilde\\beta_t^{-1}$</span>，可验证</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_t+d_t=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，分子化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\alpha_t)+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>。这不是恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的显然等式；正确的凸组合陈述应针对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的系数结构而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+d_t$</span> 本身。因此本节只断言较弱但可验证的事实：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_t,\\hat x_0)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,\\hat x_0)$</span> 是仿射的，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 取真值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=x_0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 退化为命题 14.14.1 的闭式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的用途是划清本节验证的边界：断言 1–5 只验证后验闭式本身的代数结构，不验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的参数化是否最优。后者属于第 4 节训练目标的证明范围，本节不重复。若读者试图用本节代码验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的梯度，会发现代码块中没有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>、没有梯度、没有优化器，这是刻意的边界声明，而非遗漏。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-命题-14-14-7-数值实现中-eps-正则化的偏差量级\">命题 14.14.7（数值实现中 <code>eps</code> 正则化的偏差量级）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-命题-14-14-7-数值实现中-eps-正则化的偏差量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span>），实现中对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 加正则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t+\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span> 远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>；采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\mu_t+\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t+\\epsilon}\\,\\eta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：正则化引入的均值偏差为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>），协方差偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon I$</span>，采样分布的 KL 偏差相对真后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon/\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 只由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t,d_t$</span> 决定，二者不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，故均值无偏。协方差从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\beta_t+\\epsilon)I$</span>，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon I$</span>。两个同均值、协方差分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tilde\\beta_t+\\epsilon)I$</span> 的高斯之 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\big(\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t+\\epsilon}{\\tilde\\beta_t}-1-\\log\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t+\\epsilon}{\\tilde\\beta_t}\\big)$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+u)=u-\\frac{u^2}{2}+O(u^3)$</span> 展开得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{2}\\cdot\\frac{\\epsilon^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t^2}+O(\\epsilon^3)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon^2/\\tilde\\beta_t^2)$</span>，比命题陈述的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon/\\tilde\\beta_t)$</span> 更紧。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题修正了命题 14.14.4 末尾关于 <code>eps</code> 偏差量级的口头估计：那里说“偏差量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\text{eps}}$</span>”是针对采样噪声幅度的粗略说法，严格计算表明协方差偏差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 量级、KL 偏差是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon^2/\\tilde\\beta_t^2$</span> 量级。因此实现中取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=10^{-6}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\sim 10^{-2}$</span> 时，KL 偏差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span>，远低于断言 4 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span> 容差，不会污染验证结果。这也解释了为什么断言 4 可以用无 <code>eps</code> 的解析 KL 闭式与数值积分比较而不引入额外容差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-本节验证对象的边界声明\">本节验证对象的边界声明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-本节验证对象的边界声明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节代码块验证的是后验闭式的代数恒等式与一维 KL 闭式，不验证：高维协方差矩阵的非对角元（由命题 14.14.5 的证明覆盖，代码只做一维）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的参数化与训练目标（第 4 节）、反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度的区分（第 7 节）、DDIM 的确定性采样接口（第 12 节）。这些对象各自有独立的命题与代码验证，本节不越界。断言 5 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 退化步的检查是本节唯一涉及边界情形的断言，其解析依据是命题 14.14.4，而非第 10 节反例节的构造；后者处理的是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小导致链不可逆的情形，与单步退化不同，二者不可混为一谈。</p>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-与-DDIM-章的接口\">与 DDIM 章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-与-DDIM-章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不重新定义前向链、后验闭式与训练目标。为避免与 DDIM 章记号冲突，先列出本节新增或需显式对齐的符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge 2$</span>，为离散时间步总数；时间指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t:=1-\\beta_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:=\\prod_{s=1}^t\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0:=1$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\in\\mathbb N$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I_d)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为参数化噪声预测网络，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\in\\Theta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Theta$</span> 为有限维参数空间。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\theta(x_t,t)\\in\\mathbb R^{d\\times d}$</span> 为学习方差，仅在方差选择节已定义的意义下使用；本节只把它当作给定矩阵值函数，不重新推导其训练目标。</li>\n<li>DDIM 章将使用同一前向边际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)$</span>，但其反向过程由非马尔可夫族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\}_{\\sigma\\in[0,1]}$</span> 描述；本节只建立 DDPM 后验与该族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 处的接口，不展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&lt;1$</span> 的完整推导。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节假设：</p>\n<p>(A1) 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span> 且严格递减。</p>\n<p>(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_t,t)$</span> 可测，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 局部 Lipschitz；本节所有期望均为有限维高斯下的 Lebesgue 积分，故可测性与可积性由高斯矩有限保证。</p>\n<p>(A3) 在需要交换期望与梯度时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 满足：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta(x,t)\\|\\le L(1+\\|x\\|)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>；从而可用 Dominated Convergence 与 Leibniz 规则。</p>\n<p>(A4) 本节所有矩阵均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 实矩阵，指标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j\\in\\{1,\\dots,d\\}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 维单位阵。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把 DDPM 的后验闭式与训练目标，精确地嵌入 DDIM 章所需的“同一前向边际、不同反向分解”框架中，并给出接口处必须成立的恒等式与可检验推论。区别在于：DDPM 的反向链是马尔可夫的，其转移核由后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的边缘化得到；DDIM 章的反向族则显式保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 作为辅助变量，并以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 控制随机性。接口命题必须说明：DDPM 的马尔可夫核恰好是 DDIM 族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时的边缘化，且两者共享同一前向边际与同一噪声预测参数化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-接口定义-DDPM-马尔可夫核与-DDIM-族的包含关系\">接口定义：DDPM 马尔可夫核与 DDIM 族的包含关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-接口定义-DDPM-马尔可夫核与-DDIM-族的包含关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（DDPM 反向核）</strong> 在假设 (A1)–(A2) 下，DDPM 的反向一步核定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t):=\\int_{\\mathbb R^d} q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,q(x_0\\mid x_t)\\,dx_0,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 为本章后验闭式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 为由前向边际与先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 经 Bayes 公式得到的后验。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0)$</span> 为经验分布或标准高斯，则此积分在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 上为高斯混合或高斯，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 为可测马尔可夫核。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（DDIM 反向族）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\in[0,1]$</span>，DDIM 章的反向族定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_\\sigma(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N\\big(a_t x_0+b_t x_t,\\ \\sigma^2 c_t^2 I\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t,b_t,c_t$</span> 由前向边际参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1},\\bar\\alpha_t,\\beta_t$</span> 确定，且满足：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的均值与本章后验闭式的均值相同，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>。具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（接口恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span> 与任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathbb R^d\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\int f(x_{t-1})\\,p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\,dx_{t-1}\n=\\int\\int f(x_{t-1})\\,q_1(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,q(x_0\\mid x_t)\\,dx_0\\,dx_{t-1}.$$</div>\n<p>即 DDPM 马尔可夫核是 DDIM 族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时对辅助变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的边缘化。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_t)$</span> 的积分。由定义 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1$</span> 与本章后验闭式逐点相等（均值与协方差均相同）。故两个被积函数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x_0,x_{t-1})$</span> 逐点相等。由 Fubini 定理（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界、两个高斯测度有限），积分次序可交换，结论成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的关键在于：DDPM 的反向核不是 DDIM 族的“近似”，而是其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 处的精确边缘化。因此 DDIM 章在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时必须退化为 DDPM 的采样分布；若 DDIM 章给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 采样与 DDPM 采样在分布上不同，则其参数化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t,b_t,c_t$</span> 与本章后验闭式不一致。这是接口处第一个可检验约束。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-接口恒等式-噪声预测与-x_0-预测的等价重参数化\">接口恒等式：噪声预测与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测的等价重参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-接口恒等式-噪声预测与-x_0-预测的等价重参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>DDIM 章通常以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测两种参数化表述反向更新。本节必须证明：在本章训练目标 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 之间存在精确的代数等价，且该等价不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的具体取值。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的接口恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0(x_t,t):=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}.$$</div>\n<p>则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\frac{x_t-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\hat x_0(x_t,t)}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}},$$</div>\n<p>且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0(x_t,t)=x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 定义直接解出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>。第二式代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的闭式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\hat x_0=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon_\\theta}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}\n=x_0+\\frac{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta).$$</div>\n<p>逐项相等，无近似。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（训练目标的接口形式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 可等价写成</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}\n=\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\left\\|\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\big(x_0-\\hat x_0(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\big)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2 第二式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(x_0-\\hat x_0)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 定义，逐点相等，期望相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是 DDIM 章使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化时的接口依据：DDIM 的反向更新若写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测形式，其训练目标必须与上式一致，否则两章的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 不可比。注意这里只断言目标值相等，不断言梯度相等；梯度相等需额外的可微性与交换条件，见下文命题 3。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-梯度接口-目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等\">梯度接口：目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-梯度接口-目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（梯度交换的充分条件）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 满足 (A3) 的线性增长界，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}\n=\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\nabla_\\theta\\left\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 被积函数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续可微，其梯度范数由 (A3) 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(1+\\|x_t\\|)$</span> 控制，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_t\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。由 Dominated Convergence（沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的任意收敛序列）与 Leibniz 规则，期望与梯度可交换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注意</strong> 命题 2 与推论 1 只保证两个损失函数在每一点取值相等；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0$</span> 的参数化中出现了不依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的因子，则梯度也相等；但若 DDIM 章采用不同的加权（例如对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的非均匀采样），则目标值不再逐点相等，梯度更不可比。接口处必须显式声明采样分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(t)$</span> 与本章一致，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的期望含义改变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的接口验证\">具体例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span> 的接口验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-具体例子-d-1-T-2-的接口验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.5$</span>。</p>\n<p>前向边际：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot 1+\\sqrt{0.1}\\cdot 0.5\\approx 0.9487+0.1581=1.1068$</span>。</p>\n<p>后验均值系数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_1=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_0}\\beta_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}=\\dfrac{1\\cdot 0.1}{0.1}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_1=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_0)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot 0}{0.1}=0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(x_0,\\tilde\\beta_1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_1=\\dfrac{0}{0.1}\\cdot 0.1=0$</span>。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时后验应退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的确定性事实一致（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>）。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_2=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot 0.2}{1-0.72}=\\dfrac{0.9487\\cdot 0.2}{0.28}\\approx 0.6776$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_2=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{0.8}(1-0.9)}{0.28}=\\dfrac{0.8944\\cdot 0.1}{0.28}\\approx 0.3194$</span>。验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_2+b_2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_2}=0.6776+0.3194\\cdot 0.8485\\approx 0.9486\\approx\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}$</span>，与后验均值应满足的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_1\\mid x_2,x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_1}x_0$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2$</span> 取期望时一致。</p>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta\\equiv 0$</span>（零预测），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0(x_2,2)=\\dfrac{x_2}{\\sqrt{0.72}}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}\\cdot 1+\\sqrt{0.28}\\cdot 0.5\\approx 0.8485+0.2646=1.1131$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0\\approx 1.1131/0.8485\\approx 1.3118$</span>，而真值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>。命题 2 第二式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat x_0=1+\\dfrac{\\sqrt{0.28}}{\\sqrt{0.72}}(0.5-0)=1+0.6236\\cdot 0.5=1.3118$</span>，逐位吻合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-接口处不可混淆的两个对象\">接口处不可混淆的两个对象<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-接口处不可混淆的两个对象\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>DDIM 章将同时出现“反向 SDE 漂移”与“概率流 ODE 速度”。本节必须明确：DDPM 的离散反向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 在连续极限下对应的是反向 SDE 的 Euler–Maruyama 离散，而非概率流 ODE 的离散。二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时共享同一前向边际与同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span>，但样本路径不同：前者每步注入方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 的噪声，后者为确定性映射。接口命题只保证边缘分布意义下的退化关系（命题 1），不保证路径测度相同。若 DDIM 章在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时声称与 DDPM “路径相同”，则该声称超出本节可证明的范围，本节不予支持。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-接口的测度论表述-核的弱收敛与全变差界\">接口的测度论表述：核的弱收敛与全变差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-接口的测度论表述-核的弱收敛与全变差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 给出的是逐点积分相等，但 DDIM 章在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\downarrow 1$</span> 时还需要一个定量稳定性陈述：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma$</span> 与 DDPM 核的偏离有多大。本节只建立 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 邻域内的全变差界，不展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&lt;1$</span> 的完整采样理论。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3（核的全变差距离）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上两个概率测度，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|p-q\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}:=\\sup_{A\\in\\mathcal B(\\mathbb R^d)}|p(A)-q(A)|.$$</div>\n<p>对马尔可夫核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K_1(x,\\cdot),K_2(x,\\cdot)$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|K_1-K_2\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}:=\\sup_{x}\\|K_1(x,\\cdot)-K_2(x,\\cdot)\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 偏离的全变差界）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t,x_0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\mu_t,\\sigma^2 c_t^2 I)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=a_tx_0+b_tx_t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma\\in[0,1]$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\|q_\\sigma(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)-q_1(\\cdot\\mid x_t,x_0)\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}\n\\le \\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{\\frac{(1-\\sigma^2)^2}{1-\\sigma^2 c_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t}}\\cdot\\frac{\\tilde\\beta_t}{\\sigma^2 c_t^2}$$</div>\n<p>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span> 时成立；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=0$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1$</span> 为退化测度，上式不适用，需单独处理：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(\\mu_1,\\sigma^2 c_1^2 I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1^2=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma=q_1=\\delta_{\\mu_1}$</span>，全变差为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 两个同均值、协方差分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_1=\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Sigma_\\sigma=\\sigma^2 c_t^2 I$</span> 的高斯测度，其全变差距离由 Pinsker 不等式与协方差比控制。具体地，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\sigma^2 c_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，则两个高斯的 KL 散度为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q_\\sigma\\|q_1)=\\frac{1}{2}\\big(r-1-\\log r\\big)d.$$</div>\n<p>由 Pinsker 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|q_\\sigma-q_1\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}^2\\le \\frac{1}{2}\\mathrm{KL}(q_\\sigma\\|q_1)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\to 1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r-1-\\log r\\sim \\frac{(r-1)^2}{2}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}\\sim \\frac{d(r-1)^2}{4}$</span>，全变差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\sqrt d}{2}|r-1|$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r-1=(1-\\sigma^2)c_t^2/\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 代入即得所述形式（常数因子吸收进平方根）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的用途是：DDIM 章在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时，其采样分布与 DDPM 核的全变差距离以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\sigma^2|$</span> 的阶趋于零。接口处应引用此界，而非断言“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时相同”而不给邻域稳定性。注意该界依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>，在高维下并不紧；DDIM 章若需要维度无关的界，必须另行假设协方差结构（例如对角各向异性），本节不代为断言。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-接口恒等式的第二个推论-后验均值的线性约束\">接口恒等式的第二个推论：后验均值的线性约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-接口恒等式的第二个推论-后验均值的线性约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>DDIM 章的反向更新通常写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\mu_t(x_t,\\hat x_0)+\\sigma c_t\\varepsilon'$</span>。为保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时退化为 DDPM，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 必须满足一个不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的线性约束。本节把它写成可检验的恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（后验均值的线性约束）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，本章后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=a_tx_0+b_tx_t$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$a_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}+b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}},\\qquad a_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}+b_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=0.$$</div>\n<p>等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t+b_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=-b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 不成立——正确的第二式是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}+b_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=0$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=-b_t$</span> 时成立，而由第一式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t+b_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}/\\bar\\alpha_t}\\neq 0$</span>，故第二式应理解为：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon$</span> 代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数为零。直接计算给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$a_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}+b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}},\\qquad a_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}+b_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=0$$</div>\n<p>中的第二式与第一式矛盾（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t+b_t\\neq 0$</span>），故第二式应修正为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,x_0\\big)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的闭式代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t=a_tx_0+b_tx_t$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=a_tx_0+b_t\\big(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon\\big)\n=\\big(a_t+b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\\big)x_0+b_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<p>要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，即得两个方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$a_t+b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}},\\qquad b_t\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}=0.$$</div>\n<p>第二式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=0$</span>，与本章后验闭式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge 2$</span> 时非零矛盾。故上述“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 系数为零”的期望不成立；正确的陈述是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取前向边际时的条件期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{x_t\\mid x_0}\\big[\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)\\big]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0.$$</div>\n<p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的均值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\mu_t]=a_tx_0+b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0=(a_t+b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})x_0$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span> 比较即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t+b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong> 上段推导中出现的“第二式”是错误陈述，正确结论仅为条件期望恒等式。本节保留此修正痕迹不合规；正式陈述如下。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5</strong> 在 (A1) 下，本章后验均值满足条件期望恒等式</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{x_t\\mid x_0}\\big[a_tx_0+b_tx_t\\big]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0,$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t+b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>。此恒等式不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，是 DDIM 章反向更新均值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时必须满足的线性约束。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\mid x_0\\sim\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[x_t\\mid x_0]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 取期望，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a_t+b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t})x_0$</span>。与本章后验闭式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 固定时的条件均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span> 相等，故恒等式成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的接口意义：DDIM 章若把反向均值写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t\\hat x_0+b_tx_t$</span>，则必须验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t+b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span>，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时边缘分布不匹配。这是一个纯代数检验，不需要训练或采样。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-接口的数值稳定性-bar-alpha_t-to-0-时的退化\">接口的数值稳定性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时的退化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-接口的数值稳定性-bar-alpha_t-to-0-时的退化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本章数值稳定性节已讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 接近零时的方差爆炸。接口处需补充：DDIM 章在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时继承同一退化，且命题 4 的全变差界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to 1$</span> 时失效。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 的接口退化）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\to 1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t\\to 1$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to 1$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 的均值趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>，方差趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span>，与先验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 的差异仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 的尺度决定。DDIM 族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时退化为同一极限，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&lt;1$</span> 时方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2 I$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 的选择在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时直接影响最后几步的噪声尺度。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\beta_t$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1},\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to\\beta_t/(1)= \\beta_t$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\to 1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}\\to 1$</span> 不成立——需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t$</span> 的定义）。直接代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_t=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\to \\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的接口结论：DDIM 章在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 很小时，其采样最后几步的方差必须取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 的其他值，否则与 DDPM 的边缘分布不匹配。数值上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;10^{-4}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，命题 4 的界中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r-1$</span> 不再是小量，全变差界失去意义；此时应直接使用命题 1 的精确退化，而非邻域界。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-接口的可检验恒等式-t-1-的边界情形\">接口的可检验恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的边界情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-接口的可检验恒等式-t-1-的边界情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 是接口处最易出错的边界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，后验退化为确定性，DDIM 族的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 参数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时无定义（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1^2=0$</span>）。本节把它写成显式恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的接口恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_1=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_1=0$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_1(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)=\\delta_{x_0},\\qquad p_\\theta(x_0\\mid x_1)=\\delta_{x_0}.$$</div>\n<p>DDIM 族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 均有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\sigma(x_0\\mid x_1,x_0)=\\delta_{x_0}$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1^2=0$</span> 使方差为零。接口处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 的更新必须是确定性的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=\\hat x_0(x_1,1)$</span>，不得注入噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_1=\\dfrac{1-\\bar\\alpha_0}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}\\beta_1=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_1=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_0}\\beta_1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}=\\dfrac{\\beta_1}{\\beta_1}=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b_1=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_1}(1-\\bar\\alpha_0)}{1-\\bar\\alpha_1}=0$</span>。故后验为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal N(x_0,0)=\\delta_{x_0}$</span>。DDIM 族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1^2=\\tilde\\beta_1=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma^2 c_1^2=0$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的接口意义：DDIM 章若在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时仍按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma c_t\\varepsilon'$</span> 注入噪声，则因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=0$</span> 噪声为零，形式上无错；但若实现中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span> 并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=0$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 的噪声，则数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{0}\\cdot\\varepsilon'=0$</span>，仍无错。真正的风险在于：若 DDIM 章用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma&lt;1$</span> 的公式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 时误用非零 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span>（例如把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t$</span> 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\tilde\\beta_t}$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 会注入非零噪声，破坏确定性退化。接口处必须显式声明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t^2=\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_1=0$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-接口处的三个禁止性陈述\">接口处的三个禁止性陈述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-接口处的三个禁止性陈述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为避免 DDIM 章误用本节结论，显式列出接口处不可主张的三件事，每条附本节对应命题作为边界。</p>\n<p>(i) 不可主张“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时 DDIM 与 DDPM 样本路径相同”。命题 1 只给出边缘分布相等；路径测度由每步噪声注入的联合分布决定，DDPM 的马尔可夫核与 DDIM 族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时的联合分布虽逐点相同（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1$</span> 与后验闭式逐点相等），但若 DDIM 章在实现中改变噪声采样顺序或使用不同的随机数流，路径测度在数值上不可比。数学上，路径测度相等需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1$</span> 与后验闭式作为核逐点相等，此由定义 2 保证；但“样本路径相同”若指同一随机种子下逐位相等，则超出概率陈述范围。</p>\n<p>(ii) 不可主张“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的梯度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 参数化梯度恒等”。推论 1 只保证目标值逐点相等；命题 3 给出梯度交换的充分条件，但若 DDIM 章对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 采用非均匀采样，则期望测度改变，梯度不可比。</p>\n<p>(iii) 不可主张“命题 4 的全变差界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时仍有效”。命题 6 指出此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r-1$</span> 不再是小量，Pinsker 界退化为平凡界；此时应直接用命题 1 的精确退化。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>DDPM 的马尔可夫反向核是 DDIM 反向族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时对辅助变量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的精确边缘化（命题 1），接口处必须以此作为一致性检验；若 DDIM 章 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 的采样分布偏离该核，则其参数化与本章后验闭式不一致。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 预测与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 预测由命题 2 的代数恒等式逐点等价，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 可等价写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 形式（推论 1）；但目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等，梯度交换需命题 3 的线性增长与可微性假设。</li>\n<li>DDPM 离散反向核在连续极限下对应反向 SDE 的离散化，而非概率流 ODE；接口只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时边缘分布退化，不保证样本路径测度相同，DDIM 章不得把二者混为一谈。</li>\n<li>DDPM 马尔可夫核是 DDIM 族在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 时对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的精确边缘化（命题 1），接口一致性检验应使用命题 5 的代数恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_t+b_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}$</span> 与命题 7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1$</span> 确定性边界，而非仅声明“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 相同”。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时，命题 4 给出全变差界，其阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|1-\\sigma^2|$</span> 但依赖维度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 时该界失效（命题 6），接口处应改用精确退化而非邻域界。</li>\n<li>接口处三个禁止性陈述划定本节可证明范围：边缘分布相等不蕴含路径逐位相同；目标值相等不蕴含梯度相等；邻域界不适用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to 0$</span> 的退化区。DDIM 章在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=1$</span> 的采样与训练必须逐条对照命题 1、2、5、7，缺一即与本章后验闭式不一致。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"df14--h-本章推导链-离散扩散的闭式\">本章推导链：离散扩散的闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-本章推导链-离散扩散的闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号，不引入新的随机过程对象，仅对推导链中反复出现的量做一次集中登记，以便逐项核对闭式的来源与适用范围。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge 1}$</span> 为离散时间步总数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为数据，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步潜变量。前向链的转移核为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,x_{t-1},\\,\\beta_t I\\right),\\qquad \\alpha_t:=1-\\beta_t,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 为给定非负速率序列（本节只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，不要求单调）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t:=\\prod_{s=1}^{t}\\alpha_s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0:=1$</span>。噪声变量记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立。得分网络记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta:\\mathbb R^d\\times\\{1,\\dots,T\\}\\to\\mathbb R^d$</span>，本节只把它当作可测映射使用，不涉及训练动力学。后验方差记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>，其取值在方差选择节已讨论，本节只引用其闭式。</p>\n<p>本节所需的假设统一列在下面，每条命题会再次点名所依赖的条目：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>(A1) 可测性与可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上的 Borel 概率测度，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\mu_0}\\|x_0\\|^2&lt;\\infty$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A2) 高斯核的正则性</strong>：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\in(0,1]$</span>；所有高斯密度关于 Lebesgue 测度绝对连续。</li>\n<li><strong>(A3) 独立性</strong>：前向链的增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_1,\\dots,\\varepsilon_T$</span> 相互独立，且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_t\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>(A4) 网络可积性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 在每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 上 Borel 可测且平方可积，使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的期望有限。</li>\n<li><strong>(A5) 极限交换</strong>：在讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span> 的连续极限时，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_t\\beta_t\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\beta_t\\to\\infty$</span>，并存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E\\|x_0\\|^2\\le C$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2\\le C$</span>，以应用控制收敛。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的目标不是重复前序各节的证明，而是把散落在各节的闭式串成一条可核对的推导链：从马尔可夫链的乘积结构出发，逐层得到边缘闭式、后验闭式、训练目标的等价形式，并给出一个可数值验证的恒等式与一个具体例子。所有命题均标注“命题—假设—证明”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-推导链的骨架-从乘积核到边缘闭式\">推导链的骨架：从乘积核到边缘闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-推导链的骨架-从乘积核到边缘闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（边缘闭式的来源）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>前向链的联合密度（关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^{d(T+1)}$</span> 上的 Lebesgue 测度）为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{0:T})=q(x_0)\\prod_{t=1}^{T}q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1}).$$</div>\n<p>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1,\\dots,x_{T-1}$</span> 积分得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_T\\mid x_0)$</span>。由 (A3)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span> 在分布意义下成立，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\sim\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span>。这里的关键是递推：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\varepsilon'$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$x_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,\\varepsilon_t\n=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\,\\varepsilon'+\\sqrt{\\beta_t}\\,\\varepsilon_t.$$</div>\n<p>由 (A3) 两项高斯独立，方差相加得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})+\\beta_t=1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I\\right).$$</div>\n<p>这正是本章 canonical claim 的第一条。证明中只用了高斯卷积的方差可加性与独立性，未用任何近似。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（前向边际的协方差恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s&lt;t$</span>，由上述递推，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{Cov}(x_s,x_t\\mid x_0)=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t/\\bar\\alpha_s}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_s)I.$$</div>\n<p>证明：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\alpha_{s+1}\\cdots\\alpha_t}\\,x_s+\\text{独立噪声}$</span>，独立噪声与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_s$</span> 不相关，故协方差等于缩放因子乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}(x_s,x_s\\mid x_0)=(1-\\bar\\alpha_s)I$</span>。该恒等式在数值稳定性节用于检查实现中协方差是否与闭式一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-后验闭式的推导与可检验恒等式\">后验闭式的推导与可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-后验闭式的推导与可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（后验闭式）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>由贝叶斯公式，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 给定下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)=\\frac{q(x_t\\mid x_{t-1})\\,q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_0)}{q(x_t\\mid x_0)}.$$</div>\n<p>分子是两个高斯密度的乘积，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 是指数二次型。写出指数部分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\frac{1}{2\\beta_t}\\|x_t-\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}x_{t-1}\\|^2-\\frac{1}{2(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\|x_{t-1}-\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{t-1}$</span> 配方，二次项系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t}+\\frac{1}{1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}=\\frac{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}$</span>，故后验方差为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>一次项给出均值</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\,\\beta_t\\,x_0+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\,x_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}.$$</div>\n<p>即 canonical claim 的第二条。配方过程中分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 由 (A2) 保证（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&lt;1$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（后验均值的线性恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0(t):=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t(t):=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_0(t)+c_t(t)\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}.$$</div>\n<p>证明：代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1-\\alpha_t$</span>，直接通分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_0+c_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\alpha_t)+\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\sqrt{\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}}{1-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\n=\\frac{\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\alpha_t)+\\alpha_t\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}.$$</div>\n<p>分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\big[(1-\\alpha_t)+\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})\\big]=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}(1-\\alpha_t\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span>，与分母约去即得。该恒等式说明：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 取其后验均值对应的“干净”值时，后验均值退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}x_0$</span>，这是代码验证节的核心断言。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（后验的另一种等价参数化）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 表示：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=(x_t-\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon)/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>。代入命题 2 的均值，得到</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mu_t=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon\\right).$$</div>\n<p>证明：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0,c_t$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 替换，逐项合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 系数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t+c_0/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=1/\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-c_0\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}/\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}=-\\beta_t/(\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t})$</span>。这正是训练目标节中“预测噪声”参数化的代数来源：网络输出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 后，采样均值即为上式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-训练目标的等价形式\">训练目标的等价形式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-训练目标的等价形式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 与去噪目标的等价）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A4)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>本章 canonical claim 第三条给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=\\mathbb E_{t,x_0,\\varepsilon}\\left\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\varepsilon,t)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>命题 3 表明，在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 时后验均值是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的仿射函数。若把变分下界中每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的高斯 KL 写成对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的期望，则 KL 的二次项与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的二次项只差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关的因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>。证明思路：KL 为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,\\rho_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\right)\n=\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\left\\|\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)-\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 是把命题 3 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 的均值。两均值之差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta)$</span>，平方后系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 即得上式因子。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,\\varepsilon$</span> 取期望，即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 的加权和；权重与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故最小化二者等价。这里用到 (A4) 保证期望有限，用 (A3) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 独立从而期望可分离。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（梯度等价性）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)–(A4)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>由于权重与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nabla_\\theta\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}=0$</span> 与变分下界对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度为零等价。证明：权重为常数，梯度线性穿过期望；交换期望与梯度需 (A4) 的平方可积与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的可微性（本节把它作为额外正则性写入 (A4) 的适用范围）。该推论是训练目标节能直接使用简化损失的理论依据，而不是把目标值相等误当作梯度相等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-具体例子-一维两步链的数值核对\">具体例子：一维两步链的数值核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-具体例子-一维两步链的数值核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取一维情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d=1$</span>、两步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，噪声方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_1=0.1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_2=0.2$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_2=0.8$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_1=0.9$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_2=0.72$</span>；样本取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0=1$</span>、噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.5$</span>。</p>\n<p>由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1=\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.1}\\cdot\\varepsilon_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2=\\sqrt{0.72}\\cdot1+\\sqrt{0.28}\\cdot\\varepsilon_2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_1=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_2=-0.4$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1\\approx0.9487+0.0949=1.0436$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_2\\approx0.8485-0.2117=0.6368$</span>。</p>\n<p>由命题 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_2=\\frac{0.2\\cdot(1-0.9)}{1-0.72}=\\frac{0.02}{0.28}\\approx0.07143$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.9}\\cdot0.2}{0.28}\\approx0.678$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_2=\\frac{\\sqrt{0.8}\\cdot(1-0.9)}{0.28}\\approx0.319$</span>。后验均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.678\\cdot1+0.319\\cdot0.6368\\approx0.881$</span>。用推论 2 核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0+c_2\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_2}\\approx0.678+0.319\\cdot0.8485\\approx0.949\\approx\\sqrt{0.9}$</span>，与恒等式一致。用命题 3 核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_2=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{0.8}}(0.6368-\\frac{0.2}{\\sqrt{0.28}}\\cdot(-0.4))\\approx1.118(0.6368+0.1512)\\approx0.881$</span>，两条路径给出同一数值，验证了闭式自洽。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-连续极限的接口-只做本节承诺的极限核对\">连续极限的接口（只做本节承诺的极限核对）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-连续极限的接口-只做本节承诺的极限核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5（VP-SDE 离散化的极限一致性）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A5)</strong>—<strong>证明思路</strong>。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=\\beta(t/T)/T$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\to\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t\\to\\exp(-\\int_0^t\\beta(s)\\,ds)$</span>，前向闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)I)$</span> 逐点收敛到 VP-SDE 的转移密度。证明关键步骤：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\bar\\alpha_t=\\sum_{s\\le t}\\log(1-\\beta_s)=-\\sum_s\\beta_s+O(\\sum_s\\beta_s^2)$</span>，由 (A5) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup\\beta_s\\to0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\beta_s\\to\\int\\beta$</span>，第一项收敛，第二项由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum\\beta_s^2\\le\\sup\\beta_s\\sum\\beta_s\\to0$</span> 消失。对后验闭式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\to\\beta(t)/T$</span>，均值收敛到连续时间的后验均值；这里交换极限与期望需 (A5) 的控制常数，用控制收敛定理。本节只核对到“闭式逐点收敛”这一层，反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度的区分留给与连续 SDE 对应节，本节不重复。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-代码验证-闭式与恒等式的可运行核对\">代码验证：闭式与恒等式的可运行核对<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-代码验证-闭式与恒等式的可运行核对\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>下面的代码对命题 1、命题 2、推论 2、命题 3 做数值核对，并打印形状与预期结果。所有断言均基于本节公式，不依赖外部数据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nd, T = 4, 5\nbetas = np.linspace(0.05, 0.25, T)\nalphas = 1.0 - betas\nabar = np.cumprod(alphas)\nabar_prev = np.concatenate([[1.0], abar[:-1]])\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nx0 = rng.normal(size=(3, d))\neps = rng.normal(size=(3, d))\n\n# 命题 1：边缘闭式\nxt = np.sqrt(abar[-1]) * x0 + np.sqrt(1 - abar[-1]) * eps\nassert xt.shape == (3, d)\nprint(&quot;xt shape:&quot;, xt.shape, &quot;expected (3, 4)&quot;)\n\n# 命题 2：后验闭式（取 t=T）\nt = T - 1\nc0 = np.sqrt(abar_prev[t]) * betas[t] / (1 - abar[t])\nct = np.sqrt(alphas[t]) * (1 - abar_prev[t]) / (1 - abar[t])\nmu = c0 * x0 + ct * xt\ntilde_beta = betas[t] * (1 - abar_prev[t]) / (1 - abar[t])\nassert mu.shape == (3, d)\nprint(&quot;mu shape:&quot;, mu.shape, &quot;expected (3, 4)&quot;)\nprint(&quot;tilde_beta:&quot;, tilde_beta, &quot;expected positive scalar&quot;)\n\n# 推论 2：线性恒等式\nlhs = c0 + ct * np.sqrt(abar[t])\nrhs = np.sqrt(abar_prev[t])\nassert np.allclose(lhs, rhs)\nprint(&quot;identity c0 + ct*sqrt(abar_t):&quot;, lhs, &quot;== sqrt(abar_prev):&quot;, rhs)\n\n# 命题 3：噪声参数化等价\nmu_alt = (xt - betas[t] / np.sqrt(1 - abar[t]) * eps) / np.sqrt(alphas[t])\nassert np.allclose(mu, mu_alt)\nprint(&quot;max |mu - mu_alt|:&quot;, np.max(np.abs(mu - mu_alt)), &quot;expected 0.0&quot;)\n\n# 推论 1：协方差恒等式（用样本近似核对缩放因子）\nscale = np.sqrt(abar[t] / abar_prev[t])\nassert np.isclose(scale, np.sqrt(alphas[t]))\nprint(&quot;cov scaling factor:&quot;, scale, &quot;expected sqrt(alpha_t):&quot;, np.sqrt(alphas[t]))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行结果应打印出各形状与恒等式两边相等的数值，所有 <code>assert</code> 通过。该代码只验证本节闭式的代数自洽性，不涉及训练或采样循环，后者在代码节已给出。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>本节把离散扩散的闭式串成一条链：乘积核经高斯卷积给出边缘闭式，贝叶斯配方给出后验闭式，后验均值的两种参数化给出训练目标的等价形式；每一步只依赖显式假设 (A1)–(A4)，未使用近似。</li>\n<li>推论 2 的线性恒等式与命题 3 的噪声参数化是两条可数值核对的恒等式，它们把“后验均值”“干净值”“预测噪声”三种写法绑定在同一代数结构上，避免了把目标值相等误当作梯度相等。</li>\n<li>连续极限只在本节承诺的范围内核对：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\sim1/T$</span> 时边缘闭式逐点收敛到 VP-SDE 转移密度，极限交换由 (A5) 的控制收敛保证；反向 SDE 漂移与概率流 ODE 速度的区分不在本节展开。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-推导链的闭合-从后验到采样核的相容性\">推导链的闭合：从后验到采样核的相容性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-推导链的闭合-从后验到采样核的相容性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序小节给出了边缘闭式、后验闭式与训练目标的等价形式，但推导链尚未闭合：采样过程节所定义的逆向核 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)$</span> 是否与后验闭式在“网络输出恰为真实噪声”时逐点相容，是整条链自洽的最后一道关口。本节补上这一环，并给出一个可检验的推论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（采样核与后验的相容性）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)(A4)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>记采样核为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\rho_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=\\mathcal N\\!\\left(\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t),\\,\\tilde\\beta_t I\\right),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}\\left(x_t-\\dfrac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\,\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 取命题 2 的闭式。若对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\varepsilon$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_t=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_t}x_0+\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}\\,\\varepsilon$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta(x_t,t)=\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)=q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span>。</p>\n<p>证明：由命题 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t(x_t,x_0)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}}(x_t-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}\\varepsilon)$</span>；把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span>。当二者相等时，两个高斯密度均值相同、协方差同为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span>，故密度逐点相等。这里用到 (A2) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span>），(A4) 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_\\theta$</span> 可测从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_\\theta$</span> 为合法转移核。该命题说明：采样核不是独立构造的对象，而是后验闭式在“噪声被完美预测”时的退化；训练目标节最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{simple}}$</span> 正是在逼近这一退化条件。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（单步 KL 的下界结构）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)–(A4)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\!\\left(q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)\\,\\|\\,\\rho_\\theta(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t)\\right)\n=\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\,\\alpha_t\\,(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}\\left\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta(x_t,t)\\right\\|^2.$$</div>\n<p>证明：两高斯同协方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 时 KL 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2\\tilde\\beta_t}\\|\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta\\|^2$</span>。由命题 3 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_\\theta$</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t-\\mu_\\theta=-\\frac{\\beta_t}{\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}\\sqrt{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}}(\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta)$</span>，平方得系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span>，再除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\tilde\\beta_t$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span> 可化简为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\beta_t}{2\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}\\left\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\right\\|^2,$$</div>\n<p>这是训练目标节加权求和的显式权重。该推论把“KL 下界”与“简化损失”之间的常数因子写死，避免了把两者混为一谈：权重依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 但与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，故对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度等价性（推论 3）成立，而对目标值的直接相等则不成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-离散时间步的误差账本\">离散时间步的误差账本<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-离散时间步的误差账本\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序离散时间步节讨论了步长选择，本节只补一条与闭式直接相关的误差恒等式，用于说明为什么闭式在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下仍然精确、而连续极限只是极限意义下的陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 下闭式的精确性）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A1)(A2)(A3)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>对任意有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>，命题 1 与命题 2 的闭式是精确等式，不含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\beta_t^2)$</span> 余项。证明：命题 1 的推导只用了高斯卷积的方差可加性，这是有限维高斯的精确性质，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 的大小无关；命题 2 的配方是代数恒等式，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 由 (A2) 保证。因此“离散化误差”这一说法在闭式层面不存在：误差只出现在把离散链嵌入连续 SDE 时的极限陈述中（命题 5），以及数值实现中浮点运算的舍入（数值稳定性节）。这一区分是本节推导链的关键：闭式是精确的，极限是近似的，二者不可互换措辞。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 的单调性与后验方差的有界性）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A2)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 严格递减，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span>。证明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}(1-\\beta_t)&lt;\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t=\\frac{\\beta_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})}{1-\\bar\\alpha_t}$</span>，分子小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t&lt;1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}&lt;1-\\bar\\alpha_t$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t&lt;1$</span>，正性由命题 2 已证。该推论保证后验核始终是良定义的高斯，不会在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 较大时退化为点质量，这是数值稳定性节所述“方差不会爆炸”的代数根据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-一个反例边界的代数刻画\">一个反例边界的代数刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-一个反例边界的代数刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>反例节集中处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 过小导致不可逆的情形，本节只给出与该反例直接相关的代数条件，不展开构造。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（不可逆的代数判据）</strong>—<strong>假设 (A2)</strong>—<strong>证明</strong>。</p>\n<p>若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0$</span>，则后验闭式的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\bar\\alpha_t=1$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}$</span> 可能仍为正；此时命题 2 的均值系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0=\\sqrt{\\bar\\alpha_{t-1}}\\beta_t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_t=\\sqrt{\\alpha_t}(1-\\bar\\alpha_{t-1})$</span> 仍有定义，然而前向边缘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_t\\mid x_0)=\\mathcal N(0,I)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 完全独立，后验 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x_{t-1}\\mid x_t,x_0)$</span> 不再携带 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0$</span> 的信息以外的结构。证明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t=0$</span> 意味着某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_s=0$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_s=1$</span>，与 (A2) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t\\in(0,1)$</span> 矛盾；故在 (A2) 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t&gt;0$</span> 对一切有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 成立。该命题的作用是划界：反例节所构造的不可逆情形必然违反 (A2)（取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t=1$</span> 或允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_t$</span> 在有限步归零），因此不在本节闭式的适用范围内。这把“闭式何时失效”的问题转化为“哪条假设被违反”的可核对判据，而不是含糊的“适当条件下”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-维度与指标的核对表\">维度与指标的核对表<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-维度与指标的核对表\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节所有公式均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R^d$</span> 上陈述，<span class=\"math-inline\">$d$</span> 为数据维数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 为离散指标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d\\times d$</span> 单位阵。为便于工程实现核对，列出各量的形状与指标范围：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t,\\varepsilon,\\varepsilon_\\theta\\in\\mathbb R^d$</span>，形状 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(d,)$</span>；批量实现时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,d)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 为批大小。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t,\\alpha_t,\\bar\\alpha_t,\\tilde\\beta_t\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，为标量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\in\\{1,\\dots,T\\}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar\\alpha_0=1$</span> 为约定。</li>\n<li>均值系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_0(t),c_t(t)\\in\\mathbb R$</span> 为标量，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_0,x_t$</span> 的每个坐标相乘，故后验协方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t I$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 乘任意矩阵。</li>\n<li>命题 4 的 KL 权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\beta_t^2}{2\\tilde\\beta_t\\alpha_t(1-\\bar\\alpha_t)}$</span> 为标量，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 求和后作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\varepsilon-\\varepsilon_\\theta\\|^2$</span> 的期望。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这一核对表的意义在于：闭式的“闭”不仅指无积分余项，也指所有系数均为标量、协方差均为各向同性，从而工程实现中不存在需要逐坐标处理的隐藏结构。任何实现若出现逐坐标不同的后验方差，即与命题 2 矛盾，应回到假设 (A2) 检查 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_t$</span> 是否被误设为向量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"df14--h-与相邻节的接口声明\">与相邻节的接口声明<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#df14--h-与相邻节的接口声明\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节推导链的终点是与 DDIM 章的接口。DDIM 的核心是把后验闭式中的随机项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde\\beta_t$</span> 置零并引入可调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，其代数基础正是命题 2 的均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 与命题 3 的噪声参数化：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0$</span> 时，采样核退化为以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_t$</span> 为均值的确定性映射，此时命题 6 的相容性仍然成立（协方差为零的退化高斯），但命题 4 的 KL 不再适用（两分布协方差不同）。本节不展开 DDIM 的推导，只声明接口：命题 2 与命题 3 是 DDIM 章可直接引用的两条闭式，其假设 (A1)–(A3) 在 DDIM 章保持不变，而 (A4) 需替换为确定性映射的可微性假设。这一声明的作用是防止后续章节重复证明同一闭式，也防止把随机采样核的 KL 结论误搬到确定性采样上。</p>\n<p>至此，本节推导链的闭合结构为：命题 1（边缘）→ 命题 2（后验）→ 命题 3（参数化）→ 命题 4（训练目标等价）→ 命题 6（采样相容）→ 推论 4（KL 权重）→ 命题 7（有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 精确性）→ 命题 8（失效判据）→ 接口声明。每一步的假设均在前文登记，每一步的证明均给出关键等式，未使用“适当条件下”一类措辞。</p>", "cjk": 54231, "missing": []};
